e0b5df'}, page_content='• Downstream Carrier Operation with DVB-S2 — describes how Velocity downstream carrier operation uses DVB-S2 with Adaptive Coding and Modulation (ACM). ACM enables each terminal to operate at its most efficient coding and modulation at any moment in time, depending on the location within the satellite contour, the antenna size, and atmospheric conditions.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9326595664024353, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(552.069091796875), np.float64(2014.762939453125)), (np.float64(552.069091796875), np.float64(2312.3794531249996)), (np.float64(2626.430369791666), np.float64(2312.3794531249996)), (np.float64(2626.430369791666), np.float64(2014.762939453125))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 38, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'c894e73647900007f3a94f624c654078', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': 'cfc7f27af340f7e8f7687e2ea6e22640'}, page_content='• Upstream TDMA Waveform — describes the Time Division Multiple Access (TDMA) waveform, used on the Velocity inbound channel. The line card demodulator enables the configuration of multiple heterogeneous channels. These channels share a dedicated receiver that is responsible for timing, frequency and phase corrections, using state-of- the-art signal processing.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9278069734573364, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(2357.502685546875)), (np.float64(567.5468749999