 or polarization."), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(557.5304947916666)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(606.1294531250002)), (np.float64(607.6595364583333), np.float64(606.1294531250002)), (np.float64(607.6595364583333), np.float64(557.5304947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 48, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '00518a8bb3c125e1cd77b72c2201cfdc', 'category': 'UncategorizedText', 'element_id': '70d4e69c8d03bce07ea1b5c7532cf69e'}, page_content='•'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9370833039283752, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(579.05859375), np.float64(557.5304947916666)), (np.float64(579.05859375), np.float64(792.0669531250002)), (np.float64(2632.005126953125), np.float64(792.0669531250002)), (np.float64(2632.005126953125), np.float64(557.5304947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 48, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '00518a8bb3c125e1cd77b72c2201cfdc', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '5dadf33fb052537d908ee3bb552478b7'}, page_content='Carrier — A channel consists of a set of carriers. A carrier is a single modulated RF signal or waveform carrying encoded data in one direction. It is 