C, and RF Gateway Components'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9146755337715149, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.70751953125), np.float64(400.7596614583332)), (np.float64(567.70751953125), np.float64(511.3377864583335)), (np.float64(2399.374267578125), np.float64(511.3377864583335)), (np.float64(2399.374267578125), np.float64(400.7596614583332))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 53, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '7dac0a5d8e45060526a9ba5a8d5f2185', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'adfdcdf07a2c69ff324907962180adf5'}, page_content='Gateway site switchover that is triggered either through manual operator action or automatically using the NMS or NMS API.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9405341744422913, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(557.5304947916666)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(792.0669531250002)), (np.float64(2637.331411458333), np.float64(792.0669531250002)), (np.float64(2637.331411458333), np.float64(557.5304947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 53, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '7dac0a5d8e45060526a9ba5a8d5f2185', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '65023a0ffa5bfb40a4a5df64cf900be1'}, page_content='Finally, to support increase of scale and efficiency, this architecture integrates the Intelligent Gateway (iGW) which hosts the PP functions, and the Intelligent Hub and Intelligent Line Cards (iHub and ILCs). Further, downstream packet encapsulation for ILCs is performed on PP/iGW, rather than on the line card.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9248939156532288, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(781.8936157226562), np.float64(878.0411987304688)), (np.float64(781.8936157226562), np.float64(1174.879453125)), (np.float64(2572.070994791666), np.float64(1174.879453125)), (np.float64(2572.070994791666), np.float64(878.0411987304688))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 53, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'a3323ad81e15f8280c25e6b42f3a0cda'}, page_content='NOTE: The CDC switch and router are expected to support jumbo frames and an MTU of 9000 without duplication. Furthermore, all components are expected to be connected to the CDC switch using 10GigE ports, must support jumbo frames and with the exception of the WAN link, are expected to support an MTU of 9000 without fragmentation.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9127869606018066, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.6302490234375), np.float64(1303.0304947916666)), (np.float64(568.6302490234375), np.float64(1366.2127864583333)), (np.float64(2023.5343017578125), np.float64(1366.2127864583333)), (np.float64(2023.5343017578125), 