ctory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'ec2c288b2a24616ad714f80b6e5dced3', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': 'a50ef9f042eea722932bde6f1c991455'}, page_content='• Satellite Router (also called modem) — The satellite router is the processing and modem component of the terminal. It provides connectivity to the SAS at the satellite link, virtual local area network (VLAN), and IP layers in order to forward IP packets, enabling applications such as voice-over-IP (VoIP), video, and data. The satellite router also directs the operation of other terminal components, including the ACU, BUC, and LNB.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9134007096290588, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(589.4473876953125), np.float64(2513.7021484375)), (np.float64(589.4473876953125), np.float64(2630.654052734375)), (np.float64(2479.67626953125), np.float64(2630.654052734375)), (np.float64(2479.67626953125), np.float64(2513.7021484375))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 57, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'ec2c288b2a24616ad714f80b6e5dced3', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': 'ea461955e3ca14af7cbeae71a106ab28'}, page_content='BUC (Block Up-Converter) — The BUC is used for uplink satellite transmission and amplification, converting a band from a lower frequency to a higher frequency.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(2518.9888281249996)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(2567.5877864583335)), (np.float64(607.6595364583333), np.float64(2567.5877864583335)), (np.float64(607.6595364583333), np.float64(2518.9888281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 57, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'ec2c288b2a24616ad714f80b6e5dced3', 'category': 'UncategorizedText', 'element_id': '0c77b1439544a71cd326f891a20b2aa5'}, page_content='•'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9256237745285034, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(2674.91259765625)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(2848.316953125)), (np.float64(2565.856847064218), np.float64(2848.316953125)), (np.float64(2565.856847064218), np.float64(2674.91259765625))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 57, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'ec2c288b2a24616ad714f80b6e5dced3', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '6f19adc902be7ad3e1b5fcfba08e79d9'}, page_content='• LNB (Low Noise Block Converter) — A combination low noise amplifier and down- converter built into one device attached to the feed, the LNB is used for satellite downlink signal reception by converting a higher frequency band to a lower frequency.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9477860331535339, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(552.0101318359375), np.float64(2889.214599609375)), (np.float64(552.0101318359375), np.float64(3314.9836197916666)), (np.float64(2613.1595364583336), np.float64(3314.9836197916666)), (np.float64(2613.1595364583336), np.float64(2889.214599609375))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 57, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'ec2c288b2a24616ad714f80b6e5dced3', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '9427a437592fe79a4f468bc51c3e3bd3'}, page_content='• Antenna — The equipment that transmits and receives electromagnetic waves, and usually referred to as the satellite dish. The antenna contains a feed assembly that gathers received high frequency signals and routes them to the LNB. The feed assembly includes an orthomode transducer that combines the Tx and Rx RF signals, which allows simultaneous reception and transmission of signals through the same feed and reflector. The feed assembly may also contain a servo motor that rotates the probe to allow for reception and transmission of both horizontally and vertically polarized signals.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(353.6458333333333), np.float64(3514.3013281249996)), (np.float64(353.6458333333333), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(1659.7896279566144), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(1659.7896279566144), np.float64(3514.3013281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'lang