'1745993496c1d057e23d825980ee7c7d'}, page_content='Service Providers who are not also satellite operators may also be referred to as Virtual Network Operators (VNOs). Specifically, a VNO is a company that purchases global or regional bandwidth capacity from a satellite operator or another VNO for the purpose of partitioning and reselling that capacity to subscribers. In general, a VNO has the ability to create and sell/resell service plans to subscribers or other VNOs. As described in Section 1.5.3, The Managed Service Model and Section 1.5.4, The Co-Located Service Model, Velocity supports a wide range of potential service models for service providers.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8369738459587097, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(662.4515991210938), np.float64(2642.947161458333)), (np.float64(662.4515991210938), np.float64(2877.4836197916666)), (np.float64(2593.7637031249997), np.float64(2877.4836197916666)), (np.float64(2593.7637031249997), np.float64(2642.947161458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 60, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '1a9cb3d274e5c688cf75e99c9bc81c12', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '0b2275f6ed0a5586017b336a47ab098d'}, page_content='VNOs are sometimes referred to as Value-Added Reseller (VARs). A VNO who is limited to purchasing subscriber service plans on a wholesale basis and reselling them to individual subscribers may be referred to as a Dealer. In general, a dealer can only manage subscribers.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d