igurable in the iDirect system to help define geo-location dependent behavior. A satellite terminal gets into the network using the Low Resolution Acquisition map. The terminal then reports its location to the PP, which makes decisions based on the Figure of Merit (FOM) map, Transmit Regulatory Offset (Tx RO) map, and regulatory areas (RAs). Service Area (SA) maps are also used by the PP to determine the services that are provided at the terminal’s location.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9102963805198669, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(560.9322509765625), np.float64(1151.8013281249998)), (np.float64(560.9322509765625), np.float64(1200.4002864583335)), (np.float64(2272.4833984375), np.float64(1200.4002864583335)), (np.float64(2272.4833984375), np.float64(1151.8013281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 68, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'fa27b2dff882b2d0389aa7c16ed783ca', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '815e57e89b41de0c55eee20d7f536272'}, page_content='All geographic information on the system is contained in following five items.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8791100382804871, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(566.3960571289062), np.float64(1246.5929947916666)), (np.float64(566.3960571289062), np.float64(1295.191953125)), (np.float64(1119.06396484375), np.float64(1295.191953125)), (np.float64(1119.06396484375), np.float64(1246.5929947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width'