'], 'page_number': 73, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'cc15b8f9183673ebec7f62fe0430d00f', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '58ee5b4a8e2bea8eefdfcc6d07e9ee41'}, page_content='A satellite terminal requires descriptions of the footprints of the beams in which it can operate. The Low Resolution Beam maps define, for each beam, the area on the earth where terminals are permitted to establish a network connection. A low-resolution map for a beam consists of one or more contours containing a small set of latitude/longitude points (typically < 20), or a center point and radius if the beam is circular. This often is the outermost contour of the FOM map.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9316103458404541, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(557.4036865234375), np.float64(2996.592994791666)), (np.float64(557.4036865234375), np.float64(3107.1711197916666)), (np.float64(2550.70361328125), np.float64(3107.1711197916666)), (np.float64(2550.70361328125), np.float64(2996.592994791666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 73, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'cc15b8f9183673ebec7f62fe0430d00f', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '01b65a5ae80f69ddc3195e262bf2df57'}, page_content='A beam’s low-resolution map does not need to include all points of the FOM contour, just enough that the terminal can determine whether it is located within the beam’s footprint:'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9