4T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 75, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '15680a158b1d0166140974b9a1faa00e', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '15b4b6eaa31ca34986c9016232697829'}, page_content='A Service Area Group SA Group), as its name suggests, is a group of service areas used to create Geoscope regions of service areas or Regulatory Areas. Each SA Group, when defined, references an SA map. A given SA map may be referenced by one or more SA Groups. Within an SA Group, SA coverage may not overlap. Each SA has an identifier 16-bit unsigned code known as the service area ID. Valid SA ID values range from 0 to 215-1 and are unique within an SA Group, but not across SA Groups.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9279940724372864, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(565.6121215820312), np.float64(2967.4263281249996)), (np.float64(565.6121215820312), np.float64(3139.9836197916666)), (np.float64(2599.03759765625), np.float64(3139.9836197916666)), (np.float64(2599.03759765625), np.float64(2967.4263281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 75, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '15680a158b1d0166140974b9a1faa00e', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'fefd7ef1e6268e7a07ef1bdb156b2b85'}, page_content='The service provider may use a private SA Group for one subscriber, or may define a public SA Group for multiple subscribers. If a single SA Group is used for all subscribers, it is referred to as the glob