e and only one service geoscope SA at a time, even if it lies in multiple beam footprints. Similarly, the satellite router will be located in one and only one RA SA at a time. When a satellite router reports its geo-location, the PP looks up the SA for the satellite router in the appropriate geoscope and RA SA Groups and makes all decisions based on that lookup.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9286161661148071, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(566.01171875), np.float64(1840.8638281249998)), (np.float64(566.01171875), np.float64(1951.4419531249998)), (np.float64(2553.8053697916666), np.float64(1951.4419531249998)), (np.float64(2553.8053697916666), np.float64(1840.8638281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 77, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'e3166083913d8004e75250bc09a51775'}, page_content='SAs and SA Groups are also used to restrict the operation of satellite routers to conform to regulatory restrictions as described in Regulatory Areas on page 44.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8920812606811523, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2039.4888281249998)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2102.6711197916666)), (np.float64(2085.960205078125), np.float64(2102.6711197916666)), (np.float64(2085.960205078125), np.float64(2039.4888281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetyp