een VLANs is not allowed inside a Velocity system.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8818918466567993, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(663.2596614583332)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(711.8586197916668)), (np.float64(1685.233642578125), np.float64(711.8586197916668)), (np.float64(1685.233642578125), np.float64(663.2596614583332))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 81, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '3c4515a2ccccda035e90ff34485d70e5', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '93ceed2cb3709da11b61b89aa3279fb0'}, page_content='The Velocity network uses the following SVN types:'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9545464515686035, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(577.95849609375), np.float64(757.0401611328125)), (np.float64(577.95849609375), np.float64(1120.1783447265625)), (np.float64(2587.378662109375), np.float64(1120.1783447265625)), (np.float64(2587.378662109375), np.float64(757.0401611328125))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 81, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '3c4515a2ccccda035e90ff34485d70e5', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': 'd84033ea71ba28ef597c45b2f0720e05'}, page_content='Data SVN — Transports user traffic from a satellite router to its final destination in a subscriber’s private network, and vice versa. It extends from the terminal network, through the satellite router, a SAS, the backbone network, and finally to an interface point to the subscriber’s private network. Each SVN is identified by an SVN ID that is defined by the satellite operator, and has its own IP address space, which may be managed by the service provider. Also referred to as a Subscriber or Customer SVN.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(758.0513281249998)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(806.6502864583334)), (np.float64(607.6595364583333), np.float64(806.6502864583334)), (np.float64(607.6595364583333), np.float64(758.0513281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 81, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '3c4515a2ccccda035e90ff34485d70e5', 'category': 'UncategorizedText', 'element_id': '42318a77860d02183b4705b09e6778f7'}, page_content='•'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9453752040863037, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(564.5657958984375), np.float64(1161.682373046875)), (np.float64(564.5657958984375), np.float64(1460.0914306640625)), (np.float64(2621.9824531249997), np.float64(1460.0914306640625)), (np.float64(2621.9824531249997), np.float64(1161.682373046875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 81, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '3c4515a2ccccda035e90ff34485d70e5', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '8e07f33f39c1f1be633e7ddf4ec40caf'}, page_content='• Admin SVN — Transports internal Velocity administrative traffic, between equipment within a SAS, between SASs, between the SAS and the NOC, and finally between the NOC or SAS NMS and satellite routers. This SVN must be assigned SVN ID 1. The management SVN IP address space is managed by the satellite operator who assigns management IP addresses to all network equipment.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9284166693687439, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1503.12646484375)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1678.0044531249998)), (np.float64(2603.3740234375), np.float64(1678.0044531249998)), (np.float64(2603.3740234375), np.float64(1503.12646484375))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 81, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '3c4515a2ccccda035e90ff34485d70e5', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '32426b5c822fdb98c0c4d60627ca6ba0'}, page_content='• Tunnel SVN — Transports user traffic between Velocity PP processes and line cards located in the same SAS or in the backup/diversity SAS. The SVN ID of the Tunnel SVN is configured by the satellite operator (Tunnel default SVN ID = 4048).'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'dete