), np.float64(617.0669531250002)), (np.float64(2580.012939453125), np.float64(617.0669531250002)), (np.float64(2580.012939453125), np.float64(506.4888281249999))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 86, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '9f5be5ddd51f5d7a3c8083059c98a034', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'a6c1faf6b4db8970071e7ac46b7d9984'}, page_content='The Velocity system supports downstream IPv4 multicasting within any SVN. Any equipment on the terminal network may subscribe to multicast streams in its SVNs.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8988907933235168, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(663.2596614583332)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(711.8586197916668)), (np.float64(2159.047607421875), np.float64(711.8586197916668)), (np.float64(2159.047607421875), np.float64(663.2596614583332))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 86, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '9f5be5ddd51f5d7a3c8083059c98a034', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'bd0bc2df7de7c73ed8e801176931b651'}, page_content='The Velocity system currently supports the following types of multicast:'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9509239196777344, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(666.9137573242188), np.float64(758.0513281249998)), (np.float64(666.9137573242188), np.float64(1117.7994384765625)), (np.float64(2598.832275390625), np.float64(1117.7994384765625)), (np.float64(2598.832275390625), np.float64(758.0513281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 86, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '9f5be5ddd51f5d7a3c8083059c98a034', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': 'ab6addb72b329f18a7f15452df1c2100'}, page_content='• Dynamic Multicast — The satellite router is an IGMP (Internet Group Management Protocol) proxy and implements IGMPv3 and IGMPv2. For dynamic multicast, the satellite router software accepts IGMPv2 or IGMPv3 join and leave messages from hosts on the terminal network, and requests the multicast streams on behalf of the hosts from the SAS site using IGMPv3. The PP also is an IGMPv3 proxy, and similarly requests the multicast streams from the upstream multicast source.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9568265080451965, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(657.7892456054688), np.float64(1162.1019287109375)), (np.float64(657.7892456054688), np.float64(1522.794677734375)), (np.float64(2638.4251614583327), np.float64(1522.794677734375)), (np.float64(2638.4251614583327), np.float64(1162.1019287109375))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 86, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '9f5be5ddd51f5d7a3c8083059c98a034', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '5a3c8a59684304646a8e35397246d90a'}, page_content="• Static Multicast — For static multicast streams, a fixed set of multicast IP addresses are configured to receive the streams in the satellite router configuration. After it enters the iNet, the satellite router generates IGMPv3 requests to the SAS site for those statically configured multicast IP addresses on behalf of the hosts on the terminal network. Note that Evolution's use of the term “static multicast” is the same as persistent multicast in Velocity."), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9486925005912781, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(654.4000244140625), np.float64(1566.1553955078125)), (np.float64(654.4000244140625), np.float64(1925.9211197916663)), (np.float64(2560.805369791666), np.float64(1925.9211197916663)), (np.float64(2560.805369791666), np.float64(1566.1553955078125))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 86, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '9f5be5ddd51f5d7a3c8083059c98a034', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '753148581aac8e35f05f8102c9dbd158'}, page_content='• Persistent Multicast — Persistent Multicast represents a multicast method, in Velocity, in which the protocol processor sends the multicast stream on the configured iNets, without waiting for an IGMP join. When a Persistent Multicast stream is configured in Velocity, the PP will send an IGMP request to the multicast source for that stream, transmitting the request without waiting for a join, on the iNets identified in that configuration.'), Document(metadata={'s