19265e9796a129b79fc6c58d43'}, page_content='2.6.1.1 Shared Chassis Operation'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.7980486154556274, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(1042.671875), np.float64(1265.0849609375)), (np.float64(1042.671875), np.float64(1316.503662109375)), (np.float64(2157.98486328125), np.float64(1316.503662109375)), (np.float64(2157.98486328125), np.float64(1265.0849609375))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 89, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'FigureCaption', 'element_id': '859917642a9d21a003a378c9996e8ffc'}, page_content='Figure 2-14. A Sample SAS Network Architecture'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9067906737327576, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.718017578125), np.float64(1401.4679947916666)), (np.float64(568.718017578125), np.float64(1464.6502864583333)), (np.float64(1589.5810180596354), np.float64(1464.6502864583333)), (np.float64(1589.5810180596354), np.float64(1401.4679947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 89, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '9e1755821bdfa33847742a8a90d2fe19'}, page_content='2.6.1.1 Shared Chassis Operation'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.947769284248352, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(566.8193359375), np.float64(1508.2896728515625)), (np.float64(566.8193359375), np.float64(1867.587786458333)), (np.float64(2600.239013671875), np.float64(1867.587786458333)), (np.float64(2600.239013671875), np.float64(1508.2896728515625))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 89, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '9e1755821bdfa33847742a8a90d2fe19', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'f18b0e8a80ab8965a75d7ad7f211a25d'}, page_content='In a Velocity network, a single hub chassis (not iHub chassis) can be configured to be shared by multiple SASs. This means the network is able to support additional satellites without the cost and effort of installing an additional chassis for every satellite. This is especially important when only a few beams on the additional satellite will be used by the Velocity network. The satellite operator will need additional line cards, a PP cluster and a SAS NMS dedicated to the additional satellite.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9394966959953308, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1913.7804947916663)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2148.3169531249996)), (np.float64(2645.47412109375), np.float64(2148.3169531249996)), (np.float64(2645.47412109375), np.float64(1913.7804947916663))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 89, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '9e1755821bdfa33847742a8a90d2fe19', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'dbb3b98c506be9b2dae4a7be5f7df657'}, page_content='This operation is based on having multiple PP clusters share the chassis. Specific chassis slots are cabled together into an IF domain associated with each satellite and indirectly assigned to each PP cluster through configuration. Each PP cluster then determines what slots it can use from the configuration.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9467344880104065, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2193.070556640625)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2553.004453125)), (np.float64(2570.5118760132286), np.float64(2553.004453125)), (np.float64(2570.5118760132286), np.float64(2193.070556640625))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 89, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '9e1755821bdfa33847742a8a90d2fe19', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '6f35ded19c3f72d413e72e6765211830'}, page_content='The chassis supports multiple simultaneous sessions to different clients, which allows it to simultaneously process commands from multiple PP clusters. Control and monitoring of the chassis as a whole, such as switching slots on/off and checking power supply status, is performed by every PP cluster as if it were the only PP cluster communicating with the chassis. Since each PP cluster limits its control to its assigned chassis slots, multiple PP clusters are able to share a chassis without any other coordination between the PP clusters.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.429934561252594, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(341.8462219238281), np.float64(3509.088134765625)), (np.float64(341.8462219238281), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(1943.415771484375), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(1943.415771484375), np.float64(3509.088134765625))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 89, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '9e1755821bdfa33847742a8a90d2fe19', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '483aeee4f85503b507c3e0726d927bd2'}, page_content='ST Engineering iDirect Proprietary | Confidentiality: Public Technical Reference Guide | iDirect Velocity™ | T0001665 | Revision 1'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(2570.3854166666665), np.float64(3514.3013281249996)), (np.float64(2570.3854166666665), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(2621.3372478846873), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(2621.3372478846873), np.float64(3514.3013281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 89, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '9e1755821bdfa33847742a8a90d2fe19', 'category': 'UncategorizedText', 'element_id': '6de72c53b00f9d54d2e24