he Tunnel SVN/VLAN are 802.1q VLAN-tagged, and the VLAN tag has the same value as the SVN ID. Although the satellite operator is given the choice whether to use VLAN tags on the Admin SVN/VLAN, the operator must choose to enable Admin VLAN tagging; failing to do so causes a heavy CPU load on the PPs.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8846703171730042, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(563.839111328125), np.float64(726.6049218749998)), (np.float64(563.839111328125), np.float64(794.6726302083334)), (np.float64(2575.26953125), np.float64(794.6726302083334)), (np.float64(2575.26953125), np.float64(726.6049218749998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 91, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '3db530d412257e0081b77b2db15758e5', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '8beb63510050357149132bb47b534be8'}, page_content='2.6.3 Velocity SAS Network — Layer 3 Network Architecture'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9448948502540588, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(838.2596614583332)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1010.8169531250002)), (np.float64(2649.047119140625), np.float64(1010.8169531250002)), (np.float64(2649.047119140625), np.float64(838.2596614583332))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 91, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 