463fec3e68e104dd04f', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '7b25aa8ee1a0434c5b880bbe29e26b73'}, page_content='As shown in the diagram, the CDC site contains three iDirect components—the Intelligent Gateway (iGW), Pulse SAS NMS, and a Kafka Kubernettes Cluster.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.5932090878486633, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(1239.7183837890625), np.float64(2173.526611328125)), (np.float64(1239.7183837890625), np.float64(2223.603411458333)), (np.float64(1962.806640625), np.float64(2223.603411458333)), (np.float64(1962.806640625), np.float64(2173.526611328125))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 92, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'FigureCaption', 'element_id': 'c43ea49da7ca06829c5f139e19c52783'}, page_content='Figure 2-17. CDC Site Network'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9388685822486877, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2278.3638281249996)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2512.9002864583335)), (np.float64(2649.43115234375), np.float64(2512.9002864583335)), (np.float64(2649.43115234375), np.float64(2278.3638281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 92, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '8c0848ff6925b1632165198d740e2e2f'}, page_content='The iGW is a virtualized platform that hosts the Velocity PP cluster. In physical terms, the iGW platform is a number of sleds in one or more FX2 chassis. Each sled hosts a number of vir- tual machines (VMs), each of which is a node in the PP cluster. For additional details on the iGW platform, refer to the document Installing iGateway in a Velocity Network.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9423630833625793, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2562.7388281249996)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2859.254453125)), (np.float64(2638.111083984375), np.float64(2859.254453125)), (np.float64(2638.111083984375), np.float64(2562.7388281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 92, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '09b856b0af0645b577c92f615cf52f6c'}, page_content='The iGW PP cluster operates in the same manner as with a bare-metal PP server cluster. As in the case of the bare-metal PP cluster, the number of nodes/VMs is determined by the satellite bandwidth and number of supported terminals. Extended PP software manages the timing synchronization across RF Gateways to minimize the effects of the WAN on control and customer traffic.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9297052025794983, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(560.226806640625), np.float64(2905.447161458333)), (np.float64(560.226806640625), np.float64(3016.025286458333)), (np.float64(2556.7584947916666), np.float64(3016.025286458333)), (np.float64(2556.7584947916666), np.float64(2905.447161458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 92, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'efd13192150bd4df02f31bd1ac61d3c1'}, page_content='The NMS in the CDC site is the same NMS as deployed in the traditional SAS, as is the Kafka cluster. The CDC network is also similar to that of the traditional SAS.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(353.6458333333333), np.float64(3514.3013281249996)), (np.float64(353.6458333333333), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(404.59766455135417), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(404.59766455135417), np.float64(3514.3013281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 92, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'UncategorizedText', 'element_id': 'fa83a908dd219580d9be96629407ca8a'}, page_content='58'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.5235278010368347, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(1063.0169677734375), np.float64(3508.538818359375)), (np.float64(1063.0169677734375), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(2626.32177734375), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), 