ad_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9400073289871216, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(561.9331665039062), np.float64(736.1763281249998)), (np.float64(561.9331665039062), np.float64(1032.691953125)), (np.float64(2636.602244791666), np.float64(1032.691953125)), (np.float64(2636.602244791666), np.float64(736.1763281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 95, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '371f68253a94e84c5e96317e6984045a', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '3188f6e00ae6f47dbc7d15abeb8743f2'}, page_content='A defining characteristic of the CDC architecture is that the RF Gateway and Protocol Processors are not co-located, but instead are at separate locations that are connected over a Wide Area Network (WAN) link. All communication between the CDC and RF Gateway components is based on standard IP, carried over an IP/MPLS WAN, or other networking technology such as MetroEthernet.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9437150359153748, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1078.884661458333)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1375.4852294921875)), (np.float64(2617.99365234375), np.float64(1375.4852294921875)), (np.float64(2617.99365234375), np.float64(1078.884661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 95, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '371f68253a94e84c5e96317e6984045a', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '363709d25395cab0d35f191721bb7f6b'}, page_content='The WAN link will likely introduce the effects of latency, jitter, packet loss and/or packet reordering to both control and data traffic between the PP and line cards. Although Velocity is defended, as much as possible, against these effects, the SLA for the Network Operator’s WAN must minimize these factors to avoid degraded service. Both Tunnel and Admin SVN traffic must also be prioritized across the WAN by policies applied at the access or PE routers.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8266041278839111, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(848.8826904296875), np.float64(2061.9836197916666)), (np.float64(848.8826904296875), np.float64(2110.5825781249996)), (np.float64(2341.009467633594), np.float64(2110.5825781249996)), (np.float64(2341.009467633594), np.float64(2061.9836197916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 95, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'FigureCaption', 'element_id': '56587c0b0a56b49de0b8bbc0a0f4a7ea'}, page_content='Figure 2-20. CDC and RF Gateway Wide Area Network (WAN) Link'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8751604557037354, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2165.3429947916666)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2213.9419531249996)), (np.float64(2392.143798828125), np.float64(2213.9419531249996)), (np.float64(2392.143798828125), np.fl