763beb2e1ab89f028b8'}, page_content='Other impairments, such as packet duplication, while remotely possible, are not considered.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9388757944107056, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(564.790283203125), np.float64(2828.884661458333)), (np.float64(564.790283203125), np.float64(3125.400286458333)), (np.float64(2609.6230781249997), np.float64(3125.400286458333)), (np.float64(2609.6230781249997), np.float64(2828.884661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 95, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '4a1bee6b2a72a41a4147ecaa7f2c9e63'}, page_content='In many data flows through the system, no change is needed since the Velocity already accounts for these effects, which remain much higher on the satellite link than on the terrestrial links. The Velocity system also prioritizes control flows over data flows. For some packet flows, however, timers will be extended and for others packet buffering will be used. See the following subsections related to impact on control and end-user data flows.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.936476469039917, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(3171.592994791666)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(3344.150286458333)), (np.float64(2631.10134875), np.float64(3344.150286458333)), (np.float64(2631.10134875), np.float64(3171.592994791666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_mod