nal network deployed at the remote location. The terminal network may be as simple as a few hosts directly connected to the satellite router, or a complex collection of VLANs and subnets.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.5793800950050354, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(1140.4166666666667), np.float64(1835.9419531249996)), (np.float64(1140.4166666666667), np.float64(1884.5409114583329)), (np.float64(2053.2621899135934), np.float64(1884.5409114583329)), (np.float64(2053.2621899135934), np.float64(1835.9419531249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 102, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'FigureCaption', 'element_id': 'b777135d8a0fc1668499b23587a5d0f6'}, page_content='Figure 2-28. Example Terminal Network'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9361495971679688, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(561.7952880859375), np.float64(1939.3013281249998)), (np.float64(561.7952880859375), np.float64(2111.8586197916666)), (np.float64(2618.5239576413014), np.float64(2111.8586197916666)), (np.float64(2618.5239576413014), np.float64(1939.3013281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 102, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'c585b4703faf5b86f7ef6308ce6f68b2'}, page_content='The number of ports available on a satellite terminal depends on its composition. In its simplest form factor, the terminal has a single Ethernet port to connect to the terminal network. The terminal may also contain an internal switch, providing multiple Ethernet ports.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9396631121635437, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.569091796875), np.float64(2158.0513281249996)), (np.float64(568.569091796875), np.float64(2392.587786458333)), (np.float64(2645.544189453125), np.float64(2392.587786458333)), (np.float64(2645.544189453125), np.float64(2158.0513281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 102, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '2190773a21558574dd75863e27d88da5'}, page_content='On the terminal switch, ports may be trunk or access. An access port carries untagged traffic, i.e. all traffic is mapped to the same SVN. Trunk ports support multiple VLANs and all frames have VLAN (802.1q) tags. Each VLAN tag is mapped to an SVN. The satellite router supports up to twelve SVNs.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9371227622032166, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2438.7804947916666)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2673.316953125)), (np.float64(2556.320994791666), np.float64(2673.316953125)), (np.float64(2556.320994791666), np.float64(2438.7804947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 102, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '302ed77474d6f489cd269b3fedef576f'}, page_content='The Velocity satellite terminal is often paired with an external router, as illustrated in the following image. In this topology, the router is a BGP peer of the satellite router and advertises the IP subnets behind it. The topology and routing protocols of the networks behind the router are transparent to the satellite router.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(353.6458333333333), np.float64(3514.3013281249996)), (np.float64(353.6458333333333), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(404.59766455135417), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(404.59766455135417), np.float64(3514.3013281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 102, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'UncategorizedText', 'element_id': 'a8c5f2fb303e223bb554a703aca9d8a7'}, page_content='68'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.48809757828712463, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(1062.0740966796875), np.float64(3510.7255859375)), (np.float64(1062.0740966796875), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(2623.44873046875), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(2623.44873046875),