tion (NAT) and port address translation (PAT) for IPv4 networks. Port forwarding rules may also be configured on the satellite router. The public address that is used for translation is configured on the satellite router.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9494273066520691, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2004.9263281249998)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2363.4211197916666)), (np.float64(2623.331411458333), np.float64(2363.4211197916666)), (np.float64(2623.331411458333), np.float64(2004.9263281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 111, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '661c8de3b82eb410b653614ee4476ab9', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'c2bdb7a20174aeba2841aaa1a1d82906'}, page_content='NAT modifies the IP addresses and port numbers in the IP packet header, so nodes that reside on a private network can share a public IP address for communication with the outside world. It is frequently used for TCP, UDP and ICMP packets. However, NAT inherently breaks protocols in which IP addresses are carried in the body of the packet. SIP (Session Initiation Protocol) is one of these protocols. Velocity provides a SIP ALG (Application Layer Gateway) to overcome this limitation.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9420691132545471, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.2315673828125), np.float64(2409.6138281249996)), (np.float64(568.2315673828125), np.float64(2582.1711197916666)), (np.float