filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '3170448383adc96da2a01f0d09f040f3', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '00a4abc615d593a89fdf7f89c87ac712'}, page_content='Symbol rates and detection thresholds for carriers with actual acquisition slots, whether used in contention or invitation mode'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9454982280731201, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(561.8636474609375), np.float64(1603.884661458333)), (np.float64(561.8636474609375), np.float64(1900.400286458333)), (np.float64(2602.531005859375), np.float64(1900.400286458333)), (np.float64(2602.531005859375), np.float64(1603.884661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 121, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '3170448383adc96da2a01f0d09f040f3', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '274e9c24fcaacf8ccad4ece36cf231fb'}, page_content='If the satellite terminal does not receive a response to the acquisition transmission, it is assumed to have been lost (or suffered a collision in a contention-based arrangement). The terminal will then transmit another acquisition burst. This will be transmitted in the next invitation assignment received, or in a contention slot selected following a random interval chosen from a range that grows exponentially with each failed attempt.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9423620104789734, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1946.5929947916663)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2243.1086197916666)), (np.float64(2640.5032864583336), np.float64(2243.1086197916666)), (np.float64(2640.5032864583336), np.float64(1946.5929947916663))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 121, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '3170448383adc96da2a01f0d09f040f3', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '62ea7a0d37269e6b9cdc70f0e011fd94'}, page_content='The satellite terminal thus handles transitions between invitation-based and contention-based operation transparently; no re-configuration is required. A satellite terminal that may not have succeeded during the invitation phase, will automatically continue its log on procedure using contention slots. In both cases, the satellite terminal will ensure the maximum allowed power spectral density is not exceeded.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9446031451225281, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2289.3013281249996)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2585.816953125)), (np.float64(2632.88671875), np.float64(2585.816953125)), (np.float64(2632.88671875), np.float64(2289.3013281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 121, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '3170448383adc96da2a01f0d09f040f3', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '2fa3e51b9f6ec2031aa6989a97c9d705'}, page_content='The physical-layer acquisition is considered complete when the acquisition burst has been received and the first correction message has been sent. Following this, the satellite terminal is authenticated and accepted into the iNet, given its QoS allocations, etc., and is allowed to start sending traffic and capacity requests. These aspects are outside the physical layer acquisition process.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.43159618973731995, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(341.3988952636719), np.float64(3509.13818359375)), (np.float64(341.3988952636719), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(1944.12744140625), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(1944.12744140625), np.float64(3509.13818359375))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 121, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '3170448383adc96da2a01f0d09f040f3', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '2a6d576a38a63a825f34ea620d82c2fe'}, page_content='ST Engineering iDirect Proprietary | Confidentiality: Public Technical Reference Guide | iDirect Velocity™ | T0001665 | Revision 1'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(2570.3854166666665), np.float64(3514.3013281249996)), (np.float64(2570.3854166666665), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(2621.3372478846873), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(2621.3372478846873), np.float64(3514.3013281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'applica