ong. Each frame type is defined in the DVB-S2 standard in terms of the number of coded bits: short frames contain 16200 coded bits; long frames contain 64800 coded bits. The Velocity system supports short frames, as illustrated in the diagram.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.623385488986969, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(1018.1718749999999), np.float64(1831.1495361328125)), (np.float64(1018.1718749999999), np.float64(1886.11376953125)), (np.float64(2177.672607421875), np.float64(1886.11376953125)), (np.float64(2177.672607421875), np.float64(1831.1495361328125))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 123, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'FigureCaption', 'element_id': '60e61fd11c6ea8aac63ecd6d84d13123'}, page_content='Figure 3-5. DVB-S2 Short Frame Protocol Structure'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9461252093315125, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1936.17333984375)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2359.775286458333)), (np.float64(2638.8447265625), np.float64(2359.775286458333)), (np.float64(2638.8447265625), np.float64(1936.17333984375))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 123, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'a273b3a4a4a7a02c92c3425d64d237cf'}, page_content='iDirect uses a proprietary data encapsulation protocol called LEGS (Lightweight Encapsulation for Generic Streams) for efficient encapsulation of downstream data between the DVB-S2 line cards and satellite terminals using generic streams. The LEGS protocol maximizes the efficiency of data packing into BBFRAMES on the downstream. For example, if a timeplan only takes up 80% of a BBFRAME, the LEGS protocol allows the transmit (Tx) line card to include a portion of another packet that is ready for transmission in the same frame. This results in maximizing the use of the downstream bandwidth.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9395037889480591, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2405.9679947916666)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2640.505126953125)), (np.float64(2648.37060546875), np.float64(2640.505126953125)), (np.float64(2648.37060546875), np.float64(2405.9679947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 123, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '62b5783a666ecf4cd1582f99dc5a15c0'}, page_content='MODCOD refers to the combinations of modulation types and error coding schemes supported by the DVB-S2 standard. The higher the modulation, the greater the number of bits per symbol (or bits per Hz). The modulation types specified by the DVB-S2 standard and supported by the iDirect system are documented in the iDirect Link Budget Analysis Guide.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9414164423942566, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2686.697161458333)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2859.254453125)), (np.float64(2630.0397447916666), np.float64(2859.254453125)), (np.float64(2630.0397447916666), np.float64(2686.697161458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 123, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'c852c1ba327899f94fef819bc4bba0b8'}, page_content='Coding refers to the error-correction coding schemes available. Low-density parity-check (LDPC) and Bose-Chaudhuri-Hocquenghem (BCH) codes are used in DVB-S2. Effective rates are 1/4 through 9/10. The 9/10 coding rates are not supported for short BBFRAMEs.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9407157301902771, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2905.447161458333)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(3139.9836197916666)), (np.float64(2537.540771484375), np.float64(3139.9836197916666)), (np.float64(2537.540771484375), np.float64(2905.447161458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 123, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '9cde17571bd0262bd36ff2287a1390ef'}, page_content='The DVB-S2 standard does not support every combination of modulation and coding. In general, the lower the MODCOD, the more robust the error correction, and the lower the spectral efficiency. The higher the MODCOD, the less robust the error correction, and the greater the spectral efficiency.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9101755023002625, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(563.978759765625), np.float64(3186.1763281249996)), (np.float64(563.978759765625), np.float64(3234.775286458333)), (np.float64(2409.208740234375), np.float64(3234.775286458333)), (np.float64(2409.208740234375), np.float64(3186.1763281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 123, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '814b61010e700f9047b9b7ee7a641edf'}, page_content='DVB-S2 defines three methods of applying modulation and coding to a data stream:'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9280075430870056, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(3280.967994791666)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(3391.5461197916666)), (np.float64(2610.224365234375), np.float64(3391.5461197916666)), (np.float64(2610.224365234375), np.float64(3280.967994791666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 123, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '9e14e089222fc9560221