rativeText', 'element_id': '1640bc8c89b8c47906ca998a6e6d1741'}, page_content='An iDirect DVB-S2 downstream contains a continuous stream of Physical Layer Frames (PLFRAMEs). The PLHEADER indicates the type of modulation and error correction coding used on the subsequent data. It also indicates the data format and frame length. An example of physical layer frames is illustrated in the diagram.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9251941442489624, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2858.0513281249996)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2968.629453125)), (np.float64(2633.30908203125), np.float64(2968.629453125)), (np.float64(2633.30908203125), np.float64(2858.0513281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 124, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '9a806e09b41d6b88ed9503f338016e55', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '7b46f91bca6fc23df15a7f46fc6f9a16'}, page_content='The PLHEADER always uses π/2 BPSK modulation. The overhead associated with pilot symbols injected into the data stream is 2.4%.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9363020658493042, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(3011.6240234375)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(3249.3586197916666)), (np.float64(2629.69775390625), np.float64(3249.3586197916666)), (np.float64(2629.69775390625), np.float64(3011.6240234375))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52