ue', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(856.4888281249998)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1091.0252864583335)), (np.float64(2624.060578125), np.float64(1091.0252864583335)), (np.float64(2624.060578125), np.float64(856.4888281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 129, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'f816595c6b328573ad08574bee80e818', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '990e87902b9f6279c0d0fdb823072e7e'}, page_content='The Pulse NMS configuration work flow allows adding beams, channels, iNets, Inroute Groups, iNet Profiles, and Inroute Group Profiles. The user can combine all related workflow pages and use the Line Card Group field on the iNet to define a group of iNets that will share the same line card.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9410753846168518, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1140.8638281249998)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1313.4211197916668)), (np.float64(2632.67431640625), np.float64(1313.4211197916668)), (np.float64(2632.67431640625), np.float64(1140.8638281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 129, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'f816595c6b328573ad08574bee80e818', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '312161beec270941f8680fe0a9515695'}, page_content='With the ILC-T multi-carrier feature, the number of required transmit line cards and the asso- ciated chassis, racks, floor space, power and climate control, and intra-site network equip- ment, all is reduced by as much as a factor of four.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9082785248756409, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(560.3203125), np.float64(1363.259661458333)), (np.float64(560.3203125), np.float64(1411.8586197916666)), (np.float64(1798.26513671875), np.float64(1411.8586197916666)), (np.float64(1798.26513671875), np.float64(1363.259661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 129, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'f816595c6b328573ad08574bee80e818', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '15c524ac7190eb511bf00b6e5edabc8c'}, page_content='With this feature, the Pulse NMS supports the following:'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.894418478012085, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.4104614257812), np.float64(1461.697161458333)), (np.float64(567.4104614257812), np.float64(1510.2961197916666)), (np.float64(1441.3394775390625), np.float64(1510.2961197916666)), (np.float64(1441.3394775390625), np.float64(1461.697161458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 129, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'f816595c6b328573a