ue', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1188.259661458333)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1236.8586197916668)), (np.float64(2524.35498046875), np.float64(1236.8586197916668)), (np.float64(2524.35498046875), np.float64(1188.259661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 138, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'bcf2e04f1c05cad604e5fac9fc27cad7', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': 'f35fbb33c969f1aaef450e7c07836675'}, page_content='Long-Term — An operator defines inroute group compositions using statistical data.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8630606532096863, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1283.0513281249998)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1331.6502864583333)), (np.float64(1720.7847432967187), np.float64(1331.6502864583333)), (np.float64(1720.7847432967187), np.float64(1283.0513281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 138, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'bcf2e04f1c05cad604e5fac9fc27cad7', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '964355eea169b29e6c191792dc4cacf7'}, page_content='These modes are described in the following sections.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.7449824810028076, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(1149.7564697265625), np.float64(2185.9419531249996)), (np.float64(1149.7564697265625), np.float64(2234.5947265625)), (np.float64(2038.145263671875), np.float64(2234.5947265625)), (np.float64(2038.145263671875), np.float64(2185.9419531249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 138, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'FigureCaption', 'element_id': 'a41588dfe985401db1b7f4c4137f6849'}, page_content='Figure 3-14. A-TDMA Adaptivity Modes'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.849193811416626, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5116577148438), np.float64(2279.48583984375)), (np.float64(567.5116577148438), np.float64(2335.1101302083334)), (np.float64(1131.3765869140625), np.float64(2335.1101302083334)), (np.float64(1131.3765869140625), np.float64(2279.48583984375))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 138, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': 'd394d38c7b68a6132a5ec7f98d55395f'}, page_content='Short-Term Adaptivity'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.944578230381012, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.6677856445312), np.float64(2378.43310546875)), (np.float64(568.6677856445312), np.float64(2676.9627864583335)), (np.float64(2638.6074531249997), np.float64(2676.9627864583335)), (np.float64(2638.6074531249997), np.float64(2378.43310546875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 138, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'd394d38c7b68a6132a5ec7f98d55395f', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'a290bd43b93bfee86c8c9b1f666888f0'}, page_content="Short-term adaptivity operates in real time and considers only the current IGC. The Upstream Control process monitors the C/N of each satellite terminal's upstream carrier, as measured at the SAS, to determine the satellite terminal's nominal carrier. A nominal carrier is the upstream carrier with the highest threshold C/N0 that the satellite terminal can currently sustain and validly use."), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.5016363859176636, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(1195.532470703125), np.float64(3340.44140625)), (np.float64(1195.532470703125), np.float64(3390.2700781249996)), (np.float64(2000.27978515625), np.float64(3390.2700781249996)), (np.float64(2000.27978515625), np.float64(3340.44140625))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 138, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': 'cdea7a411264253c0a3f4ab5b2bceafd'}, page_content='Figure 3-15. Short-Term Adaptivity'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(353.6458333333333), np.float64(3514.3013281249996)), (np.float64(353.6458333333333), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(430.0836416027083), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(430.0836416027083), np.float64(3514.3013281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 138, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'cdea7a411264253c0a3f4ab5b2bceafd', 'category': 'UncategorizedText', 'element_id': '24fb8092ce9d3ecfd698d8aa6eb13a35'}, page_content='104'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.5237840414047241, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(1060.123779296875), np.float64(3514.229248046875)), (np.float64(1060.123779296875), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(2633.3720703125), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(2633.3720703125), np.float64(3514.229248046875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 138, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'cdea7a411264253c0a3f4ab5b2bceafd', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '40086f6644727b516af34ac4ab866bf5'}, page_content='ST Engineering iDirect Proprietary | Confidentiality: Public Technical Reference Guide | iDirect Velocity™ | T0001665 | Revision 1'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9156054258346558, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(2046.025146484375), np.float64(251.28049479166657)), (np.float64(2046.025146484375), np.float64(299.87945312500017)), (np.float64(2630.795166015625), np.float64(299.87945312500017)), (np.float64(2630.795166015625), np.float64(251.28049479166657))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 139, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Header', 'element_id': 'c3a3c556277da1b5986ecded4daa2f28'}, page_content='3.5.2.2 Adaptivity Modes'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9484232068061829, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(400.7596614583332)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(759.2544531250002)), (np.float64(2634.487661458333), np.float64(759.2544531250002)), (np.float64(2634.487661458333), np.float64(400.7596614583332))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 139, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'c3a3c556277da1b5986ecded4daa2f28', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'ac64e62012d1e6b5a93734b8a6b58c8b'}, page_content="The protocol processor uses a bandwidth allocation algorithm to assign each satellite terminal slot with parameters (such as symbol rate and MODCOD) that are estimated to be within its capabilities for the current link conditions. The algorithm attempts to allocate slots on the satellite terminal's nominal carrier and on any carriers having a C/N0 lower than the nominal carrier. However, this is not always possible due to the overall demand for upstream traffic slots in the inroute group."), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9454612731933594, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(805.4471614583332)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1103.0753173828125)), (np.float64(2630.97802734375), np.float64(1103.0753173828125)), (np.float64(2630.97802734375), np.float64(805.4471614583332))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 139, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'c3a3c556277da1b5986ecded4daa2f28', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'cf8f4a1f7b08616c1b4f90735250ecb2'}, page_content='The bandwidth allocation algorithm schedules bursts in TDMA frames for each satellite terminal in accordance with the rules and priorities defined by the Group QoS settings for the inroute group. However, for A-TDMA, the algorithm must also account for the dynamic nature of the total capacity available for each satellite terminal, because the subset of carriers on which a terminal is able to transmit can change according to real-time network conditions.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.937609851360321, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1148.1554947916666)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1444.6711197916666)), (np.float64(2640.758494791666), np.float64(1444.6711197916666)), (np.float64(2640.758494791666), np.float64(1148.1554947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 139, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'c3a3c556277da1b5986ecded4daa2f28', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '534934320c4e9aed2148c1b641d1bbf0'}, page_content="As an example of short-term adaptivity, consider a satellite terminal experiencing a rain fade. When the satellite terminal enters the fade, the C/N of the satellite terminal's bursts, as measured at the SAS, drops. This drop limits the set of upstream carriers on which the satellite terminal can successfully transmit. This causes the UCP to change the satellite terminal's nominal carrier to a more protected carrier."), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9458626508712769, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.7452392578125), np.float64(1490.8638281249998)), (np.float64(567.7452392578125), np.float64(1849.3586197916663)), (np.float64(2606.669953125), np.float64(1849.3586197916663)), (np.float64(2606.669953125), np.float64(1490.8638281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 139, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'c3a3c556277da1b5986ecded4daa2f28', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'fe7ae8c30382c476e388fa3807994593'}, page_content="When allocating new bandwidth to the satellite terminal during the fade, the bandwidth allocation algorithm only considers available slots on the more limited subset of carriers. Because the satellite terminal's nominal carrier is set to a more protected carrier with lower throughput, the satellite terminal is able to stay in the network at the expense of bandwidth efficiency. When the fade passes, the satellite terminal's nominal carrier is changed back to the more efficient carrier."), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.901242733001709, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(566.1852416992188), np.float64(1898.8132552083332)), (np.float64(566.1852416992188), np.float64(1952.2976302083332)), (np.float64(1194.5743408203125), np.float64(1952.2976302083332)), (np.float64(1194.5743408203125), np.float64(1898.8132552083332))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 139, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'c3a3c556277da1b5986ecded4daa2f28', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '587475b6826972dc608d4cde3514eea4'}, page_content='Medium-Term Adaptivity'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9425588846206665, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.0952758789062), np.float64(1997.634661458333)), (np.float64(567.0952758789062), np.float64(2170.1919531249996)), (np.float64(2603.7168281249997), np.float64(2170.1919531249996)), (np.float64(2603.7168281249997), np.float64(1997.634661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 139, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '587475b6826972dc608d4cde3514eea4', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '0adcd96aeafdf4fbc81cc4f0f672e46b'}, page_content='Medium-term adaptivity is the automated process of selecting the best IGC for current network conditions. The frequency at which the selection algorithm executes is configurable through the NMS. By default, the IGC selection algorithm executes once per minute.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9523292779922485, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2216.384661458333)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2698.8377864583335)), (np.float64(2625.482453125), np.float64(2698.8377864583335)), (np.float64(2625.482453125), np.float64(2216.384661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 139, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '587475b6826972dc608d4cde3514eea4', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '08c639e658e15c1f89b21cb571c9eb7e'}, page_content='The goal of the IGC selection algorithm is to determine the IGC that best matches the current overall state of the system. At each invocation the algorithm carries out a trial scheduling of a single frame for each defined IGC, using demand levels that are computed statistically over the preceding interval. The algorithm takes into account the total number of slots assigned (capacity) as well as the level of bandwidth contention, which represents the number of slots that could not be allocated due to lack of capacity. If the optimal IGC selected by the algorithm is different from the current IGC, then the carrier configuration for the inroute group is changed to the new IGC.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.41693487763404846, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(342.4467468261719), np.float64(3512.1123046875)), (np.float64(342.4467468261719), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(1942.8453369140625), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(1942.8453369140625), np.float64(3512.1123046875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 139, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '872f04b8ef377cf28201915a15446c4a'}, page_content='ST Engineering iDirect Proprietary | Confidentiality: Public Technical Reference Guide | iDirect Velocity™ | T0001665 | Revision 1'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(2544.864583333333), np.float64(3514.3013281249996)), (np.float64(2544.864583333333), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(2621.302391602708), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(2621.302391602708), np.float64(3514.3013281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 139, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'UncategorizedText', 'element_id': 'dd422b1bc0f439abdd48d89f3ba4da8a'}, pa