ing remote commissioning. After the satellite terminal is commissioned, the value contained in the satellite terminal options file is used whenever the satellite terminal re-joins the network.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9366465210914612, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(564.9680786132812), np.float64(2960.134661458333)), (np.float64(564.9680786132812), np.float64(3132.691953125)), (np.float64(2589.1699531249997), np.float64(3132.691953125)), (np.float64(2589.1699531249997), np.float64(2960.134661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 147, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '3455bcc7082a785c87c807d1a0277fa3', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '30a16b94046d305e28c6381c770a2a49'}, page_content='This section describes why it is important to correctly configure the TDMA initial transmit power for all satellite terminals. Additional information is contained in the following iDirect documentation:'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9258439540863037, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(578.1646728515625), np.float64(3173.974609375)), (np.float64(578.1646728515625), np.float64(3351.441953125)), (np.float64(2580.0918281249997), np.float64(3351.441953125)), (np.float64(2580.0918281249997), np.float64(3173.974609375))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 147, 'file_di