eams on each of the satellites is a precious and expensive resource — one that is carefully managed by satellite operators and service providers. They will take care to deploy ground equipment that is link efficient (generates the most Mbps per MHz) and provides the most flexibility in creating service plans for a variety of applications.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9376968741416931, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(566.6803588867188), np.float64(2920.030494791666)), (np.float64(566.6803588867188), np.float64(3092.587786458333)), (np.float64(2536.324462890625), np.float64(3092.587786458333)), (np.float64(2536.324462890625), np.float64(2920.030494791666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 164, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '89c84225d43ed86f012e27b11ff60436', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '2631578db1527cf28764231711af8bdb'}, page_content='When discussing QoS, several interrelated measures are considered: throughput, latency, jitter, and packet loss. This section describes these QoS characteristics in general terms, without specific regard to a Velocity satellite network.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9188408255577087, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(3180.634661458333)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(3243.8169531249996)), (np.float64(1191.7470703125), np.float64(3243.8169531249996)), (np.float64(1191.7470703125), np.float64(3180.634661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpa