d': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(347.0414123535156), np.float64(251.28049479166657)), (np.float64(347.0414123535156), np.float64(299.87945312500017)), (np.float64(985.2820434570312), np.float64(299.87945312500017)), (np.float64(985.2820434570312), np.float64(251.28049479166657))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 176, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Header', 'element_id': '6f7fba25c1dbeabaeb49823321b7887c'}, page_content='4.5.2 GBWM Tree Structure'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9301143884658813, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(394.8340885416665)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(462.9017968750001)), (np.float64(1521.8504638671875), np.float64(462.9017968750001)), (np.float64(1521.8504638671875), np.float64(394.8340885416665))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 176, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '6f7fba25c1dbeabaeb49823321b7887c', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '5fb165422d61f413f8a73cbf51127687'}, page_content='4.5.2 GBWM Tree Structure'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9399638772010803, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(506.4888281249999)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(741.0252864583334)), (np.float64(2629.0553697916666), np.float64(741.0252864583334)), (np.float64(2629.0553697916666), np.float64(506.4888281249999))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 176, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '5fb165422d61f413f8a73cbf51127687', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'c58302e4f7454cbe2deaa036358f2388'}, page_content='All beams on all satellites defined in the global network contribute to a single bandwidth pool managed by GBWM. The GBWM tree defines how the service provider subdivides that bandwidth pool into smaller bandwidth pools to control how individual subscribers compete for the finite satellite bandwidth.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9496684670448303, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(562.0405883789062), np.float64(787.2179947916666)), (np.float64(562.0405883789062), np.float64(1146.11181640625)), (np.float64(2614.5084947916666), np.float64(1146.11181640625)), (np.float64(2614.5084947916666), np.float64(787.2179947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 176, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '5fb165422d61f413f8a73cbf51127687', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'b9e81217cdf1d1b183d1ba5970e4eb21'}, page_content='Services are represented in the Velocity system by subscriber service plans (SSPPs / SSPCs) and GSPs. The relationships between these services and partitioning of bandwidth among them are represented by nodes in the GBWM tree. GSPs can be parents of other GSPs, many times over, down to the leaf-nodes of the tree, which are SSPCs. This hierarchy and the rules configured at each node determine how bandwidth is distributed by GQE. For additional information on Global QoS Enforcement, see GBWM Operations on page 160.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9488779902458191, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(566.7593994140625), np.float64(1191.9054947916666)), (np.float64(566.7593994140625), np.float64(1612.3794531249998)), (np.float64(2624.2793281249997), np.float64(1612.3794531249998)), (np.float64(2624.2793281249997), np.float64(1191.9054947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 176, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '5fb165422d61f413f8a73cbf51127687', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '8b9735e56d51a91519685d9153734d8f'}, page_content='When designing the GBWM tree, it is useful to think of the activity as designing pools of bandwidth and competition for that bandwidth. A GSP represents a pool of bandwidth. At runtime, its child nodes - whether other GSPs or SSPCs - compete with each other for the bandwidth available to the GSP. The bandwidth available to the GSP varies over time to reflect the result of competition with its sibling nodes and environmental conditions such as rain fade. Please refer to Outbound Service Plan Parameters on page 149 and Inbound Service Plan Parameters on page 158.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9381097555160522, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(565.3800659179688), np.float64(1658.572161458333)), (np.float64(565.3800659179688), np.float64(1831.1294531249998)), (np.float64(2614.873078125), np.float64(1831.1294531249998)), (np.float64(2614.873078125), np.float64(1658.572161458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 176, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '5fb165422d61f413f8a73cbf51127687', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '2e75b16bb499afabcb83a11bbadc182b'}, page_content="Velocity allows bandwidth to be oversubscribed in any GSP and at multiple levels of the tree. A service provider's knowledge of their customers' usage patterns and statistical analysis, typically guide the degree of oversubscription and where it should be used."), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8952956199645996, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1877.322161458333)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1925.9211197916663)), (np.float64(2075.645263671875), np.float64(1925.9211197916663)), (np.float64(2075.645263671875), np.float64(1877.322161458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 176, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '5fb165422d61f413f8a73cbf51127687', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '79e8879550fc2f72445f47bb9007c98c'}, page_content='Th