ope is a characteristic of service plans that describes where a service plan can be used, and by extension that bandwidth in the satellite network can be used to satisfy their demand. For each GSP, satellite operators and service providers can indicate it is supported globally, or is applicable to a subset of the beams in the satellite network. Additionally, each GSP can be configured with maximum throughput limits per beam, limiting the maximum throughput delivered to an individual service plan in specific beams.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9369340538978577, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(560.9234619140625), np.float64(1279.4054947916666)), (np.float64(560.9234619140625), np.float64(1451.962786458333)), (np.float64(2550.0866197916666), np.float64(1451.962786458333)), (np.float64(2550.0866197916666), np.float64(1279.4054947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 182, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '7fff3096d06634f45513085ffa36cda0', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '85be4ab5cbc6e86fcd78985bf05a150d'}, page_content='For SSPCs, service providers can specify the beams and/or service areas where the service plan can be used. See Geoscope Regions Based on Service Areas on page 43, for additional details on geographic scope and service areas.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.907191276550293, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1540.009661458333)), (np.float64(568.75), np.floa