19a9649051a8994d512edf7be3'}, page_content='4.5.5.1 Outbound (DVB-S2) QoS'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8916738629341125, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(564.47802734375), np.float64(400.7596614583332)), (np.float64(564.47802734375), np.float64(449.35861979166685)), (np.float64(2307.243408203125), np.float64(449.35861979166685)), (np.float64(2307.243408203125), np.float64(400.7596614583332))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 184, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '5acb5719a9649051a8994d512edf7be3', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'e57cdcb1f9b9dc22e22e6a865e8ccb30'}, page_content='The following terms are used when discussing MODCODs in the context of GQoS:'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9380513429641724, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(495.5513281249999)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(731.8638305664062)), (np.float64(2631.7897447916666), np.float64(731.8638305664062)), (np.float64(2631.7897447916666), np.float64(495.5513281249999))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 184, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '5acb5719a9649051a8994d512edf7be3', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '2adbe8ff26b6a8dd57c911f1479bfe0d'}, page_content="• Maximum MODCOD — The network's maximum MODCOD is the highest (or most efficient) MODCOD supported by the Velocity network. The Maximum MODCOD on the DVB-S2 outbound is 16APSK 8/9. Although the maximum MODCOD value is a global parameter that applies to all iNets, iNets can have different configured Maximum MODCODS."), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9349288940429688, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(776.2804947916666)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1011.1860961914062)), (np.float64(2557.212890625), np.float64(1011.1860961914062)), (np.float64(2557.212890625), np.float64(776.2804947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 184, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '5acb5719a9649051a8994d512edf7be3', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '0bf6775c467c20b7086bc7996abacb73'}, page_content="• Minimum MODCOD — The network's minimum MODCOD is the lowest (least spectrally efficient) MODCOD supported by the Velocity network. The Minimum MODCOD on the DVB-S2 outbound is QPSK 1/4. Although the minimum MODCOD value is a global value that applies to all iNets, iNets can have different configured Minimum MODCODS."), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9398254752159119, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1057.009661458333)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1230.8004150390625)), (np.float64(2626.940786458333), np.float64(1230.8004150390625)), (np.float64(2626.940786458333), np.float64(1057.009661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 184, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '5acb5719a9649051a8994d512edf7be3', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '043270a4802f36f03dea953a2e32cc6a'}, page_content="• Base MODCOD — The lowest MODCOD at which an application's CIR/MIR is honored in DVB-S2/ACM. The satellite terminal can still operate in rain fade all the way down to the network's minimum MODCOD. See following detailed description."), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.926449179649353, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(561.7111206054688), np.float64(1271.289794921875)), (np.float64(561.7111206054688), np.float64(1449.258544921875)), (np.float64(2463.74267578125), np.float64(1449.258544921875)), (np.float64(2463.74267578125), np.float64(1271.289794921875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 184, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '5acb5719a9649051a8994d512edf7be3', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '08dfc4610fe43ffd4c2dc4d21e197445'}, page_content='• Nominal MODCOD (for GSPs) — The nominal MODCOD is the estimated average operating MODCOD for all satellite terminals in a group. Nominal MODCOD is only available in the downstream direction.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9317962527275085, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1489.9735107421875)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1667.0669531249998)), (np.float64(2627.7428697916666), np.float64(1667.0669531249998)), (np.float64(2627.7428697916666), np.float64(1489.9735107421875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 184, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '5acb5719a9649051a8994d512edf7be3', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '4d12bd911645b7ea86967365e1e32e1a'}, page_content="• Operating MODCOD — The operating MODCOD refers to the satellite terminal's real-time operating point. Under normal operation, a satellite terminal's operating MODCOD is expected to be above the base MODCOD."), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9449146389961243, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(554.3967895507812), np.float64(1709.7313232421875)), (np.float64(554.3967895507812), np.float64(2011.3194580078125)), (np.float64(2577.503286458333), np.float64(2011.3194580078125)), (np.float64(2577.503286458333), np.float64(1709.7313232421875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 184, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '5acb5719a9649051a8994d512edf7be3', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': 'dae105efb089bc0a6b09a4e63f4535bf'}, page_content='• Minimum Efficiency — The ratio of IP bits per symbol — above which the GSP is expected to operate. If the current operating efficiency of the GSP falls below the configured efficiency, then the aggregate CIR/MIR of the GSP is scaled down on the downstream. This parameter applies only when operating in the IP-based mode. See IP Efficiency Operation on page 177.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.5771826505661011, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(856.40625), np.float64(2096.072161458333)), (np.float64(856.40625), np.float64(2206.650286458333)), (np.float64(2556.2480781249997), np.float64(2206.650286458333)), (np.float64(2556.2480781249997), np.float64(2096.072161458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 184, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'f95ef906de099369fdf94c2e5f2400ff'}, page_content='NOTE: See the following sections for detailed descriptions of Base MODCOD, Operating MODCOD, and Nominal MODCOD.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8282503485679626, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(849.4579467773438), np.float64(2245.5513281249996)), (np.float64(849.4579467773438), np.float64(2356.1294531249996)), (np.float64(2596.7532864583336), np.float64(2356.1294531249996)), (np.float64(2596.7532864583336), np.float64(2245.5513281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 184, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '43208a416ef4316a9932791b84b9391d'}, page_content='The Nominal MODCOD parameter applies only when operating in Symbol-based mode.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8894520401954651, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(559.70458984375), np.float64(2485.792421875)), (np.float64(559.70458984375), np.float64(2539.276796875)), (np.float64(1176.0780029296875), np.float64(2539.276796875)), (np.float64(1176.0780029296875), np.float64(2485.792421875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 184, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '1791073960d3f89d55854592a41e5016'}, page_content='Scaled Information Rate'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9361836910247803, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(563.0225219726562), np.float64(2582.306396484375)), (np.float64(563.0225219726562), np.float64(2881.129453125)), (np.float64(2635.2168281249997), np.float64(2881.129453125)), (np.float64(2635.2168281249997), np.float64(2582.306396484375))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 184, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '1791073960d3f89d55854592a41e5016', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'c83bf8424a01118f06b6dd73e622cf92'}, page_content='While service plans are configured with a CIR and an MIR in Mbps, the amount of satellite bandwidth (in Msps) consumed will depend on the operating MODCOD of the terminal. Delivering 1 Mbps to a terminal operating at a low and inefficient MODCOD, say QPSK 1/4, will require more symbols (measured in Msps) than delivering the same 1 Mbps to a terminal operating at the more efficient 16PSK 8/9 MODCOD.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.939116895198822, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2927.322161458333)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(3161.8586197916666)), (np.float64(2637.710205078125), np.float64(3161.8586197916666)), (np.float64(2637.710205078125), np.float64(2927.322161458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 184, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '1791073960d3f89d55854592a41e5016', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'c5f7f0955355de99a10885538269bd91'}, page_content='To accommodate this requirement, the number of bytes being requested (demand) in the 100-ms allocation window is converted to a Scaled Information Rate (SIR) with a unit of scaled bytes. Scaled bytes take the MODCOD into account, so as to give a more true measure of the amount of satellite bandwidth (Msps) that is actually used over the air.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9