 'parent_id': 'a1bf6decb802ca638c9b1ef10a9fac47', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'e3056b48403d77ef4da617f9d8986ed7'}, page_content='Single beam restrictions and GSP MODCOD scaling are characteristics of GSPs that both give service providers a more granular control of the amount of bandwidth a GSP uses in each of the beams from which it is allowed to draw bandwidth.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9163720607757568, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(564.9554443359375), np.float64(2234.229921875)), (np.float64(564.9554443359375), np.float64(2287.714296875)), (np.float64(1186.716796875), np.float64(2287.714296875)), (np.float64(1186.716796875), np.float64(2234.229921875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 187, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': 'fa9ff418af14baed44b49bb2f68c97cf'}, page_content='Single Beam Restrictions'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9426530599594116, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2328.640380859375)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2629.566953125)), (np.float64(2616.290771484375), np.float64(2629.566953125)), (np.float64(2616.290771484375), np.float64(2328.640380859375))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 187, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'fa9ff418af14baed44b49bb2f68c97cf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '871ada9c2e9122634fcfff148049ab9f'}, page_content='The single beam restrictions parameter defines the maximum CIR/MIR allowed for a GSP in a single beam. This restriction is used to avoid a situation where too many satellite terminals with high demand from one GSP are in a single beam. The system allows the configuration of a default maximum CIR/MIR for a GSP, which applies to all beams. The system allows exceptions for specific beams.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8994863629341125, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.1712646484375), np.float64(2679.0215885416665)), (np.float64(568.1712646484375), np.float64(2732.5059635416665)), (np.float64(1088.7222900390625), np.float64(2732.5059635416665)), (np.float64(1088.7222900390625), np.float64(2679.0215885416665))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 187, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': 'c7901e214608a27356bf36dccaa82bd9'}, page_content='GSP MODCOD Scaling'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9472665190696716, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2774.744873046875)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(3074.3586197916666)), (np.float64(2632.9928697916666), np.float64(3074.3586197916666)), (np.float64(2632.9928697916666), np.float64(2774.744873046875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 187, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'c7901e214608a27356bf36dccaa82bd9', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'de36d66f171303ff255b38ab8dfcef00'}, page_content='As described in Outbound (DVB-S2) QoS on page 149, the GSP configuration includes a nominal MODCOD that is used to scale the CIR/MIR commitment in Mbps to scaled bytes. (For additional information on scaled bytes, see Scaled Information Rate on page 150.) However, not all beams offer the same signal performance, and for a set of beams with widely varying signal performance a single nominal MODCOD field is not appropriate.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9342788457870483, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(554.7281494140625), np.float64(3120.5513281249996)), (np.float64(554.7281494140625), np.float64(3417.066953125)), (np.float64(2638.169953125), np.float64(3417.066953125)), (np.float64(2638.169953125), np.float64(3120.5513281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 187, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'c7901e214608a27356bf36dccaa82bd9', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '8d59d58c2c5fd2ec89cd4ce12d0120ba'}, page_content='CIR/MIR configurations in the outbound direction for GSPs, using GSP MODCOD scaling, allow service providers to offer the same quality of service across satellite beams with different capabilities, while managing the configurati