8-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 189, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'e425c3b7d188fe910a710a24ea6b1893', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '275c3920ce41481bac61e2bb8cdc5235'}, page_content="The objective is to select a nominal MODCOD for the GSP that, on average, represents the expected efficiency of the bandwidth consumption in all of the GSP's children nodes that demand and consume bandwidth in the outbound direction."), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8927890062332153, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(845.1770833333333), np.float64(659.6138281249998)), (np.float64(845.1770833333333), np.float64(894.1502864583334)), (np.float64(2576.701203125), np.float64(894.1502864583334)), (np.float64(2576.701203125), np.float64(659.6138281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 189, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '0bdca6a795c086bbf93b2d5467d0bc8b'}, page_content='NOTE: iDirect does not guarantee the following process is always the optimum method for determining nominal MODCOD values. Each satellite operator or service provider must evaluate the process and make adjustments or changes to fit individual use cases and service models.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8891605138778687, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(825.3674926757812), np.float64(933.0513281249998)), (np.float64(825.3674926757812), np.float64(1105.6086197916668)), (np.float64(2571.609130859375), np.float64(1105.6086197916668)), (np.float64(2571.609130859375), np.float64(933.0513281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 189, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'bc7e44f6cc4399e92475b32663d5bf7f'}, page_content='Furthermore, it is likely that the nominal MODCOD value will be adjusted periodically as more historical usage data from specific satellite networks and customers is compiled.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8931673765182495, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1235.2715885416665)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1288.7559635416667)), (np.float64(827.5681784059375), np.float64(1288.7559635416667)), (np.float64(827.5681784059375), np.float64(1235.2715885416665))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 189, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '2f1bd6ce20dd069b59725570300998c6'}, page_content='Procedure'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9484432339668274, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1334.0929947916666)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1692.587786458333)), (np.float64(2637.255615234375), np.float64(1692.587786458333)), (np.float64(2637.255615234375), np.float64(1334.0929947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 189, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '2f1bd6ce20dd069b59725570300998c6', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '21daeee2a0ae3aac365910086f571f56'}, page_content='This procedure is provided to aid in planning services. It is based on certain initial assumptions and the accuracy and correctness of the outcome relies on the variance between the assumptions and the real performance of the satellite terminals (the SSPCs on the satellite terminals) and their efficiency when consuming bandwidth. This procedure also assumes the availability of high quality raw data about the performance of the different types of satellite terminals being used in all of the satellite beams.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9492109417915344, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(563.545166015625), np.float64(1738.7804947916663)), (np.float64(563.545166015625), np.float64(2221.2336197916666)), (np.float64(2630.061279296875), np.float64(2221.2336197916666)), (np.float64(2630.061279296875), np.float64(1738.7804947916663))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 189, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '2f1bd6ce20dd069b59725570300998c6', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'aadd5c0ab4667dd336ac4b4599e6763f'}, page_content='This procedure calculates the nominal and average MODCOD of a GSP used for satellite terminals that have similar performance (typically being the same RF Terminal Type). It depends upon the availability of certain raw information regarding the performance of a satellite terminal of a specific type in each of the satellite beams included in the geoscope of the GSP. In addition, an MDA (multi-destination link budget analysis) for each of the satellite beams must have been performed. The result of this MDA is a two dimensional grid. Each point on the grid represents a geographic coordinate for which the link budget analysis (LBA) has been performed and the expected C/N value is known.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9525153040885925, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.2940063476562), np.float64(2261.87646484375)), (np.float64(567.2940063476562), np.float64(2627.005615234375)), (np.float64(2639.0449531249997), np.float64(2627.005615234375)), (np.float64(2639.0449531249997), np.float64(2261.87646484375))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 189, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '2f1bd6ce20dd069b59725570300998c6', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '7faf45349fcdf00f01ac5c491f2a60d8'}, page_content='• Nominal MODCOD Calculation — The procedure requires an initial estimate of the distribution of the CIR in Mbps across all of the satellite beams in the GSP. The procedure also requires the calculation of the average MODCOD for each satellite beam. It assumes the average MODCODs have already been calculated and the CIR required by the customer is already known. The nominal MODCOD is calculated as illustrated in the diagram, for a GSP containing ten beams.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.4264669418334961, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(341.8460998535156), np.float64(3509.238037109375)), (np.float64(341.8460998535156), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(1941.9613037109375), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(1941.9613037109375), np.float64(3509.238037109375))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 189, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '2f1bd6ce20dd069b59725570300998c6', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '33d0cf944b5e63ea611a443277b617a7'}, page_content='ST Engineering iDirect Proprietary | Confidentiality: Public Technical Reference Guide | iDirect Velocity™ | T0001665 | Revision 1'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.3881322145462036, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(2544.864583333333), np.float64(3514.3013281249996)), (np.float64(2544.864583333333), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(2624.75634765625), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(2624.75634765625), np.float64(3514.3013281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 189, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filena