p.float64(568.75), np.float64(1448.8638281249998)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1512.1551513671875)), (np.float64(1733.72216796875), np.float64(1512.1551513671875)), (np.float64(1733.72216796875), np.float64(1448.8638281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 192, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'fde02ee5b8233dd21eea6e703e814f48', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '90e0097c275cc48602ae77389636383e'}, page_content='4.5.6.1 Inbound (Adaptive TDMA) QoS'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9433031678199768, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1552.973876953125)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1853.0044531249998)), (np.float64(2617.753286458333), np.float64(1853.0044531249998)), (np.float64(2617.753286458333), np.float64(1552.973876953125))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 192, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '90e0097c275cc48602ae77389636383e', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '34d5a728de144dae4620b79bb57fd57a'}, page_content='GBWM on the inbound behaves differently than on the outbound. On the outbound, there is a single DVB-S2 channel for each iNet that is shared by all satellite terminals. The MODCOD can be changed frame-by-frame. At any point in time, the aggregate bandwidth (in Mbps) delivered by the entire outbound will vary depending on the operating MODCOD at each satellite terminal.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9514662027359009, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1896.544189453125)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2330.5528385416665)), (np.float64(2634.268911458333), np.float64(2330.5528385416665)), (np.float64(2634.268911458333), np.float64(1896.544189453125))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 192, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '90e0097c275cc48602ae77389636383e', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'c23a91febc6277a24937f8f04fdb933c'}, page_content='The upstream is governed by the Adaptive TDMA (A-TDMA) algorithm. The set of inroute channels is the inroute group, and the set of fixed MODCODs configured for those inroute channels is the inroute group composition (IGC). The adaptive algorithm dynamically assigns a nominal carrier to each satellite terminal based on its current C/N0, which is the carrier with the highest C/N0 threshold at which the satellite terminal can be assigned bursts. The satellite terminal may be assigned bursts on its nominal carrier, or any other carrier with a lower C/N0 threshold.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9389362931251526, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2365.8638281249996)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2538.4211197916666)), (np.float64(2579.326203125), np.float64(2538.4211197916666)), (np.float64(2579.326203125), np.float64(2365.8638281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 192, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '90e0097c275cc48602ae77389636383e', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '286409db4e5d85cb20fcbc41aebcbb13'}, page_content='For details on the Adaptive TDMA algorithm, see Differentiating C/N0 and C/N on page 103. What is important to note is that the aggregate throughput (in Mbps) delivered by a set of inbound carriers only changes when the inroute group composition (IGC) is changed.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9417259693145752, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2584.6138281249996)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2881.129453125)), (np.float64(2629.069580078125), np.float64(2881.129453125)), (np.float64(2629.069580078125), np.float64(2584.6138281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 192, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '90e0097c275cc48602ae77389636383e', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'a9c854875d908846e0f1f9323abff4ad'}, page_content='The aggregate throughput (Mbps) of the outbound will vary according to the signal conditions at each of the individual satellite terminals it serves. However, on the inbound signal, conditions at each of the individual satellite terminals drives the selection of one of the IGC. Each IGC has a fixed throughput (Mbps) corresponding to the bandwidth, MODCOD, and length of each TDMA slot.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9433479309082031, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(566.71875), np.float64(2927.322161458333)), (np.float64(566.71875), np.float64(3347.7961197916666)), (np.float64(2643.023193359375), np.float64(3347.7961197916666)), (np.float64(2643.023193359375), np.float64(2927.322161458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 192, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '90e0097c275cc48602ae77389636383e', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'd359cd87c579c8c1777e0bf12971b2e9'}, page_content='The satellite terminal in the inbound direction has a nominal carrier at any instance of time. The nominal carrier, one of the carriers in the currently-used IGC, is the most efficient carrier the satellite terminal can use in any given location based on a number of constraints, including the C/N0 level received at the SAS from the satellite terminal. It has a peak IP rate that will provide an upper bound on the MIR that SSPCs on that satellite terminal can transmit at any given time. The satellite terminal is deemed to be in a fade condition if it is transmitting on a carrier less efficient than its configured nominal carrier.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.3282395005226135, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(353.6458333333333), np.float64(3514.3013281249996)), (np.float64(353.6458333333333), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(431.5389709472656), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(431.5389709472656), np.float64(3514.3013281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 192, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '90e0097c275cc48602ae77389636383e', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'b3b98c90d21e0d530e884450a633d159'}, page_content='158'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.5280093550682068, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(1059.2979736328125), np.float64(3508.665771484375)), (np.float64(1059.2979736328125), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(2633.35986328125), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(2633.35986328125), np.float64(3508.665771484375))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 192, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '90e0097c275cc48602ae77389636383e', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'cfff4f1cd22d440f7b03ef2d32c0be97'}, page_content='ST Engineering iDirect Proprietary | Confidentiality: Public Technical Reference Guide | iDirect Velocity™ | T0001665 | Revision 1'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9219280481338501, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(1694.40380859375), np.float64(251.28049479166657)), (np.float64(1694.40380859375), np.float64(299.87945312500017)), (np.float64(2634.533935546875), np.float64(299.87945312500017)), (np.float64(2634.533935546875), np.float64(251.28049479166657))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 193, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Header', 'element_id': '951f15a5a5efddf96ad866b7092862a9'}, page_content='4.5.6.2 Nominal MODCOD (for GSPs only)'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9201759696006775, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(391.57216145833326)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(454.75445312499966)), (np.float64(1812.58251953125), np.float64(454.75445312499966)), (np.float64(1812.58251953125), np.float64(391.57216145833326))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 193, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '951f15a5a5efddf96ad866b7092862a9', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '430ee4a39e55b091abba30b57dcced2c'}, page_content='4.5.6.2 Nominal MODCOD (for GSPs only)'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8930068612098694, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(562.5619506835938), np.float64(499.1971614583332)), (np.float64(562.5619506835938), np.float64(547.7961197916668)), (np.float64(1803.7783203125), np.float64(547.7961197916668)), (np.float64(1803.7783203125), np.float64(499.1971614583332))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 193, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '430ee4a39e55b091abba30b57dcced2c', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '67d430a078d5aa321be2b3dfad4ffc20'}, page_content="There is no 'Nominal MODCOD defined for inbound GSPs."), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9258416295051575, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(635.8429947916666)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(699.025286458333)), (np.float64(2203.205463339635), np.float64(699.025286458333)), (np.float64(2203.205463339635), np.float64(635.8429947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 193, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '951f15a5a5efddf96ad866b7092862a9', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': 'e17e51e5e98c31512d5137d2f2d685f4'}, page_content='4.5.6.3 Inbound Fairness Base Bitrate (for SSPCs only)'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9444692730903625, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(563.4822387695312), np.float64(743.4679947916666)), (np.float64(563.4822387695312), np.float64(1101.9627864583335)), (np.float64(2591.517578125), np.float64(1101.9627864583335)), (np.float64(2591.517578125), np.float64(743.4679947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 193, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'e17e51e5e98c31512d5137d2f2d685f4', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '50993f6b05cce45a64c835b2bae207d2'}, page_content='For each SSPC the service provider can decide whether or not to scale the CIR/MIR values in fade conditions (as determined by whether the satellite terminal is operating below its nominal carrier). If that scale value is set to zero, no scaling is done. If it is set to another value, that value is compared to the peak IP rate for the current nominal carrier. If the configured value is greater than the peak rate, a scaling factor equal to the ratio of the configured rate to the peak rate is applied to both the configured CIR and MIR values.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9406781792640686, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1148.1554947916666)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1382.6919531249998)), (np.float64(2606.633494791667), np.float64(1382.6919531249998)), (np.float64(2606.633494791667), np.float64(1148.1554947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 193, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'e17e51e5e98c31512d5137d2f2d685f4', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'de5c2417833ae61c19e5ddbb6c4b520f'}, page_content='For example, if the configured rate, known as base-bit-rate, is 500 Kb/s and the peak IP rate is 300 Kb/s, then, the CIR/MIR values are scaled down by a factor of 0.6 (300/500). If the peak rate was 600 Kb/s, then no scaling down is applied, as 600/500 is greater than one. Scaling is done only at the SSPC level: no other scaling is done in the higher GQE tree nodes.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9379794001579285, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(563.5360107421875), np.float64(1428.884661458333)), (np.float64(563.5360107421875), np.float64(1601.4419531249998)), (np.float64(2555.518911458333), np.float64(1601.4419531249998)), (np.float64(2555.518911458333), np.float64(1428.884661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 193, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'e17e51e5e98c31512d5137d2f2d685f4', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '3174ef6c00b332c02364f49c7f184f68'}, page_content='The modulation and coding of an A-TDMA carrier used by the satellite terminal determines the amount of satellite bandwidth consumed to provide a given information rate. For additional details, refer to Inbound (Adaptive TDMA) QoS on page 158.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9422572255134583, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1647.634661458333)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1882.1711197916663)), (np.float64(2629.419953125), np.float64(1882.1711197916663)), (np.float64(2629.419953125), np.float64(1647.634661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 193, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'e17e51e5e98c31512d5137d2f2d685f4', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '4004b76f083d2a9c97fbec60b93cd021'}, page_content='Each subscriber service plan component (SSPC) may be configured with a base bitrate. An SSPC operating on a nominal carrier with a peak data rate (in Kbps) lower than the configured base bitrate is deemed to be in fade. When in fade, the current CIR and MIR are scaled down as follows:'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.7826547622680664, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.8292236328125), np.float64(1928.3638281249998)), (np.float64(567.8292236328125), np.float64(1989.54443359375)), (np.float64(1597.209228515625), np.float64(1989.54443359375)), (np.float64(1597.209228515625), np.float64(1928.3638281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 193, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'e17e51e5e98c31512d5137d2f2d685f4', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '57003be24bd65d91a89edf69c8cbec3f'}, page_content='If (Peak Data RateNominal Carrier < base_bitrate)'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(674.4791666666666), np.float64(2017.7961197916666)), (np.float64(674.4791666666666), np.float64(2077.2403385416665)), (np.float64(2269.9498387416666), np.float64(2077.2403385416665)), (np.float64(2269.9498387416666), n