: {'points': ((np.float64(343.79541015625), np.float64(251.28049479166657)), (np.float64(343.79541015625), np.float64(299.87945312500017)), (np.float64(1435.8072509765625), np.float64(299.87945312500017)), (np.float64(1435.8072509765625), np.float64(251.28049479166657))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 206, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Header', 'element_id': '100c95fea6e2fba7bedee25d1debbc2c'}, page_content='4.6.4.4 Allocation Fairness Relative to MODCOD'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9240158200263977, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(565.4151000976562), np.float64(393.08408854166646)), (np.float64(565.4151000976562), np.float64(446.56846354166674)), (np.float64(1832.758544921875), np.float64(446.56846354166674)), (np.float64(1832.758544921875), np.float64(393.08408854166646))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 206, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '100c95fea6e2fba7bedee25d1debbc2c', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '5f56bab1c099974933fadd223f57a046'}, page_content='Allocation Fairness Relative to Operating MODCOD'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9413127303123474, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(491.9054947916665)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(788.4211197916668)), (np.float64(2596.574951171875), np.float64(788.4211197916668)), (np.float64(2596.574951171875), np.float64(491.9054947916665))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 206, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '5f56bab1c099974933fadd223f57a046', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'd499ebfb7207e18e03f0db98ec228733'}, page_content='Allocation fairness relative to operating MODCOD applies an internal cost parameter to each SSPC based on the current operating MODCOD of the satellite terminal on which the SSPC resides. This option is best used in a mobile environment, where the base MODCOD for the satellite terminal may be the same but the operating MODCODs are different depending upon the location of the satellite terminal relative to the beam.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9381550550460815, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(566.3504028320312), np.float64(834.6138281249998)), (np.float64(566.3504028320312), np.float64(1131.129453125)), (np.float64(2614.4355781249997), np.float64(1131.129453125)), (np.float64(2614.4355781249997), np.float64(834.6138281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 206, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '5f56bab1c099974933fadd223f57a046', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '047fb96eafd6030568fe1fa892ccb133'}, page_content="The system provides a mode of operation that supports bits/sec allocation in DVB-S2/ACM, which is based on the satellite terminal's operating MODCOD. This option comes into play under contention for the CIR and allocation of bursting traffic above the CIR up to the MIR. It allows all terminals in the group to be treated equally regardless of their operating MODCOD, permitting fair bits/sec allocation, as long as they are operating above their base MODCOD."), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9432751536369324, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1177.322161458333)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1473.837786458333)), (np.float64(2629.237661458333), np.float64(1473.837786458333)), (np.float64(2629.237661458333), np.float64(1177.322161458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 206, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '5f56bab1c099974933fadd223f57a046', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'f182c425231904f86daa4a820912d990'}, page_content='For this example, two satellite terminals with the same antenna size, same base MODCOD of QPSK 3/4, and same CIR of 1M each have an SSPC in the same GSP. One satellite terminal is in the beam center while the other is at the beam edge. Because of the difference in the SNR between the beam center and the beam edge, the two satellite terminals are operating at different MODCODs.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9444370865821838, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), n