e IP-based service option is only entered after the network operator decides to switch the QoS Service Mode to IP-based and applies the change. Choosing this mode enables Service Providers to create and configure unicast GSPs with CIR/MIR specified in Mbps. In addition to this, QoS stats can be monitored in Mbps without over-the-air overhead.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9446622133255005, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(565.6021118164062), np.float64(1977.71484375)), (np.float64(565.6021118164062), np.float64(2275.9211197916666)), (np.float64(2640.138703125), np.float64(2275.9211197916666)), (np.float64(2640.138703125), np.float64(1977.71484375))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 210, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'b53ff42cebc5655a5fccbfd2e3f29a9b', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '0074bb3dc062d1cbfb2e5ad9086df937'}, page_content='Although multicast GSPs may be configured while operating in IP-based service option, operators must still configure the multicast MODCOD in the multicast SSPP, and multicast traffic still reports Stats that include over-the-air overhead. The multicast base MODCOD, specified in the multicast SSPP, is still required and used for the streams operating in IP-based service mode.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8799306154251099, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2321.9560546875)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2370.712786458333)), (np.float64(214