4e9a904704bf55af75d'}, page_content="The operator can support two (2) 'N' NGSO satellites with an N+1 gateway redundancy scheme. As the Active antenna changes, the operator controls which Velocity RF Gateway is assigned to which satellite via API calls. From Velocity's perspective, this is similar to Geosynchronous Satellites, except that the time required for the HEO RFS to make the switch is minimal."), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.4270394444465637, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(342.08843994140625), np.float64(3509.26611328125)), (np.float64(342.08843994140625), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(1942.735595703125), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(1942.735595703125), np.float64(3509.26611328125))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 233, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'ab3943bf0114b2710d9ec74c0a76e174', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'dc7d6d73ba496553b8a11ae12f8b6084'}, page_content='ST Engineering iDirect Proprietary | Confidentiality: Public Technical Reference Guide | iDirect Velocity™ | T0001665 | Revision 1'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(2544.864583333333), np.float64(3514.3013281249996)), (np.float64(2544.864583333333), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(2621.302391602708), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(2621.302391602708), np.float64(3514.3013281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_mo