), np.float64(1707.1711197916663)), (np.float64(2561.1328125), np.float64(1707.1711197916663)), (np.float64(2561.1328125), np.float64(1472.634661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 241, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '65f8be4155e477d5ccb9d74d4d70c01e', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '233df4e4161e9d2844eebfe3b5ddbe2e'}, page_content='The line card switchover process in the iDirect Velocity network is designed to avoid any network interruptions and to allow smooth network operations during hardware failures or manual switchover. Each line card is assigned to an IF domain, and line card redundancy is provided within an IF domain. An active line card supports one iNet.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9409008622169495, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.6690063476562), np.float64(1753.3638281249998)), (np.float64(567.6690063476562), np.float64(1987.900286458333)), (np.float64(2625.399169921875), np.float64(1987.900286458333)), (np.float64(2625.399169921875), np.float64(1753.3638281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 241, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '65f8be4155e477d5ccb9d74d4d70c01e', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '3fb269205a9241000585bd09c07c594f'}, page_content='Both ULCs and ILCs are assigned to IF Domains that model the physical connection between line cards a