ackbone network, as shown in the diagram.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.7801870107650757, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(1067.9375), np.float64(1952.6086197916666)), (np.float64(1067.9375), np.float64(2001.2075781249998)), (np.float64(2125.7011902528643), np.float64(2001.2075781249998)), (np.float64(2125.7011902528643), np.float64(1952.6086197916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 256, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'FigureCaption', 'element_id': '76ecbfeb9a2b5745793612e1c5f2fb42'}, page_content='Figure 6-1. Pulse NMS Distributed Components'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8726794719696045, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(566.1819458007812), np.float64(2090.1465885416665)), (np.float64(566.1819458007812), np.float64(2158.214296875)), (np.float64(1260.90771484375), np.float64(2158.214296875)), (np.float64(1260.90771484375), np.float64(2090.1465885416665))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 256, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '49785cd9eda79923052b7ebc4d067c72'}, page_content='6.1.1 The NOC NMS'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9492941498756409, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(562.6177368164062), np.float64(2198.45263671875)), (np.float64(562.6177368164062), np.float64(2622.2752864583335)), (np.float64(2632.6282864583336), np.float64(2622.2752864583335)), (np.float64(2632.6282864583336), np.float64(2198.45263671875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 256, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '49785cd9eda79923052b7ebc4d067c72', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '459b4c5dbebaae03ae101335e968dd4b'}, page_content='The NOC NMS is responsible for normal operational management of the entire network managed by Pulse. It is also responsible for maintaining the master copy of the configuration database for the network, monitoring events from all network elements, collecting historical stats from all SAS NMSs, collecting real-time global QoS statistics, and storing stats long-term. It is also responsible for generating thresholding events from received stats, storing stats short-term, and storing received events. In addition, the SAS NMS is responsible for latency measurements and connectivity for troubleshooting network elements.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9249841570854187, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(562.5106201171875), np.float64(2667.041015625)), (np.float64(562.5106201171875), np.float64(2779.0461197916666)), (np.float64(2612.79736328125), np.float64(2779.0461197916666)), (np.float64(2612.79736328125), np.float64(2667.041015625))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 256, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '49785cd9eda79923052b7ebc4d067c72', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '9a5cfccc756f8c7ce2a4a81c6f4fcdbf'}, page_content='Finally, the NOC NMS generates alarms from received events and statistics, and provides EAP user account access interfaces to the EAP NMS for control and reporting to external systems.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8615643978118896, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2870.3549218749995)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2938.4226302083325)), (np.float64(1854.2696302083332), np.float64(2938.4226302083325)), (np.float64(1854.2696302083332), np.float64(2870.3549218749995))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 256, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '943d17fb0b152dc2b1397eb7b0bb2acb'}, page_content='6.1.2 The NMS External Access Portal'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9395604729652405, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(566.9425659179688), np.float64(2979.22509765625)), (np.float64(566.9425659179688), np.float64(3278.525286458333)), (np.float64(2593.2168281249997), np.float64(3278.525286458333)), (np.float64(2593.2168281249997), np.float64(2979.22509765625))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 256, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '943d17fb0b152dc2b1397eb7b0bb2acb', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '26892aa3196f9e7194da40da80de0fc2'}, page_content='An External Access Portal (EAP) to the NMS, which resides outside of the primary NOC, is responsible for providing NMS functionality for all users and systems that are external to the service provider. The Global Bandwidth Manager is located at the NOC, but it is not an integral part of the Pulse NMS. The EAP also supports limited access to NMS services for service providers and end-customers.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(353.6458333333333), np.float64(3514.3013281249996)), (np.float64(353.6458333333333), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(430.0836416027083), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(430.0836416027083), np.float64(3514.3013281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 256, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '943d17fb0b152dc2b1397eb7b0bb2acb', 'category': 'UncategorizedText', 'element_id': 'af8de9211a3797d95dea247872af220d'}, page_content='222'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.5095426440238953, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(1066.559326171875), np.float64(3507.04345703125