tent='After successfully entering a user name and password, users are authenticated by the system, the NMS establishes a user session, and the web interface opens to the configured landing page. The user account or user group determines the landing page to which the NMS opens.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9339221119880676, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1501.8013281249998)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1674.3586197916663)), (np.float64(2633.131591796875), np.float64(1674.3586197916663)), (np.float64(2633.131591796875), np.float64(1501.8013281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 258, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'e6ed14e009cee25e0a9a9d00ae185f20', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'ce8a0303fc08977809a93484a0da212f'}, page_content='User access privileges are based on the access privileges of a user’s assigned user roles and user groups. This provides a very fine grained access control. Machine-to-machine access uses the same users and user permission system.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9352924227714539, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1720.5513281249998)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1955.087786458333)), (np.float64(2619.638671875), np.float64(1955.087786458333)), (np.float64(2619.638671875), np.float64(1720.5513281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 258, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'e6ed14e009cee25e0a9a9d00ae185f20', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'fd00b2c277005ca2ef5a51f922520f0a'}, page_content='User sessions in which there is no activity for 30 minutes, or some other configured duration, are automatically terminated and logged out. Activity is considered any action that directly causes the browser to load contents from the server or triggers the normal asynchronous communication from the browser to the NMS server.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8594323992729187, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2046.211181640625)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2114.464296875)), (np.float64(2163.0127985586455), np.float64(2114.464296875)), (np.float64(2163.0127985586455), np.float64(2046.211181640625))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 258, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'c1967c3b75007a45eceae819dcb435a3', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '603820e1e68e0276388fe63bd364cfd2'}, page_content='6.2.3 NMS Web UI for Configuration and Control'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9481633305549622, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.2911376953125), np.float64(2158.0513281249996)), (np.float64(567.2911376953125), np.float64(2455.28564453125)), (np.float64(2641.233154296875), np.float64(2455.28564453125)), (np.float64(2641.233154296875), np.float64(2158.0513281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 258, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '603820e1e68e0276388fe63bd364cfd2', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '22eb112f798c175f20e79cb003e94b07'}, page_content='Primary access to the iDirect Velocity network is via a graphical web-based user interface. The NMS user interface supports simultaneous access by multiple users with defined access permissions and views. The web interface supports configuration and control, monitoring, and reporting capabilities for terminals and for all of the iDirect infrastructure, for example , chassis and line cards, protocol processors, and NMS servers.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.941710352897644, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2500.759661458333)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2859.254453125)), (np.float64(2616.562255859375), np.float64(2859.254453125)), (np.float64(2616.562255859375), np.float64(2500.759661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 258, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '603820e1e68e0276388fe63bd364cfd2', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'e416ab35f636d50eb799364594878738'}, page_content='The NMS web user interface employs a layered hierarchical model in which configurable NMS elements are grouped into collections of related elements. Of the many element domains, represented in the NMS, the Physical, Transport, Network, and Service domains form the primary infrastructure of the Velocity network. Together, these domains provide essential services to the Satellite Terminal domain. In turn, the Satellite Terminal domain provides IP connectivity between each remote LAN and the SAS.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8739272356033325, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.7886352539062), np.float64(2902.322998046875)), (np.float64(567.7886352539062), np.float64(2954.0461197916666)), (np.float64(2249.4287109375), np.float64(2954.0461197916666)), (np.float64(2249.4287109375), np.float64(2902.322998046875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 258, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '603820e1e68e0276388fe63bd364cfd2', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'ccc38f3f1989b6d03f89c50f0960ddc1'}, page_content='The Pulse Web-based user interface is split into a number of separate areas:'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9340478777885437, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(579.4556884765625), np.float64(2997.485107421875)), (np.float64(579.4556884765625), np.float64(3173.9921875)), (np.float64(2612.05517578125), np.float64(3173.9921875)), (np.float64(2612.05517578125), np.float64(2997.485107421875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '20