ty. Group permissions determine which generic functions its members can perform and exactly what elements upon which these functions may be performed.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9293491840362549, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(725.2388281249998)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(835.8169531250002)), (np.float64(2634.352783203125), np.float64(835.8169531250002)), (np.float64(2634.352783203125), np.float64(725.2388281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 260, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '541eda9c487af6c48fede838bd893348', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '7e2509eef7320d8123f3f7fa512e8807'}, page_content='Visibility determines what group members are able to view or see in the NMS. Each user group and its members can be isolated from one another, with each having privacy from all others.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9416794776916504, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(566.5809326171875), np.float64(882.0096614583332)), (np.float64(566.5809326171875), np.float64(1178.5252864583335)), (np.float64(2620.524119791666), np.float64(1178.5252864583335)), (np.float64(2620.524119791666), np.float64(882.0096614583332))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 260, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '541eda9c487af6c48fede838bd893348', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '150337a7dbc960b86657cc14048416be'}, page_content='As user accounts are defined, each user is assigned membership to one or more user groups. Group membership, in turn, manages user access to the NMS. More specifically, the user group prevents users from gaining access or visibility outside of what has been allowed or assigned by the permissions assigned to the group. In essence, the user group constrains what elements a user can access.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9386899471282959, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1224.7179947916666)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1459.2544531249998)), (np.float64(2581.914744791666), np.float64(1459.2544531249998)), (np.float64(2581.914744791666), np.float64(1224.7179947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 260, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '541eda9c487af6c48fede838bd893348', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'e5432175370cd38085d423d382fc587a'}, page_content='A user role is a specific set of defined permissions that can be assigned to a user. It defines what functionality, within the NMS, can be seen or used by the user to which the role is assigned. Since roles are assigned at the creation of the user account, the user role must already exist.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9393790364265442, 'is_extracted':