erational requirements. Should a physical host fail, the platform’s high availability system, if configured, will restart the virtual machines on other physical hosts. After the virtual machines have restarted, Pulse integrates them back into the cluster and resume operations.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8646800518035889, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1808.0513281249998)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1856.650286458333)), (np.float64(2388.7197265625), np.float64(1856.650286458333)), (np.float64(2388.7197265625), np.float64(1808.0513281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 261, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'f9ba0679cfd3edd24e29dda859f4687e', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '23340130adbde84794274dd4d8aab271'}, page_content='An example architecture for a Pulse deployment is shown in the following diagram.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.5930651426315308, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(1085.0552978515625), np.float64(2983.928466796875)), (np.float64(1085.0552978515625), np.float64(3036.74267578125)), (np.float64(2104.5988959774472), np.float64(3036.74267578125)), (np.float64(2104.5988959774472), np.float64(2983.928466796875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 261, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpnt