 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '75c0aa5a330f920b154ffa461cb9bd7c'}, page_content='As part of the Pulse design, all communication is encrypted using Transport Layer Security (TLS). This encryption includes external communication through the Internet, as well as internal machine-to-machine communication within iDirect Pulse itself.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9228602051734924, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(725.2388281249998)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(835.8169531250002)), (np.float64(2621.1074531249997), np.float64(835.8169531250002)), (np.float64(2621.1074531249997), np.float64(725.2388281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 262, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '4e8e44253f8283e3cc0817c31b411123', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'e3f74e3698fbb26f99b99000f835e939'}, page_content='By default, the system implements an internal authentication process that enforces password rules and validates users into the system through a login process.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.949684202671051, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(564.9284057617188), np.float64(882.0096614583332)), (np.float64(564.9284057617188), np.float64(1302.4836197916668)), (np.float64(2634.7793281249997), np.float64(1302.4836197916668)), (np.float64(2634.7793281249997), np.float64(882.0096614583332))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 262, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '4e8e44253f8283e3cc0817c31b411123', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'cf467c4540c73bf10a30a98dc6aac1cf'}, page_content='Once a user is within the system, iDirect Pulse restricts each user’s access on a “need to know” basis through a highly customizable user-groups-and-role-based mechanism. Users accessing the system via the API and users with the same permissions accessing the system via the web-based user interface are considered equivalent and will have the same options. Each user is granted visibility only to authorized network elements, and within those network elements, is only authorized for the functions they need to perform their duties. In addition, the NMS logs all user-initiated updates.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(353.6458333333333), np.float64(3514.3013281249996)), (np.float64(353.6458333333333), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(430.0836416027083), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(430.0836416027083), np.float64(3514.3013281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 262, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '4e8e44253f8283e3cc0817c31b411123', 'category': 'UncategorizedText', 'element_id': 'f7fff545bb4b8a06806581a4d9651219'}, page_content='228'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf'