erface to all configuration data and enforces data validation and integrity. It is also responsible for generating option files for all network elements and forwarding them to the Update Manager for distribution.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9256249666213989, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1286.697161458333)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1459.2544531249998)), (np.float64(2621.550537109375), np.float64(1459.2544531249998)), (np.float64(2621.550537109375), np.float64(1286.697161458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 264, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'adca201960a12fde7056a3b9798da64d', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '9cdcca3eb99d42317e638ed59a6485de'}, page_content='The configuration manager runs in read/write mode on the NOC site only. Each SAS also has a configuration manager installed, and running in read-only mode. The SAS configuration manager stays in sync with the primary NOC using replication.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9466667175292969, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1505.447161458333)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1863.9419531249998)), (np.float64(2633.722036458333), np.float64(1863.9419531249998)), (np.float64(2633.722036458333), np.float64(1505.447161458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 264, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'adca201960a12fde7056a3b9798da64d', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '469b15051e533e87584618d6cbbd0bde'}, page_content='Changes to the configuration of the network are first stored as pending changes. These changes can then be applied, which pushes the changes to the network equipment via the Update Manager. Any pending changes are shown in the web-based user interface, to allow an operator to view what will change when changes are applied. Changes may also be viewed through the Impact Analysis tool, which shows which network elements will be affected by applying a change.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9471002221107483, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.711181640625), np.float64(1910.134661458333)), (np.float64(567.711181640625), np.float64(2269.166015625)), (np.float64(2613.7392578125), np.float64(2269.166015625)), (np.float64(2613.7392578125), np.float64(1910.134661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 264, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'adca201960a12fde7056a3b9798da64d', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'ffe16978212d9ac9741765e5276cd8a2'}, page_content='Incomplete or inconsistent changes may be saved in a pending state. This allows an operator to make a series of changes and save the intermediate steps. To ensure that the active configuration is always consistent, the full configuration will be checked before allowing the operator to apply the change. This step also performs validation checks to ensure the configuration being applied to the network passes business rules. A log of all changes is stored, together with the user who made the change and the time.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9483380317687988, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2314.4951171875)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2735.2961197916666)), (np.float64(2626.9043281249997), np.float64(2735.2961197916666)), (np.float64(2626.9043281249997), np.float64(2314.4951171875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 264, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'adca201960a12fde7056a3b9798da64d', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'f8f00b62aba5f66b6950b517473fb968'}, page_content='It is possible to “undo” any change, provided that undoing the change leaves the network in a consistent, valid state. Undo is implemented by changing values in the pending configuration back to their previous values. This allows an operator to see the effect of the undo and make any further required changes before applying the change to the network. Once a change is applied, it can be undone by making necessary changes based on the latest changes in the activity logs. Any changes will still be processed through the validation logic to ensure the network stays in a consistent state.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9116380214691162, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(565.9918212890625), np.float64(2780.3173828125)), (np.float64(565.9918212890625), np.float64(2892.066953125)), (np.float64(2600.4560546875), np.float64(2892.066953125)), (np.float64(2600.4560546875), np.float64(2780.3173828125))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 264, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'adca201960a12fde7056a3b9798da64d', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '8044bcf12c22707ca5f4a1ad8d8185ec'}, page_content='Every entity configurable through the web-based user interface or Web Services have one of the following configuration statuses:'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9098174571990967, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(587.8939208984375), np.float64(2934.584716796875)), (np.float64(587.8939208984375), np.float64(3048.837786458333)), (np.float64(2583.14990234375), np.float64(3048.837786458333)), (np.float64(2583.14990234375), np.float64(2934.584716796875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 264, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'adca201960a12fde7056a3b9798da64d', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': 'fd3ac302e4cf8f2f876e280478e97cdb'}, page_content='Nominal — There are no outstanding changes to this element, and all previous changes have been applied to the network.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': 