tors with a variety of ways to access to operational and statistical performance information about the Velocity network Operators are able to access network overview and performance data as well as drill down to individual physical and logical network elements, such as line cards, satellite terminals servers, and service plans.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9434138536453247, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(566.0095825195312), np.float64(2613.7804947916666)), (np.float64(566.0095825195312), np.float64(2910.2961197916666)), (np.float64(2637.081787109375), np.float64(2910.2961197916666)), (np.float64(2637.081787109375), np.float64(2613.7804947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 269, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'e280e361336a52cd33b3ababa6aea1e5', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '1640f0b303018184dc73d5d2270a715a'}, page_content='NMS monitoring and reporting tools support the viewing and management of network events, alarms, and incidents, as well as a variety of network Status and Statistics data, using both real-time and historical reports. Retrieved stats and operational information can be viewed in a variety of forms, for example log views, status views, and analytical views that provide visualization using pie charts, bar graphs, and line charts.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.934620201587677, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2956.4888281249996)), (np.float64(5