sis, based on configuration.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9335592985153198, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(668.7577514648438), np.float64(960.0135498046875)), (np.float64(668.7577514648438), np.float64(1258.7336197916668)), (np.float64(2626.764892578125), np.float64(1258.7336197916668)), (np.float64(2626.764892578125), np.float64(960.0135498046875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 280, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '27b3f2b44b48a6535a6fcfcaad25cecc', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '9447d6eb9321b97586b8d554296c4565'}, page_content='• Transmission Control Protocol (TCP) Acceleration — TCP acceleration mitigates the side effects of the long-latency satellite hop by owning the end-to-end connection and splitting the sliding window protocol into three segments: two terrestrial links (between the communicating devices and the iDirect network), and the over the air link (between iDirect endpoints).'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8686097860336304, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(670.0223999023438), np.float64(1296.7242431640625)), (np.float64(670.0223999023438), np.float64(1347.519775390625)), (np.float64(1683.6380995878644), np.float64(1347.519775390625)), (np.float64(1683.6380995878644), np.float64(1296.7242431640625))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number