N is identified on the remote LAN by the VLAN tag of the incoming data. Each SVN has its own independent IP address space, and thus the same IP address may be used in different SVNs — but only in different SVNs. Based on the configuration, each SVN interface is assigned either an IPv4 or an IPv6 address. However, the management SVN must be an IPv4 address. For more information, refer to About Satellite Virtual Networks on page 45.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9062272310256958, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(3270.030494791666)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(3380.6086197916666)), (np.float64(2526.097036458333), np.float64(3380.6086197916666)), (np.float64(2526.097036458333), np.float64(3270.030494791666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 280, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '8cfc22f04e11c39f424d32d6c146df1f', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'ea1f9f41ba3d8292c536202f4cf7896c'}, page_content='The following information is configurable for each of the SVNs configured on the satellite router:'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.40548714995384216, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(351.36090087890625), np.float64(3514.3013281249996)), (np.float64(351.36090087890625), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(430.9872741699219), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(430.9872741699219), np.float64(3514.3013281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_