_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '6ac85b7589e3776119290b4f3524653c', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'bb7edb7eac13f94d0c7b92b818a235a6'}, page_content='IP features such as BGP, HTTP acceleration, DNS caching, DHCP, RADIUS (Remote Authentication Dial-In Service), TCP acceleration, payload compression, and SIP ALG are all enabled and configured per SVN. For more information on these various protocols, see the following sections for a brief description, or for more detailed descriptions, see Chapter 2 , Velocity System Operations on page 33.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9209359884262085, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1164.4888281249998)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1227.6711197916663)), (np.float64(1483.642578125), np.float64(1227.6711197916663)), (np.float64(1483.642578125), np.float64(1164.4888281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 281, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '6ac85b7589e3776119290b4f3524653c', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '1d6c3c6e27c9562a4e26907b109e6faa'}, page_content='7.3.3.2 Domain Name System'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9499109387397766, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1269.3641357421875)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1568.6294531249998)), (np.float64(2617.1699531249997), np.float64(1568.6294531249998)), (np.float64(2617.1699531249997), np.float64(1269.3641357421875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 281, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '1d6c3c6e27c9562a4e26907b109e6faa', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'b4a9d6a52a70d01d9415f015cf36e275'}, page_content='The satellite router implements a local DNS cache. The satellite router may be configured with a primary and secondary DNS server address for relaying requests for caching. Support for resolving IPv4 and IPv6 addresses is provided. An independent DNS cache is maintained on the satellite router per each SVN instance on the satellite router. For more detail, refer to Velocity Data Traffic Protocols on page 71.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9196821451187134, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1656.6763281249998)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1719.8586197916666)), (np.float64(1769.08544921875), np.float64(1719.8586197916666)), (np.float64(1769.08544921875), np.float64(1656.6763281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 281, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '6ac85b7589e3776119290b4f3524653c', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '202ea04e1361a0f8b6e643d584768a99'}, page_content='7.3.3.3 Caching and HTTP Acceleration'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.928857684135437, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1764.3013281249998)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1874.8794531249998)), (np.float64(2617.313232421875), np.float64(1874.8794531249998)), (np.float64(2617.313232421875), np.float64(1764.3013281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 281, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '202ea04e1361a0f8b6e643d584768a99', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '0dde753b1723dfc74df8f83f906f2544'}, page_content='The satellite router accelerates web traffic and caches data locally in order to avoid the long satellite delay for frequently accessed pages and objects.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9505227208137512, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1921.072161458333)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2341.5461197916666)), (np.float64(2639.384521484375), np.float64(2341.5461197916666)), (np.float64(2639.384521484375), np.float64(1921.072161458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 281, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '202ea04e1361a0f8b6e643d584768a99', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '91aa6dcfb1593e9c7a91bcc8600c9abd'}, page_content='TCP handshake acceleration and DNS caching speed up web access. Both should be enabled for Web traffic, whether caching is used or not. TCP handshake acceleration allows the HTTP get request to be sent before the TCP three-way handshake is completed (see Transmission Control Protocol (TCP) on page 72. DNS caching avoids sending a DNS address resolution message over the satellite link to resolve the name (URL) in the HTTP get request. This may be needed for the main page and all embedded objects. The caching software is linked to the iDirect DNS caching server.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9323976039886475, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2387.7388281249996)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2488.02001953125)), (np.float64(2624.59814453125), np.float64(2488.02001953125)), (np.float64(2624.59814453125), np.float64(2387.7388281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 281, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '202ea04e1361a0f8b6e643d584768a99', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '8bd349546dd5a1edbe1343e381723f89'}, page_content='For more details about HTTP Acceleration and caching, see Velocity Data Traffic Protocols on'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2449.7179947916666)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2498.316953125)), (np.float64(754.9504010416666), np.float64(2498.316953125)), (np.float64(754.9504010416666), np.float64(2449.7179947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 281, 'file_dir