updates are only allowed if they match the version specified in the NMS. It also ensures that if someone modifies the software locally, without authorization, the NMS will override it.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9266266822814941, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(723.3429947916666)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(786.525286458333)), (np.float64(1504.5032958984375), np.float64(786.525286458333)), (np.float64(1504.5032958984375), np.float64(723.3429947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 284, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'c4023f790c57781971898556d9605905', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '06b7326838abcb7beba4a26a97970dd8'}, page_content='7.3.4.2 Configuration Updates'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9421612620353699, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(830.9679947916665)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1127.4836197916668)), (np.float64(2650.382568359375), np.float64(1127.4836197916668)), (np.float64(2650.382568359375), np.float64(830.9679947916665))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 284, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '06b7326838abcb7beba4a26a97970dd8', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '3bd62ca7f5b8fec345691f2f094507e4'}, page_content='The operator modifies the configuration of the terminal, services, etc. using the Pulse NMS UI and/or API. When the changes are activated, the NMS pushes the resulting config modifications in the form of one or more options files to the terminal (and the PP). An operator can also place an option file on the terminal using the Terminal WUI. This is typically used during commissioning or installation.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9353129863739014, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1173.6763281249998)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1284.254453125)), (np.float64(2649.619140625), np.float64(1284.254453125)), (np.float64(2649.619140625), np.float64(1173.6763281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 284, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '06b7326838abcb7beba4a26a97970dd8', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'd23dc195b1de24aed6091e664e342754'}, page_content='The NMS periodically verifies that the terminal’s configuration matches what the operator has activated. If it does not, the NMS pushes the correct configuration to the terminal.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9506366848945618, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(565.4108276367188), np.float64(1330.447161458333)), (np.float64(565.4108276367188), np.float64(1688.9419531249998)), (np.float64(2622.9541015625), np.float64(1688.9419531249998)), (np.float64(2622.9541015625), np.float64(1330.447161458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 284, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '06b7326838abcb7beba4a26a97970dd8', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '76d746957c1f7a13472aa6ce89802a97'}, page_content='If a terminal receives an invalid remote configuration file (falcon.json) it has the ability to self-recover into the network using its previous known good configuration. When a terminal receives a configuration file and successfully comes into network using it, the terminal stores a backup copy of the configuration file. Then, if the terminal receives another new configuration file and is unable to acquire into the network using it, the terminal reverts to the backup configuration file. This protects against:'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1735.134661458333)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1783.7336197916663)), (np.float64(607.6595364583333), np.float64(1783.7336197916663)), (np.float64(607.6595364583333), np.float64(1735.134661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 284, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '06b7326838abcb7beba4a26a97970dd8', 'category': 'UncategorizedText', 'element_id': 'a2e6fe7995ba90b18188e27e9b09e4bf'}, page_content='•'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9370955228805542, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(580.3906860351562), np.float64(1735.134661458333)), (np.float64(580.3906860351562), np.float64(1907.6919531249998)), (np.float64(2625.5553697916666), np.float64(1907.6919531249998)), (np.float64(2625.5553697916666), np.float64(1735.134661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 284, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '06b7326838abcb7beba4a26a97970dd8', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': 'ce00042a6694316358cbe8ce1fbc23eb'}, page_content='A Missing/Corrupt Remote Configuration File: When the terminal comes into the network using the backup file, it remains in the network using that file until the operator pushes a new configuration file (falcon.json) using the NMS.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9383365511894226, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(562.7554321289062), np.float64(1953.884661458333)), (np.float64(562.7554321289062), np.float64(2250.400286458333)), (np.float64(2637.9512031249997), np.float64(2250.400286458333)), (np.float64(2637.9512031249997), np.float64(1953.884661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 284, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '06b7326838abcb7beba4a26a97970dd8', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '1f9787fcfd38cf7a17228b282f0399e5'}, page_content='• An Invalid Remote Configuration File: This occurs when it contains a misconfiguration that prevents the terminal from coming into network, such as the LNB LO being set to a value the LNB does not support. In this case, the terminal alternates between the backup file and the new invalid configuration file based on the resiliency timeout until either a corrected configuration file is pushed by the Operator, or the LNB is modified.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9393080472946167, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(563.247802734375), np.float64(2296.5929947916666)), (np.float64(563.247802734375), np.float64(2531.129453125)), (np.float64(2650.70263671875), np.float64(2531.129453125)), (np.float64(2650.70263671875), np.float64(2296.5929947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 284, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '06b7326838abcb7beba4a26a97970dd8', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'fa816a6ed97febe8dc90e2d49a1d036c'}, page_content='If an invalid remote configuration file is sent, an event and alarm are generated to indicate to the NOC operator that the terminal had to use a backup configuration file to acquire into the network. A NOC operator can use this information to review any recent changes they have made on the terminal(s) and correct the configuration causing problem.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9312256574630737, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(