25c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9407320022583008, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(565.281005859375), np.float64(400.7596614583332)), (np.float64(565.281005859375), np.float64(573.3169531250002)), (np.float64(2573.966828125), np.float64(573.3169531250002)), (np.float64(2573.966828125), np.float64(400.7596614583332))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 287, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '8f01d86403ceef29f84e409258477c48', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '7bdea87291d431578e66566ad449bc17'}, page_content='The BUC interface may be tailored to the application by selection of interface type (RS-422 serial or UDP over Ethernet). This standard is designed to be extensible for vendor-specific enhancements.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9529903531074524, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(619.5096614583332)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1101.9627864583335)), (np.float64(2638.7897447916666), np.float64(1101.9627864583335)), (np.float64(2638.7897447916666), np.float64(619.5096614583332))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 287, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '8f01d86403ceef29f84e409258477c48', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'f3d4056727914f9adfa45e3e0272404d'}, page_content='This interface plays a key role in setup, calibration, and installation. When the terminal is initializing, the satellite router obtains the BUC serial number and calibration data using OpenBMIP. During installation, the installer will instruct the satellite router to perform, using OpenBMIP, an auto-calibration procedure designed to determine the loss in the IFL cable across the operational frequency range. The results of this calibration procedure, along with the BUC calibration data, provides the information needed to properly control transmit power without the need for a commissioning procedure that would require over-the-air transmissions to the SAS.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9412557482719421, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(566.5309448242188), np.float64(1148.1554947916666)), (np.float64(566.5309448242188), np.float64(1320.7127864583335)), (np.float64(2559.03515625), np.float64(1320.7127864583335)), (np.float64(2559.03515625), np.float64(1148.1554947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 287, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '8f01d86403ceef29f84e409258477c48', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '34c4bcefdde833d6af59b9c8a0f5dc32'}, page_content='Similarly, the OpenBMIP interface also plays a role during acquisition. The BUC determines the max power value, and communicates it to the terminal via BMIP, which allows the acquisition burst to be more accurate and margin to be smaller.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9407281279563904, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(561.8696899414062), np.float64(1366.9054947916666)), (np.float64(561.8696899414062), np.float64(1601.4419531249998)), (np.float64(2590.081411458333), np.float64(1601.4419531249998)), (np.float64(2590.081411458333), np.float64(1366.9054947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 287, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '8f01d86403ceef29f84e409258477c48', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'c78dad1a3258d24c4878c6977663a074'}, page_content='The OpenBMIP interface continues to be vital during normal operation, while the terminal is in network and the BUC is transmitting live data. During this time, the satellite router continually obtains the BUC current temperature, which is needed when using the BUC calibration data to accurately set transmit power.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8872849345207214, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1691.8392968749997)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1752.6153385416665)), (np.float64(1736.9866943359375), np.float64(1752.6153385416665)), (np.float64(1736.9866943359375), np.float64(1691.8392968749997))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 287, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '8f01d86403ceef29f84e409258477c48', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': 'f3707faa7dc9b11c010795fd92446af4'}, page_content='Satellite Terminal and BUC Identification'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9440504908561707, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1797.1138281249998)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2093.6294531249996)), (np.float64(2611.9560546875), np.float64(2093.6294531249996)), (np.float64(2611.9560546875), np.float64(1797.1138281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 287, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'f3707faa7dc9b11c010795fd92446af4', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '0fcc7b7fc1fa4697c41230ac0e20c924'}, page_content='The satellite router identifies the BUC by querying its ID and type information via OpenBMIP. This information is stored on the router. The satellite router software reads this information and sends it to the SAS where it may be used for confirmation that the components of the terminal are acceptable for operation in the network before admission of the terminal into the Velocity network.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8451957702636719, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(284.2438049316406), np.float64(2178.2998046875)), (np.float64(284.2438049316406), np.float64(2275.1923828125)), (np.float64(2246.530029296875), np.float64(2275.1923828125)), (np.float64(2246.530029296875), np.float64(2178.2998046875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 287, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '8f01d86403ceef29f84e409258477c48', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': 'b9c42321bae54d0ffb7b81bfac174421'}, page_content='7.5 Terminal Installation and Commissioning'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.933499276638031, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2316.587158203125)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2553.004453125)), (np.float64(2640.44287109375), np.float64(2553.004453125)), (np.float64(2640.44287109375), np.float64(2316.587158203125))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 287, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'b9c42321bae54d0ffb7b81bfac174421', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '031c0910b6f81bebaa7d8cd8b5f9b22d'}, page_content='After a subscriber satellite terminal is installed, it is ready for commissioning so that it can be acquired into the Velocity network. The satellite terminal type determines whether the satellite terminal is pre-calibrated at the factory or if it needs calibration during commissioning. For information on commissioning, refer to the Terminal Web UI User Guide.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9284554719924927, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2598.9697265625)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2771.754453125)), (np.float64(2609.387939453125), np.float64(2771.754453125)), (np.float64(2609.387939453125), np.float64(2598.9697265625))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 287, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'b9c42321bae54d0ffb7b81bfac174421', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '534f7880c4e58c9a0fe380d5628636c9'}, page_content='The commissioning process ensures the satellite terminal configuration and hardware are set up properly and will not cause interference or disruption of service after the satellite terminal acquires into the Velocity network.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8590808510780334, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2854.845458984375)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2931.130963541666)), (np.float64(2084.603271484375), np.float64(2931.130963541666)), (np.float64(2084.603271484375), np.float64(2854.845458984375))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 287, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '8f01d86403ceef29f84e409258477c48', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '205a92f9abce2c651ee2ec382f157f08'}, page_content='7.5.1 Installation and Commissioning Process'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9324953556060791, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2967.603515625)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(3147.275286458333)), (np.float64(25