libration. If the BUC does not support OpenBMIP, the installer will need to manually determine the P1dB Compression Point.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9146814942359924, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1368.6204833984375)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1481.5518798828125)), (np.float64(2602.1337890625), np.float64(1481.5518798828125)), (np.float64(2602.1337890625), np.float64(1368.6204833984375))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 288, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '92f69166442d7ef3e854664acb1938b9', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '6fe2055611d3f6bb0ed11c661b5a6166'}, page_content='6. For satellites using linear polarization, a cross-polarization alignment can be performed to ensure proper cross-polarization isolation.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8407002687454224, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1515.9581298828125)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1569.873291015625)), (np.float64(2216.63427734375), np.float64(1569.873291015625)), (np.float64(2216.63427734375), np.float64(1515.9581298828125))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 288, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '92f69166442d7ef3e854664acb1938b9', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': 'f8b9641e7a663ff4f1e04246979b3ad1'}, page_content='7. Satellite terminal is ready for acquisition and begins network process.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9477689862251282, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(566.0176391601562), np.float64(1614.822161458333)), (np.float64(566.0176391601562), np.float64(1974.0372314453125)), (np.float64(2619.72705078125), np.float64(1974.0372314453125)), (np.float64(2619.72705078125), np.float64(1614.822161458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 288, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '92f69166442d7ef3e854664acb1938b9', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '5d0b0e6ebcba9a413a0dbe4823304f22'}, page_content='A terminal will not attempt to acquire until it has been commissioned using either the One- Touch procedure or a manual procedure. Subsequent changes to the install that would affect the results of the commissioning procedure, such as replacing the transmit IFL cable, will require that the terminal be re-commissioned before it is allowed to acquire back into the network. The terminal will not be able to enforce this after such changes have been made — so, in this case it will be up to the installer to ensure the terminal is re-commissioned.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9163846969604492, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2061.3638281249996)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2124.5461197916666)), (np.float64(1853.9276123046875), np.float64(2124.5461197916666)), (np.float64(1853.9276123046875), np.float64(2061.3638281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 288, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '92f69166442d7ef3e854664acb1938b9', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': 'f850cf9f3bcecc195bd1204766af8b41'}, page_content='7.5.1.1 Terminals with OpenAMIP Support'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9490382075309753, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2165.47314453125)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2527.4836197916666)), (np.float64(2640.6491197916666), np.float64(2527.4836197916666)), (np.float64(2640.6491197916666), np.float64(2165.47314453125))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 288, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'f850cf9f3bcecc195bd1204766af8b41', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '419d2fbb53fe3d8ad79d7be81efb9547'}, page_content='Support for OpenAMIP and support for OpenBMIP are orthogonal when it comes to their effects on the installation/commissioning process. Terminals that support OpenAMIP will auto-point their antennas, with little to no interaction required of the installer. The installer may be required to enter initial downstream parameters into the iDirect Web interface or directly into the ACU. Terminals that do not support OpenAMIP will require the installer to manually point the antenna.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9051356911659241, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2615.5304947916666)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2678.7127864583326)), (np.float64(1853.74951171875), np.float64(2678.7127864583326)), (np.float64(1853.74951171875), np.float64(2615.5304947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 288, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '92f69166442d7ef3e854664acb1938b9', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '71335254237efdd71327d754980501d5'}, page_content='7.5.1.2 Terminals with OpenBMIP Support'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9492247104644775, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(562.0222778320312), np.float64(2722.314208984375)), (np.float64(562.0222778320312), np.float64(3143.629453125)), (np.float64(2635.3626614583336), np.float64(3143.629453125)), (np.float64(2635.3626614583336), np.float64(2722.314208984375))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 288, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '71335254237efdd71327d754980501d5', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '6e5bb094795492a2591a50a856cfc530'}, page_content='For terminals equipped with a BUC that supports OpenBMIP, the Velocity commissioning process does not involve any NOC operators or any tests requiring the transmission of a continuous wave (CW) to the satellite or a Pseudo random bit sequence (PRBS) pattern. The installer performs the installation of the antenna and, when activated, a One-Touch Calibration process prior to the satellite router acquiring into the Velocity network. Terminals that do not support OpenBMIP require the installer to perform a procedure to measure the P1dB compression point, which will involve the transmission of a CW to the satellite.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.25020888447761536, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(351.5220947265625), np.float64(3514.3013281249996)), (np.float64(351.5220947265625), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(433.39739990234375), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(433.39739990234375), np.float64(3514.3013281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 288, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '71335254237efdd71327d754980501d5', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '603acf921ba34d74a24cca08246ad34d'}, page_content='254'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.5242485404014587, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(1061.5546875), np.float64(3508.86669921875)), (np.float64(1061.5546875), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(2629.720703125), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(2629.720703125), np.float64(3508.86669921875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 288, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '71335254237efdd71327d754980501d5', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '964501edc344b52404b52da2a87536a6'}, page_content='ST Engineering iDirect Proprietary | Confidentiality: Public Technical Reference Guide | iDirect Velocity™ | T0001665 | Revision 1'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9183915257453918, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(1929.8489583333335), np.float64(251.28049479166657)), (np.float64(1929.8489583333335), np.float64(299.87945312500017)), (np.float64(2627.23388671875), np.float64(299.87945312500017)), (np.float64(2627.23388671875), np.float64(251.28049479166657))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 289, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Header', 'element_id': '25f84dab95c4ebe478e306a296ff6e1b'}, page_content='7.5.1.3 One-Touch Calibration'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9337106347084045, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(391.57216145833326)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(454.75445312499966)), (np.float64(1512.490478515625), np.float64(454.75445312499966)), (np.float64(1512.490478515625), np.float64(391.57216145833326))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 289, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '25f84dab95c4ebe478e306a296ff6e1b', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': 'ef01a2d17e958d9ca86f3af5de1b9cd2'}, page_content='7.5.1.3 One-Touch Calibration'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9488871097564697, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(499.1971614583332)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(857.9385375976562)), (np.float64(2623.9147447916666), np.float64(857.9385375976562)), (np.float64(2623.9147447916666), np.float64(499.1971614583332))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 289, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'ef01a2d17e958d9ca86f3af5de1b9cd2', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '3721ae9ed87cf183dd408f4525b2a39c'}, page_content="Some iDirect terminals have been designed to support a one-touch calibration process. This is a process where a satellite terminal can be commissioned with a single-click from the browser. The process is completely automated and requires no transmissions over the air to complete the calibration of the terminal's transmit power. The process requires a BUC that supports OpenBMIP, comes equipped with a built-in means to measure power, and has been calibrated at the factory and loaded with the resulting calibration data."), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9528587460517883, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(903.8846614583332)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1324.3586197916668)), (np.float64(2606.865966796875), np.float64(1324.3586197916668)), (np.float64(2606.865966796875), np.float64(903.8846614583332))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 289, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'ef01a2d17e958d9ca86f3af5de1b9cd2', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '4eb72001317953ca35d822798217265c'}, page_content='The calibration data provides the gain characteristics of the BUC over frequency and temperature. It does not, however, provide any information to the satellite router regarding the loss characteristics of the cable connecting it to the BUC. The cable loss characteristics are determined during One-Touch Calibration through a process where the satellite router mutes the BUC then sequences through transmissions at stepped frequencies and power levels, querying the BUC at each step for the power measurements needed to calculate the cable loss.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9391974210739136, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1370.5513281249998)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1607.0272216796875)), (np.float64(2634.159536458333), np.float64(1607.0272216796875)), (np.float64(2634.159536458333), np.float64(1370.5513281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 289, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'ef01a2d17e958d9ca86f3af5de1b9cd2', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '4b7ce394df036f60b15dfc3de492b47e'}, page_content='If the BUC is ever replaced after having performed One-Touch Calibration, the satellite router will detect the change in the serial number reported by the BUC over OpenBMIP and will automatically re-run the calibration procedure with the new BUC. If, however, the cable is replaced, an installer will need to initiate the procedure from the Web-based user interface.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8650709986686707, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1693.134661458333)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1756.3169531249998)), (np.float64(2447.359375), np.float64(1756.3169531249998)), (np.float64(2447.359375), np.float64(1693.134661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 289, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '25f84dab95c4ebe478e306a296ff6e1b', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '87a0e538a94a0d9cc2582815bfbebb21'}, page_content='7.5.1.4 One-Touch Calibration-Multi-Band Smart BUC Support'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9306517839431763, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1800.759661458333)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1973.3169531249998)), (np.float64(2552.068115234375), np.float64(1973.3169531249998)), (np.float64(2552.068115234375), np.float64(1800.759661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 289, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '87a0e538a94a0d9cc2582815bfbebb21', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '26a8d8c4f7c9803dee8bfb321478fe37'}, page_content='This Multi-Band Smart BUC feature is an enhancement to the One Touch Calibration (OTC) process. This enhancement enables the accurate integration of multi-band Block Up- Converters (BUCs) to Velocity 3.2 and subsequent releases.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9472367167472839, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2019.509661458333)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2378.0044531249996)), (np.float64(2638.023193359375), np.float64(2378.0044531249996)), (np.float64(2638.023193359375), np.float64(2019.509661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 289, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '87a0e538a94a0d9cc2582815bfbebb21', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '4e308a02217be5d8784c64ccf759ff9c'}, page_content='A Smart BUC is one that supports the OpenBMIP interface between the BUC and remote. OTC is a process in which the effect of IF cable network losses between the remote output and the BUC input is taken into account to ensure accurate return path transmission power during installation and commissioning of a terminal. With this enhancement the OTC process, which formerly only supported single-band smart BUCs, now provides increased capability with full- band support of up to 8 BUC bands.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9407809376716614, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2424.197161458333)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2596.754453125)), (np.float64(2632.7734375), np.float64(2596.754453125)), (np.float64(2632.7734375), np.float64(2424.197161458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 289, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '87a0e538a94a0d9cc2582815bfbebb21', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '6d2c690b60b23987fe9e37a0d9ca2c4f'}, page_content='The upstream transmitted power from a terminal must be accurately controlled to ensure the maximum useable link budget, while ensuring that the BUC is operating linearly and that the output transmission power meets federal operating regulations.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9369789958000183, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(561.61279296875), np.float64(2642.947161458333)), (np.float64(561.61279296875), np.float64(2877.4836197916666)), (np.float64(2621.2410883516663), np.float64(2877.4836197916666)), (np.float64(2621.2410883516663), np.float64(2642.947161458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 289, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '87a0e538a94a0d9cc2582815bfbebb21', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '13ea60b6fc83b8ab7c1c9c7a744a1cec'}, page_content='For operation with a Multi-band BUC the terminal must be loaded with an options file (TERMINAL_OPT) that has been generated using Pulse NMS 2.6 or later, and where the BUC has been configured with multiple bands. The BUC band information, added to the TERMINAL_ OPT is required to support a Multi-Band BUC.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.821630597114563, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(807.1006469726562), np.float64(2963.780494791666)), (np.float64(807.1006469726562), np.float64(3074.3586197916666)), (np.float64(2441.0556640625), np.float64(3074.3586197916666)), (np.float64(2441.0556640625), np.float64(2963.780494791666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 289, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '198c0e75000b0c090763146d8cdb2f74'}, page_content='NOTE: Initial implementation of the multiband smart BUC support is for Aviation (Aero) and Maritime applications.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.4611111581325531, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(353.6458333333333), np.float64(3512.002197265625)), (np.float64(353.6458333333333), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(1938.377197265625), np.float64(3628.52