50}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 295, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'cba5349191c085bdbcdd8bd63c245c98', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '865e803b88beaf5011f731d60b42d239'}, page_content='8. The A-TDMA Aggregator process forwards packet to the acquisition process for the iNet.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9271734952926636, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(2967.4263281249996)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(3078.004453125)), (np.float64(2588.189697265625), np.float64(3078.004453125)), (np.float64(2588.189697265625), np.float64(2967.4263281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 295, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'cba5349191c085bdbcdd8bd63c245c98', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '9ce51506be873c1a49b646144069cdc1'}, page_content='9. The process sends a message to the satellite terminal correcting its power, frequency, and timing, as well as assigning an HDLC address to the satellite terminal.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8402904868125916, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(3116.905494791666)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(3165.504453125)), (np.float64(2567.2235047590098), np.float64(3165.504453125)), (np.flo