te terminal access for the particular Satellite Router ID. If so, it sends a forced logout message, and raises a warning on the NMS.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9401965141296387, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1924.7179947916663)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(2097.275286458333)), (np.float64(2606.265485142083), np.float64(2097.275286458333)), (np.float64(2606.265485142083), np.float64(1924.7179947916663))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 297, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '917020ce8d03cc0928854f9a9a69ef46'}, page_content='3. The Satellite Terminal Proxy process checks to see if the satellite terminal access class value is allowed into the iNet. If not, it switches the satellite terminal to another available iNet if available, or sends a forced logout message if no other iNet is available.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9338015913963318, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(2136.1763281249996)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(2433.55322265625)), (np.float64(2611.1907864583336), np.float64(2433.55322265625)), (np.float64(2611.1907864583336), np.float64(2136.1763281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 297, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '28fc6bbe65895f7ef8522688d6fd9467'}, page_content='4. The Satellite Terminal Proxy process consults the Geo-location Server process to see if the satellite terminal is in a permit/deny geographic position. If the satellite terminal is in a deny geographic position, the Satellite Terminal Proxy sends a forced logout message to the satellite terminal with a latitude/longitude bounding box indicating where the satellite terminal is permitted to try again.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.912887692451477, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(2471.5929947916666)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(2582.6337890625)), (np.float64(2507.394287109375), np.float64(2582.6337890625)), (np.float64(2507.394287109375), np.float64(2471.5929947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 297, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '9ac4c7a3f784b175d2082bc95ca87d27'}, page_content='5. The normal load balancing process will move the satellite terminal to a new iNet if necessary.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.43080079555511475, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(341.8025207519531), np.float64(3509.214111328125)), (np.float64(341.8025207519531), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(1941.9403076171875), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (n