 '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'c332af5e63514a27fff9a0469d9a0df5', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '500accc36fa6a5e4af3fe1d275e1ce90'}, page_content='A satellite terminal with beam map information can fail to acquire into an iNet for a number of reasons, such as rain fade, hardware failure, interference, or polarization or frequency mismatch.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8789504766464233, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(563.2098999023438), np.float64(725.2388281249998)), (np.float64(563.2098999023438), np.float64(773.8377864583334)), (np.float64(1105.7132568359375), np.float64(773.8377864583334)), (np.float64(1105.7132568359375), np.float64(725.2388281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 298, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'c332af5e63514a27fff9a0469d9a0df5', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '240a6ff49e6ae12683f618ed05403471'}, page_content='The typical sequence is:'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9405800700187683, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(808.4660034179688)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1109.2637939453125)), (np.float64(2634.159536458333), np.float64(1109.2637939453125)), (np.float64(2634.159536458333), np.float64(808.4660034179688))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 298, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'c332af5e63514a27fff9a0469d9a0df5', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': 'a0f22b2588e5c71b08e3d21e53021516'}, page_content='1. The satellite terminal locks to DVB-S2 downstream, successfully receives return channel information, and sends an acquisition burst. When no reply is received, the satellite terminal begins a random exponential backoff, involving a series of re-tries, with an increasing wait time between. The wait time increases both randomly and exponentially, to minimize the number of collisions when recovering from a complete iNet outage.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9289458394050598, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1148.1554947916666)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1258.7336197916668)), (np.float64(2603.30908203125), np.float64(1258.7336197916668)), (np.float64(2603.30908203125), np.float64(1148.1554947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 298, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'c332af5e63514a27fff9a0469d9a0df5', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '628a3e21f6c527b9aa268b0f18ac24b0'}, page_content='2. After a configured amount of time, the satellite terminal declares a failure to enter the network.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9294710159301758, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1297.634661458333)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1408.212786458333)), (np.float64(2534.5322265625), np.float64(1408.212786458333)), (np.float64(2534.5322265625), np.float64(1297.634661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 298, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'c332af5e63514a27fff9a0469d9a0df5', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '5c19bba18ccc3b595cc46e48d0614a50'}, page_content='3. The satellite terminal begins a round robin attempt to enter all available iNets at its current geo-location, including iNets across all satellites.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1447.1138281249998)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1495.712786458333)), (np.float64(642.9876614583332), np.float64(1495.712786458333)), (np.float64(642.9876614583332), np.float64(1447.1138281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 298, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'c332af5e63514a27fff9a0469d9a0df5', 'category': 'UncategorizedText', 'element_id': 'dc8a74961a39da762ee380a749461515'}, page_content='4.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9302537441253662, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(590.8158569335938), np.float64(1447.1138281249998)), (np.float64(590.8158569335938), np.float64(1557.6919531249998)), (np.float64(2611.559814453125), np.float64(1557.6919531249998)), (np.float64(2611.559814453125), np.float64(1447.1138281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 298, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'c332af5e63514a27fff9a0469d9a0df5', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': 'dd011bfe023236349293d7c71da4ee54'}, page_content='If the satellite terminal fails on all available iNets, the satellite terminal re-tunes to the ASC to receive a new copy of the beam map and returns to Step 3.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8638741970062256, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(845.1770833333333), np.float64(1643.9888281249998)), (np.float64(845.1770833333333), np.float64(1754.5669531249998)), (np.float64(2558.909536458333), np.float64(1754.5669531249998)), (np.float64(2558.909536458333), np.float64(1643.9888281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 298, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '5f9b7dbef6349a31b4515c965aaa657b'}, page_content='NOTE: Once a terminal successfully acquires into an iNet by repeating step 3, it sends events to the NMS to indicate the failure to acquire on previous iNets.'), Docume