is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(528.3638281249998)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(576.9627864583335)), (np.float64(1701.2469281627605), np.float64(576.9627864583335)), (np.float64(1701.2469281627605), np.float64(528.3638281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 299, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '0f534eb1638d2593c21b2185f0adf645', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '46764684934e2287bd6cc1b1ce545db4'}, page_content='There are four satellite terminal operational states:'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9188756346702576, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(623.1554947916666)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(735.3231201171875)), (np.float64(2514.92724609375), np.float64(735.3231201171875)), (np.float64(2514.92724609375), np.float64(623.1554947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 299, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '0f534eb1638d2593c21b2185f0adf645', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '267e9b08f5e96312fcb01f89db682d5f'}, page_content='• Satellite Search — The satellite terminal is looking for an available satellite. In this state, the satellite terminal does not transmit.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9567223787307739, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(563.3984375), np.float64(777.34423828125)), (np.float64(563.3984375), np.float64(1138.4211197916668)), (np.float64(2617.899119791666), np.float64(1138.4211197916668)), (np.float64(2617.899119791666), np.float64(777.34423828125))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 299, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '0f534eb1638d2593c21b2185f0adf645', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': 'cf536fa386ff4e5f0974d585b3d41982'}, page_content='• Locked to Acquisition Signaling Carrier — The signaling carrier is a way to inform terminals of the current satellite network configuration: more specifically - beam footprint and/or parameters such as outbound carrier frequency, symbol rate and/or polarization. However, if the satellite terminal is in a location without a suitable DVB-S2 service channel, it remains in the ASC state and, at intervals, checks whether a suitable service channel is available.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1184.6138281249998)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1233.2127864583335)), (np.float64(607.6595364583333), np.float64(1233.2127864583335)), (np.float64(607.6595364583333), np.float64(1184.6138281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 299, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '0f534eb1638d2593c21b2185f0adf645', 'category': 'UncategorizedText', 'element_id': 'a9e6cfd64f0c42879b1ae965db9d59a2'}, page_content='•'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9379218220710754, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(585.3045043945312), np.float64(1184.6138281249998)), (np.float64(585.3045043945312), np.float64(1357.1711197916668)), (np.float64(2540.056884765625), np.float64(1357.1711197916668)), (np.float64(2540.056884765625), np.float64(1184.6138281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 299, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '0f534eb1638d2593c21b2185f0adf645', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': 'b6a1a6d4b0ba29b9ed07442fa11ef5d3'}, page_content='Acquisition — The satellite terminal has identified a suitable DVB-S2 data carrier. It tunes to that carrier, and communicates with the SAS to authenticate and join the satellite network.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9350517988204956, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(564.5375366210938), np.float64(1403.3638281249998)), (np.float64(564.5375366210938), np.float64(1638.781982421875)), (np.float64(2639.802978515625), np.float64(1638.781982421875)), (np.float64(2639.802978515625), np.float64(1403.3638281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 299, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '0f534eb1638d2593c21b2185f0adf645', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '2f3a0393c19eaaa3c9d862595e76f05c'}, page_content='• Data Communication — The satellite terminal is in this state when it is logged into the network and is sending and receiving data. Because the network uses an A-TDMA scheme, transmissions are in the form of short bursts of varying time, frequency, and power level. The number of bursts depends on the transmitted data.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.940875232219696, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(662.159912109375), np.float64(1676.8013281249998)), (np.float64(662.159912109375), np.float64(1973.3169531249998)), (np.float64(2639.3730781249997), np.float64(1973.3169531249998)), (np.float64(2639.3730781249997), np.float64(1676.8013281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 299, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '0f534eb1638d2593c21b2185f0adf645', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'a62f9cf2056c526028144bcc1660d3c0'}, page_content='In the data communication state, the satellite terminal may switch from one iNet to another. This can occur for load balancing reasons or because the satellite terminal has moved into a different beam. During this transition, the satellite terminal continues to transmit normally; however, at some point the frequency band of the transmissions shifts and the satellite terminal tracks on the new carrier.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_