: {'points': ((np.float64(574.4739583333333), np.float64(1765.14794921875)), (np.float64(574.4739583333333), np.float64(1819.645751953125)), (np.float64(2632.486083984375), np.float64(1819.645751953125)), (np.float64(2632.486083984375), np.float64(1765.14794921875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 301, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'b39976c9033519a2ee4ecd971731cbae'}, page_content='Figure 7-5. Satellite Router Uplink and Downlink Configuration Information and Data Flow'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9250181913375854, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(577.8257446289062), np.float64(1870.9407958984375)), (np.float64(577.8257446289062), np.float64(2046.2336197916663)), (np.float64(2628.4355781249997), np.float64(2046.2336197916663)), (np.float64(2628.4355781249997), np.float64(1870.9407958984375))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 301, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': 'aab988e40fe8130125500872f7621129'}, page_content='Acquisition Signaling Carrier Outbound (Downlink) — The signaling carrier, irrespective of type, is used to broadcast the satellite network beam configuration to the terminals located within the network.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1873.6763281249998)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1922.275286458333)), (np.float64(607.6595364583333), np.float64(1922.275286458333)), (np.float64(607.6595364583333), np.float64(1873.6763281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 301, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'UncategorizedText', 'element_id': '590c1d9079dcb6f47aba46e658d377d2'}, page_content='•'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9290633201599121, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(559.2778930664062), np.float64(2089.445556640625)), (np.float64(559.2778930664062), np.float64(2327.915771484375)), (np.float64(2618.53564453125), np.float64(2327.915771484375)), (np.float64(2618.53564453125), np.float64(2089.445556640625))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 301, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': 'ce7cd5805457be7057585249e27e2bca'}, page_content='• Downlink Data DVB-S2 Carrier — After detecting the ASC, the satellite router locates a suitable DVB-S2 carrier for downlink data. The DVB-S2 carrier is > 1 Msps (typically > 20 Msps), with a minimum operational C/N of -2.0 dB (negative 2 dB). The antenna must be able to track the DVB-S2 carrier down to that signal level.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9302729964256287, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(644.2947387695312), np.float64(2365.8638281249996)), (np.float64(644.2947387695312), np.float64(2662.379453125)), (np.float64(2599.997314453125), np.float64(2662.379453125)), (np.float64(2599.997314453125), np.float64(2365.8638281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 301, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '1dbcacd3b5814b2ed4dfb76f23fdb440'}, page_content='The downlink DVB-S2 carrier encodes and modulates the data at the MODCOD (modulation and coding) that allows the highest efficiency possible given the quality of the RF link at the moment. The satellite router demodulates and decodes the downstream data. Then, satellite terminal proprietary firmware and software reassemble and decrypts the data into IP packets and send it to the Ethernet LAN port.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9449324607849121, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(565.8407592773438), np.float64(2708.572161458333)), (np.float64(565.8407592773438), np.float64(3005.597412109375)), (np.float64(2605.498779296875), np.float64(3005.597412109375)), (np.float64(2605.498779296875), np.float64(2708.572161458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 301, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '9cc8fabd193cb27bbea7cef70229e6e0'}, page_content='• Uplink A-TDMA Carrier — For upstream operation, the satellite router encrypts (when configured to do so), segments, and encapsulates user data from the LAN port using iDirect proprietary software and firmware. The satellite terminal hardware modulates the data for transmission to the satellite. Uplink channels use burst A-TDMA with dynamic frequency hopping across carriers of different symbol rates.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.3672747015953064, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(351.912353515625), np.float64(3508.518310546875)), (np.float64(351.912353515625), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(1940.548828125), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(1940.548828125), np.float64(3508.518310546875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 301, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '0d5f9e7f04abf04bfdb33b9dad598aaa'}, page_content='ST Engineering iDirect Proprietary | Confidentiality: Public Technical Reference Guide | iDirect Velocity™ | T0001665 | Revision 1'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.30962613224983215, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(2544.864583333333), np.float64(3514.3013281249996)), (np.float64(2544.864583333333), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(2625.225830078125), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(2625.225830078125), np.float