: 'ListItem', 'element_id': '7c024e94bc792c75cddac5bee25267e3'}, page_content='11. The Satellite Terminal Proxy creates standard IP packets and passes the IP packets to the IP stack. TCP traffic undergoes processing pertaining to acceleration and compression associated with PEP operations.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8754080533981323, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(612.2179947916666)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(660.8169531250002)), (np.float64(2187.44091796875), np.float64(660.8169531250002)), (np.float64(2187.44091796875), np.float64(612.2179947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 303, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'd1024cf4d53364ebb31e0b2cc223e79b', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': 'f3d5cf7f6095048caec7c3e9bdf9f536'}, page_content='12. The Satellite Terminal Proxy processes the packet according to type.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9288744330406189, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(699.7179947916666)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(810.2961197916668)), (np.float64(2614.836619791667), np.float64(810.2961197916668)), (np.float64(2614.836619791667), np.float64(699.7179947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 303, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5