gured to receive the modulated signal.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9316784143447876, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(562.40576171875), np.float64(743.4679947916666)), (np.float64(562.40576171875), np.float64(854.180419921875)), (np.float64(2531.83837890625), np.float64(854.180419921875)), (np.float64(2531.83837890625), np.float64(743.4679947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 306, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '9afc885fafd2bd50f21052e7b1bd226d', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '3935bde9f798e429b647a2811c3e2536'}, page_content='The inset shows the presence of the carrier, the location of the terminal L1 in the iNet 1 beam, and that the modem is receiving the traffic on Rx1 of a dual-receive modem.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.6756860017776489, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(1113.2916666666665), np.float64(2594.2752864583335)), (np.float64(1113.2916666666665), np.float64(2642.8742447916666)), (np.float64(2080.392468458281), np.float64(2642.8742447916666)), (np.float64(2080.392468458281), np.float64(2594.2752864583335))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 306, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'FigureCaption', 'element_id': 'afa