tch, the terminal logs out of the current SAS site and logs into a new SAS site. This is a complete login, and causes the terminal to land in a new set of PPs at the new SAS site.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9388508796691895, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(559.2584838867188), np.float64(725.2388281249998)), (np.float64(559.2584838867188), np.float64(959.7752864583334)), (np.float64(2578.0866197916666), np.float64(959.7752864583334)), (np.float64(2578.0866197916666), np.float64(725.2388281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 311, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'c998da705168082e113375b0955d553b', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'dcc84bc6bd553f10cfe11e5d03fb676d'}, page_content='In addition to causing sessions to be dropped, re-convergence of the terrestrial network is needed to restore connectivity to the remote. For example, withdrawal of the BGP routes from the original SAS and advertisement of the routes on the new SAS will occur, which will trigger routing updates across the terrestrial network.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.5605006814002991, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(1064.79541015625), np.float64(2422.9211197916666)), (np.float64(1064.79541015625), np.float64(2471.5200781249996)), (np.float64(2126.5122601249477), np.float64(2471.5200781249996)), (np.float64(2126.5122601249477), np.float64(2422.9211197916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_heigh