arent_id': 'da862bfb1bd4967d13030ab1068be9a4', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '79475bcfb17a225c712a88fd0020370f'}, page_content='The load balancing algorithm runs continuously at each SAS and is largely based on two main components. First, there is a decision metric (DM) value that is computed for each terminal, for each candidate beam to which the terminal could be switched; and on an actual congestion indication, which is based on a congestion metric (CM) value that is computed for every iNet. This CM value reflects the total unmet CIR/MIR demand.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9315255880355835, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(871.0721614583332)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(981.6502864583334)), (np.float64(2610.948486328125), np.float64(981.6502864583334)), (np.float64(2610.948486328125), np.float64(871.0721614583332))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 314, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'da862bfb1bd4967d13030ab1068be9a4', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'f9f3bb4fc3a3cfe9f6c00f6412df77f3'}, page_content='Switching decisions between iNets in Velocity are based upon full knowledge of the actual congestion in a candidate iNet/satellite, whether in the same or in a different iNet/satellite.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9090635776519775, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1027.8429947916666)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1076.4419531