iNet. The table also contains a date-time-stamp of when each CM value was sampled and the table constructed.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9435389041900635, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(561.6997680664062), np.float64(911.1763281249998)), (np.float64(561.6997680664062), np.float64(1083.7336197916668)), (np.float64(2590.907958984375), np.float64(1083.7336197916668)), (np.float64(2590.907958984375), np.float64(911.1763281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 315, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'a0fdaa108e805882bbc3b51223c665dc', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '8d67b643a33adb153f285709b0ab9169'}, page_content='After assembling its CM value table, each SAS sends the table to the NOC Global Bandwidth Manager (GBWM), based on a polling interval of every 30 seconds. The NOC will always have the latest CM table of each SAS. This SAS-to-NOC communication is illustrated below.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8227537274360657, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(959.9479166666667), np.float64(2565.1086197916666)), (np.float64(959.9479166666667), np.float64(2613.7075781249996)), (np.float64(2234.564697265625), np.float64(2613.7075781249996)), (np.float64(2234.564697265625), np.float64(2565.1086197916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 315, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'FigureCaption', 'element_id': '3c1a5fab977d5cd7464a0e38db3db051'}, page_content='Figure 7-15. SAS-to-NOC iNet CM Values Communication'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.914516270160675, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(828.385009765625), np.float64(2708.572161458333)), (np.float64(828.385009765625), np.float64(3197.292724609375)), (np.float64(2568.425161458333), np.float64(3197.292724609375)), (np.float64(2568.425161458333), np.float64(2708.572161458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 315, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '39fe35ce2a155f5dadfeb5dd8348fff1'}, page_content='NOTE: The CM values of foreign iNets (not in the same SAS/Satellite) are delayed, on the average, by 30 seconds, compared to the CM values in the local SAS. If during that period, the CM value of the foreign iNet has changed to indicate a congestion condition, then due to the delay in the reporting, the foreign iNet will appear uncongested. The congestion algorithm assumes that the overall system is relatively stable and a large number of such transitions is not expected, and therefore will have minimal impact on the system performance.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.45737406611442566, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(353.6458333333333), np.float64(3510.12255859375)), (np.f