ar/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.929520845413208, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(394.8340885416665)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(462.9017968750001)), (np.float64(1653.4149169921875), np.float64(462.9017968750001)), (np.float64(1653.4149169921875), np.float64(394.8340885416665))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 317, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '38f1a48036532e6e90da7d9ae6edb741', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '3910d093f220dc64db725a5fb250ff33'}, page_content='7.12.3 NOC/SAS Communications'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9499338269233704, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(566.9010620117188), np.float64(506.4888281249999)), (np.float64(566.9010620117188), np.float64(927.1062622070312)), (np.float64(2625.58984375), np.float64(927.1062622070312)), (np.float64(2625.58984375), np.float64(506.4888281249999))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 317, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '3910d093f220dc64db725a5fb250ff33', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '054e752c6e515dbf0d308422ae68a5cd'}, page_content='As a part of congestion management implementation, the same PP process runs on both the SAS and NOC PPs. The function of constructing and distributing the congestion metric (CM) tables, sent from each SAS to the NOC, is managed by the per SAS process; while the function of consolidating the CM data from all of the SASs and redistributing it to each of the SASs, is handled by the corresponding process at the NOC. To ensure system-wide awareness of the congestion metrics, a version of this same process runs on each primary and optional backup SAS, each primary and back-up NOCs, and interfaces with the NOC and at each SAS.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9376078844070435, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(973.1554947916665)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1145.7127864583335)), (np.float64(2621.617869791666), np.float64(1145.7127864583335)), (np.float64(2621.617869791666), np.float64(973.1554947916665))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 317, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '3910d093f220dc64db725a5fb250ff33', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'bc937312b3f9eac157dc717fa5dab9df'}, page_content='The diagram illustrates this intercommunication between all Velocity sites, including primary and optional backups, to facilitate assembly and delivery of system wide congestion values of all iNets in the system to all SASs.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8147217035293579, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(959.9479166666667), np.float64(2014.587786458333)), (np.float64(959.9479166666667), np.float64(2063.1867447916666)), (np.float64(2237.5205078125), np.float64(2063.1867447916666)), (np.float64(2237.5205078125), np.float64(2014.587786458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 317, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'FigureCaption', 'element_id': 'f21b77c75d9dc2d04a8a497364ce6a20'}, page_content='Figure 7-17. SAS-to-NOC iNet CM Values Communication'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9167314767837524, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(845.140625), np.float64(2158.0513281249996)), (np.float64(845.140625), np.float64(2392.587786458333)), (np.float64(2510.0918281249997), np.float64(2392.587786458333)), (np.float64(2510.0918281249997), np.float64(2158.0513281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 317, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'fcfe712928ad975ff7e1c9ddc7fe10d7'}, page_content='NOTE: If, for some brief period, there is an interruption of the SAS-to-NOC communication, then for that period the congestion management algorithm will rely on the local SAS CM data alone until the communication is re- established.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9188572764396667, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2524.0007552083334)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2592.0684635416665)), (np.float64(2211.417724609375), np.float64(2592.0684635416665)), (np.float64(2211.417724609375), np.float64(2524.0007552083334))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 317, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '55f034c9a1ebf3d61ab4e0129b9749df'}, page_content='7.12.4 Determining Congestion Metric (CM) Values'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9471340179443359, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(562.6281127929688), np.float64(2635.6554947916666)), (np.float64(562.6281127929688), np.float64(2994.150286458333)), (np.float64(2635.789794921875), np.float64(2994.150286458333)), (np.float64(2635.789794921875), np.float64(2635.6554947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 317, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '55f034c9a1ebf3d61ab4e0129b9749df', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'f1b2a7c72a3067ac4502e1a569d1488f'}, page_content='Calculation of the congestion metric, is every 30 seconds, and is for upstream and downstream. The averaging algorithm, on which the calculation is based, determines a value that best represents the congestion level of a network. Due to the potential bursty nature of user traffic, averaging is done to reduce messaging chatter and to provide a more stable system behavior. An operator at the NOC NMS can configure congestion control parameters on a per-SAS basis.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.929547131061554, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(561.3439331054688), np.float64(3040.342994791666)), (np.float64(561.3439331054688), np.float64(3150.9211197916666)), (np.float64(2526.907958984375), np.float64(3150.9211197916666)), (np.float64(2526.907958984375), np.float64(3040.342994791666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 317, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '55f034c9a1ebf3d61ab4e0129b9749df', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '8d4605db6ee4664631f98b69ae21bfa6'}, page_content='To understand the congestion metric, it is important to consider the following GSP/SSPC bandwidth allocation properties:'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9241488575935364, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(566.9638061523438), np.float64(3197.1138281249996)), (np.float64(566.9638061523438), np.float64(3307.691953125)), (np.float64(2607.7637031249997), np.float64(3307.691953125)), (np.float64(2607.7637031249997), np.float64(3197.1138281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 317, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '55f034c9a1ebf3d61ab4e0129b9749df', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '03a8a696855208956de0090c888a8640'}, page