age_content='• A map that describes a figure of merit (FOM) for each beam as a function of location'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9044783115386963, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(658.1896362304688), np.float64(1165.839111328125)), (np.float64(658.1896362304688), np.float64(1276.9627864583335)), (np.float64(2544.396728515625), np.float64(1276.9627864583335)), (np.float64(2544.396728515625), np.float64(1165.839111328125))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 324, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '3d1ca923f79de3c646812f8cedf08d5d', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': 'c92576c750301f5b7320ed1afb082aa3'}, page_content='• In the case of different satellite, satellite visibility from terminal’s geo-location, based on the configured look angle parameters'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9544160962104797, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1323.1554947916666)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1805.6086197916663)), (np.float64(2629.2741197916666), np.float64(1805.6086197916663)), (np.float64(2629.2741197916666), np.float64(1323.1554947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 324, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '3d1ca923f79de3c646812f8cedf08d5d', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '1e114eefda0ee5309b31dc12615c4942'}, page_content='Prior to making a beam switch decision, the PP determines the switch mode of all reachable networks, to determine whether to use a Break-before-Make or Make-before-Break switch. If the current beam and target beam have different upstream/downstream polarizations, or if the target beam downstream frequency falls in a different LNB band from the current beam, then a switch to that target will require a BBM switch. Otherwise, an MBB switch can be used. Finally, the PP also takes into consideration whether the RF terminal type is supported by the target beams. As such, network operators can exclude certain terminal types from being allowed to use a specified Beam/iNet.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8398453593254089, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(612.5), np.float64(1880.9679947916663)), (np.float64(612.5), np.float64(1929.5669531249998)), (np.float64(1954.685497840833), np.float64(1929.5669531249998)), (np.float64(1954.685497840833), np.float64(1880.9679947916663))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 324, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '3d1ca923f79de3c646812f8cedf08d5d', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '0a74a531425a12e76c55c25c1bf01dd3'}, page_content='NOTE: Certain remote types always use BBM beam switching.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9294768571853638, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.