26-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 325, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '5053030d286886f1cf5e8fff792b2cd0', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '5e8357fd92d61e9fe5515c10f8bf46b4'}, page_content='A negative DM value for a candidate iNet indicates that the iNet is potentially a new and better home for the remote. The iNet with the most negative DM value is considered the best candidate, to which the terminal could be immediately switched or scheduled to be switched.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9484807252883911, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(566.9593505859375), np.float64(619.5096614583332)), (np.float64(566.9593505859375), np.float64(979.7066650390625)), (np.float64(2623.87255859375), np.float64(979.7066650390625)), (np.float64(2623.87255859375), np.float64(619.5096614583332))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 325, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '5053030d286886f1cf5e8fff792b2cd0', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'd1d9e1830ae20c079ad9a2e14034106e'}, page_content='This metric provides a means of comparing the quality of the link obtainable in each candidate beam and weighing that against the level of congestion being experienced in each candidate iNet. Various configuration parameters allow the balance between link quality and network congestion to be adjusted. The configuration of the FOM map allows for the setting of link quality, and various weights can be configured to control the influence of the types of demand that can be included in the calculation of network congestion.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.930783212184906, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(832.2094116210938), np.float64(1064.3013281249998)), (np.float64(832.2094116210938), np.float64(1485.3536376953125)), (np.float64(2577.466828125), np.float64(1485.3536376953125)), (np.float64(2577.466828125), np.float64(1064.3013281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 325, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '58534415d0b21e68986a628e3a28ffe1'}, page_content='NOTE: The access class is an 8-bit or 40-bit mask configured on individual terminals, as well as on iNets. This is a method by which some iNets can be reserved for use by only certain classes of terminals. For example, exclusive access to an iNet may be given to terminals operated by a government agency. Whether an iNet is usable by a terminal depends on the result of a bitwise logical AND of the iNet access class and the terminal access class. A non-zero result means the iNet is usable.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8916240930557251, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(863.8917846679688), np.float64(1661.9676513671875)), (np.float64(863.8917846679688), np.float64(1834.775286458333)), (np.float64(2598.49072265625), np.float64(1834.775286458333)), (np.float64(2598.49072265625), np.float64(1661.9676513671875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 325, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'aa5c47f64919f6eb04e2e8ce76680699'}, page_content='NOTE: The 40-bit access bitmask option is enabled through a script that is run by iDirect TAC at the request of the customer. Once this feature is enabled by the script, it cannot be disabled.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9239305257797241, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1962.9263281249998)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2026.1086197916666)), (np.float64(1756.6213931193229), np.float64(2026.1086197916666)), (np.float64(1756.6213931193229), np.float64(1962.9263281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 325, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '94fa8bb5ec2d099acb760d9bb6104008'}, page_content='7.12.8.2 Staggered Terminal Switching'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.936876654624939, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(565.3153076171875), np.float64(2070.5513281249996)), (np.float64(565.3153076171875), np.float64(2243.1086197916666)), (np.float64(2614.1074531249997), np.float64(2243.1086197916666)), (np.float64(2614.1074531249997), np.float64(2070.5513281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 325, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '94fa8bb5ec2d099acb760d9bb6104008', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '302df13c125dfeeaf1c1f1b519f9613f'}, page_content='The Velocity enhanced congestion management implementation also leverages an enhanced “staggering algorithm” that ensures switching of terminals to a new iNet/satellite is properly managed to avoid creating congestion in the target iNet.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9437521696090698, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2289.3013281249996)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2585.816953125)), (np.float64(2636.092041015625), np.float64(2585.816953125)), (np.float64(2636.092041015625), np.float64(2289.3013281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 325, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '94fa8bb5ec2d099acb760d9bb6104008', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '8f775c9f7a450c931cad07eeb57bc30e'}, page_content='With the enhancements to the CM calculation and the continuous updates of all SASs, the staggering algorithm is more able to consider the dynamic changes of congestion conditions in both the current iNet and candidate iNets. Furthermore, staggering can be partly controlled as the operator is able, through configuration, to affect the number of terminals that are switched during an active congestion cycle.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9050043225288391, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2632.009661458333)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2680.6086197916666)), (np.float64(2022.6214599609375), np.float64(2680.6086197916666)), (np.float64(2022.6214599609375), np.float64(2632.009661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 325, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '94fa8bb5ec2d099acb760d9bb6104008', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'd5b2850dd191e35623750725be58c387'}, page_content='Other enhancements to the staggering algorithm are listed below:'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(2726.8013281249996)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(2775.400286458333)), (np.float64(607.6595364583333), np.float64(2775.400286458333)), (np.float64(607.6595364583333), np.float64(2726.8013281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 325, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '94fa8bb5ec2d099acb760d9bb6104008', 'category': 'UncategorizedText', 'element_id': 'a94580c679407f4f5078830ad219c62f'}, page_content='•'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad905