175575256, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(809.0929947916666)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1043.629453125)), (np.float64(2605.503286458333), np.float64(1043.629453125)), (np.float64(2605.503286458333), np.float64(809.0929947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 328, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '771df712324c46420a18c28483083f97', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '1cc6491d632644a399eaa455523180d4'}, page_content='Occasionally, the reception and timing of these signals is altered by signal path blockage, multi-path reflections, or interference. This can result in some calculations from these altered signals producing erroneous terminal geo-locations. The resulting outliers can induce significant errors into:'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9034727215766907, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(672.4296875), np.float64(1089.822161458333)), (np.float64(672.4296875), np.float64(1138.4211197916668)), (np.float64(2225.1728515625), np.float64(1138.4211197916668)), (np.float64(2225.1728515625), np.float64(1089.822161458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 328, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '771df712324c46420a18c28483083f97', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '166e7ba5ef957c0abeb56795c5e5c329'}, page_content='• Terminal transmit timing calculations performed during acquisition'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9382201433181763, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(673.2760416666666), np.float64(1184.6138281249998)), (np.float64(673.2760416666666), np.float64(1419.150286458333)), (np.float64(2624.66259765625), np.float64(1419.150286458333)), (np.float64(2624.66259765625), np.float64(1184.6138281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 328, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '771df712324c46420a18c28483083f97', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': 'c171958a4d434efe0b26ff5d6db20441'}, page_content="• Terminal velocity calculations that can hamper any efforts to predict the apparent shifts in carrier frequencies, which occur due to the Doppler Effect; such predictions that become increasingly critical as a terminal's velocity relative to the satellite increases."), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9478767514228821, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(562.1507568359375), np.float64(1465.3429947916666)), (np.float64(562.1507568359375), np.float64(1763.041748046875)), (np.float64(2610.296142578125), np.float64(1763.041748046875)), (np.float64(2610.296142578125), np.float64(1465.3429947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 328, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '771df712324c46420a18c28483083f97', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'a442034eac44ed401ce498f78f763765'}, page_content='A series of calculations are performed on a set of sequential GPS positional values, and a determination is then made as to whether to reject any of those positional values and which ones to reject. Detection of an outlier is not in itself cause for any action, other than rejection of the corresponding measurements. Only measurements that are not rejected are then used for subsequent calculations and controls.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(353.6458333333333), np.float64(3514.3013281249996)), (np.float64(353.6458333333333), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(430.0836416027083), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(430.0836416027083), np.float64(3514.3013281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 328, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '771df712324c46420a18c28483083f97', 'category': 'UncategorizedText', 'element_id': 'f2f292104dd7cfeba49cc4236733e512'}, page_content='294'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.47962844371795654, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(1060.918212890625), np.float64(3510.844970703125)), (np.float64(1060.918212890625), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(2624.246337890625), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(2624.246337890625), np.float64(3510.844970703125)))