34, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1275.759661458333)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1572.275286458333)), (np.float64(2635.326203125), np.float64(1572.275286458333)), (np.float64(2635.326203125), np.float64(1275.759661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 332, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '419b548891e015833a60a964baef8469'}, page_content='When the beam is in State 1 it has only the Base iNet. At some point in time, a decision is made (externally) to add the “Floater” iNet to the beam. The system then transitions to State 2, where the beam has two iNets. It can remain in this state for some time. At a certain point in time, an external decision is made to remove the Floater iNet and the beam transitions back to State 1 with the Base iNet.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.926008403301239, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1618.4679947916663)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1729.0461197916663)), (np.float64(2605.576416015625), np.float64(1729.0461197916663)), (np.float64(2605.576416015625), np.float64(1618.4679947916663))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 332, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '61d2550d6c570c72cdb0e4a98a514187'}, page_content='Figure 7-26 shows the changes in the capacity of a beam as the “Floater” iNet is moved from the blue Beam to the red Beam.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.7941857576370239, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(1279.765625), np.float64(2973.220458984375)), (np.float64(1279.765625), np.float64(3022.040911458333)), (np.float64(1920.431884765625), np.float64(3022.040911458333)), (np.float64(1920.431884765625), np.float64(2973.220458984375))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 332, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'FigureCaption', 'element_id': 'db7492f9a8a7cae24819b6350dba09d3'}, page_content='Figure 7-26. Beam Capacity'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9504392743110657, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(566.0157470703125), np.float64(3072.822998046875)), (np.float64(566.0157470703125), np.float64(3435.2961197916666)), (np.float64(2638.472900390625), np.float64(3435.2961197916666)), (np.float64(2638.472900390625), np.float64(3072.822998046875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 332, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '0ce0792132479805c8ce92e7d75d94b8'}, page_content='A value of 15 Mb/s is used as an example for the capacity of each iNet. At t0, the blue beam covers the high-demand area and requires additional capacity. So with the “Floater” iNet activated, the total capacity is 30 Mb/s and can meet demand from the high-demand area. At t1, the beams moved and now the high demand area on the ground falls under the red beam. So the “Floater” iNet is deactivated in the blue beam and reactivated in red beam to meet the demand. This example demonstrates the need to shift the capacity between the beams as'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.4509986639022827, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(351.43194580078125), np.float64(3514.3013281249996)), (np.float64(351.43194580078125), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(432.2580871582031), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(432.2580871582031), np.float64(3514.3013281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 332, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': 'a54a357b3e1e426591f1dae60a146e95'}, page_content='298'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(1315.1614583333333), np.float64(3514.3013281249996)), (np.float64(1315.1614583333333), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(2621.2687946232813), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(2621.2687946232813), np.float64(3514.3013281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 332, 'file_directory': '/var/folders