', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(348.0533752441406), np.float64(251.28049479166657)), (np.float64(348.0533752441406), np.float64(299.87945312500017)), (np.float64(1044.6531982421875), np.float64(299.87945312500017)), (np.float64(1044.6531982421875), np.float64(251.28049479166657))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 334, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Header', 'element_id': '96d94f595184a260d7f6adb031f634f1'}, page_content='7.14.4 Dynamic Beam Changes'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9460259079933167, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(400.7596614583332)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(573.3169531250002)), (np.float64(2632.477294921875), np.float64(573.3169531250002)), (np.float64(2632.477294921875), np.float64(400.7596614583332))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 334, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '96d94f595184a260d7f6adb031f634f1', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '031b7f5332954544a771dfd58ef7b8fe'}, page_content='The operator generates dynamic beam maps and loads them into Pulse at intervals suitable to the satellite orbits in use. These are then loaded onto the respective data path elements on the CDC/SAS. This process is similar to the existing method of updating configuration.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9433031678199768, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(619.5096614583332)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(854.0461197916668)), (np.float64(2628.82080078125), np.float64(854.0461197916668)), (np.float64(2628.82080078125), np.float64(619.5096614583332))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 334, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '96d94f595184a260d7f6adb031f634f1', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'f425e434df306a79235d7af7eafa7021'}, page_content='However, for Dynamic Beam Switching, the configuration loaded has a specific validity time post during which a specific beam and/or channel configuration set can be used. This specific dynamic beam configuration and schedule set are "activated" automatically based on the schedule time in the configuration.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.95236736536026, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(566.1714477539062), np.float64(900.2388281249998)), (np.float64(566.1714477539062), np.float64(1444.6711197916666)), (np.float64(2641.086619791666), np.float64(1444.6711197916666)), (np.float64(2641.086619791666), np.float64(900.2388281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 334, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '96d94f595184a260d7f6adb031f634f1', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '0fce851c0d9929e482d89e5e8d265aba'}, page_content='To minimize the impact on the system and also ensure the system can apply the dynamic beam changes quickly (approximately every 15 minutes), the dynamic beam configuration is updated via Pulse API as configuration files. To ensure that the system can switch the currently active beam set in the expected time frame, rather than relying on Pulse to push a new beam update or have an external program trigger the activation via an external command, a pre-determined "dynamic beam configuration" change schedule is provided to the protocol processor cluster via a separate configuration file. However, to provide the operator the capability to manually intervene/change the active beam set configuration, an RT command is also provided.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.938673734664917, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1490.8638281249998)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1663.4211197916663)), (np.float64(2635.5126953125), np.float64(1663.4211197916663)), (np.float64(2635.5126953125), np.float64(1490.8638281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 334, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '96d94f595184a260d7f6adb031f634f1', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '39178dcfc823a426c0fa1b9708e0b704'}, page_content='Note that it is expected that the PP_Cluster is already synchronized to Network Time Protocol (NTP) to ensure the time specified in the schedule is universally aligned. Upon activation (or failure) of the operation, an event is reported to the Pulse NMS for record keeping.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.3498232960700989, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(352.90228271484375), np.float64(3514.3013281249996)), (np.float64(352.90228271484375), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(432.3060607910156), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(432.3060607910156), np.float64(3514.3013281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 334, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '96d94f595184a260d7f6adb031f634f1', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '4dd71605226c3d7a8a70a2c03e0b40c8'}, page_content='300'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.47960785031318665, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(1060.9208984375), np.float64(3510.84619140625)), (np.float64(1060.9208984375), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(2624.25830078125), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(2624.25830078125), np.float64(3510.84619140625))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 334, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '96d94f595184a260d7f6adb031f634f1', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '45539278d5cd51d2c1457120be2115c3'}, page_content='ST Engineering iDirect Proprietary | Confidentiality: Public Technical Reference Guide | iDirect V