rectory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Header', 'element_id': '5de37808c08764b04f9dc04437d17ea3'}, page_content='8.2 Terminal Component Mismatch'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.882941722869873, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(298.1334228515625), np.float64(397.541666666667)), (np.float64(298.1334228515625), np.float64(485.041666666667)), (np.float64(1843.8945364583328), np.float64(485.041666666667)), (np.float64(1843.8945364583328), np.float64(397.541666666667))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 341, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '5de37808c08764b04f9dc04437d17ea3', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '0988c2b830c96b910bc24e2208168ead'}, page_content='8.2 Terminal Component Mismatch'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9465883374214172, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(528.3638281249998)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(886.8586197916668)), (np.float64(2629.529296875), np.float64(886.8586197916668)), (np.float64(2629.529296875), np.float64(528.3638281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 341, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '0988c2b830c96b910bc24e2208168ead', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '15f642931fb93bd940aae0f224669bd1'}, page_content='Satellite terminals can be configured such that upon entering a satellite network, it can send to the SAS, a key/value string that identifies all of its key components — for example, satellite router, BUC, ACU, or Terminal Type. This string is compared to an equivalent string at the SAS, whereby any mismatch is reported to the NMS as an event. The string used for the comparison is generated at the NMS and sent to the SAS as part of the hub-side configuration for the terminal.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9412922859191895, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.156494140625), np.float64(933.0513281249998)), (np.float64(568.156494140625), np.float64(1167.7646484375)), (np.float64(2638.821533203125), np.float64(1167.7646484375)), (np.float64(2638.821533203125), np.float64(933.0513281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 341, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '0988c2b830c96b910bc24e2208168ead', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'f47ab9bd34381c0248c26d124bc01c0a'}, page_content='If a particular key/value pair from the satellite terminal fails to match an element in the comparison string, the Satellite Terminal Proxy generates an event of the specific Event Type ID, Terminal Component Mismatch and sends it to the NMS. If enabled by the configuration, the terminal will be sent a forced logout command, and is not allowed to enter the network.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9358618855476379, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(561.6689453125), np.float64(1213.7804947916666)), (np.float64(561.6689453125), np.float64(1510.2961197916666)), (np.float64(2636.3105781249997), np.float64(1510.2961197916666)), (np.float64(2636.3105781249997), np.float64(1213.7804947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 341, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '0988c2b830c96b910bc24e2208168ead', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'eab766b90b8c7df27ccfa947604ea13d'}, page_content='The terminal component mismatch event creates a MAJOR severity event, in the NMS, which immediately triggers a MAJOR severity alarm for the satellite terminal. The result should be that the operator will examine the alarm and makes a case-by-case determination of the correct action to take. Once the corrective action is taken, the NMS operator can manually clear the alarm at the appropriate time.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8313227891921997, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(833.1307373046875), np.float64(1596.5929947916663)), (np.float64(833.1307373046875), np.float64(1770.285888671875)), (np.float64(2533.697021484375), np.float64(1770.285888671875)), (np.float64(2533.697021484375), np.float64(1596.5929947916663))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 341, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '51685692794a6016d5e757439f6121c5'}, page_content='NOTE: It is likely some key/values pairs not present in the comparison string from the NMS (for example, BUC serial number) will come from the satellite terminal. No comparison is performed on these pairs.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8164794445037842, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(831.6536865234375), np.float64(1844.509661458333)), (np.float64(831.6536865234375), np.float64(1955.087786458333)), (np.float64(2553.40966796875), np.float64(1955.087786458333)), (np.float64(2553.40966796875), np.float64(1844.509661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 341, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'bd4f772b8b10e8371946a86438addbd5'}, page_content='The comparison string from the NMS supports regular expression matching, so more than one component value can match a given comparison string.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.4301307201385498, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(342.636474609375), np.float64(3509.2626953125)), (np.float64(342.636474609375), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(1941.2919921875), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(1941.2919921875), np.float64(3509.2626953125))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pd