tiveText', 'element_id': '42f0b8a5d6f4286ec48d3a829a8f1336'}, page_content='Once the terminal is in the network, the hub pushes the PSD-vs-skew curve and the tolerance parameter (maximum acceptable C/N reduction or angular tolerance) to the core module via the DFOE protocol, as part of the session-dependent configuration parameter set. A skew characteristic can be associated with any configured Regulatory Area associated with discreet mode terminals, which can be used in the same manner as regular characteristics. This regulatory area will never change as long as the terminal remains in the same beam/iNet.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8541291952133179, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(910.9921875)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1021.7544531250002)), (np.float64(2487.5605781249997), np.float64(1021.7544531250002)), (np.float64(2487.5605781249997), np.float64(910.9921875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 346, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '91671c34676f8ce323dd30505d90c79c', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'bee0f706ddcbe616006967759709e189'}, page_content='Advanced skew, which relies on periodic geo-location updates from the terminal, is not supported for discreet terminals.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9009194374084473, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1113.0632552083332)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1181.1309635416667)), (np.float64(1262.