(845.1770833333333), np.float64(617.343994140625)), (np.float64(2583.5553697916666), np.float64(617.343994140625)), (np.float64(2583.5553697916666), np.float64(440.8638281249999))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 352, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'e7d0987fb539b95ef72fa561794b7b2d'}, page_content='NOTE: The PSD curve is provided by the antenna manufacturer as a list of data points, where each point is formed by the Skew Angle (deg.) and the Relative PSD Level (dBm). A PSD curve must be configured for each terminal type.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.91953045129776, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(565.8204956054688), np.float64(744.8340885416665)), (np.float64(565.8204956054688), np.float64(812.9017968750001)), (np.float64(1157.4554443359375), np.float64(812.9017968750001)), (np.float64(1157.4554443359375), np.float64(744.8340885416665))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 352, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '2ee74d02c440e2b9356de5bdf352d8f7'}, page_content='8.5.4 Real Skew'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9426062107086182, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(856.4888281249998)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1154.813232421875)), (np.float64(2611.3720703125), np.float64(1154.813232421875)), (np.float64(2611.3720703125), np.float64(856.4888281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 352, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '2ee74d02c440e2b9356de5bdf352d8f7', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '12ab0fd2274e01d8d94d90cd12626e34'}, page_content='Satellite routers can now support antennas that report the “real skew.” Real skew takes into account the relative positioning of the terminal, and the “local tilt,” which results from platform attitude variations (pitch and roll for an aircraft). Using OpenAMIP v1.12 or higher, the antenna control unit (ACU) directly provides a real skew measurement in the OpenAMIP “w” message, which includes pitch, roll, yaw, heading, and skew.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9485629796981812, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1199.197161458333)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1557.9915771484375)), (np.float64(2638.01123046875), np.float64(1557.9915771484375)), (np.float64(2638.01123046875), np.float64(1199.197161458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 352, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '2ee74d02c440e2b9356de5bdf352d8f7', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'b535d1b5636e81bb07388b315a119e6c'}, page_content='If the skew is provided by the ACU, the PP and modem use this value instead of calculating level-flight skew. The modem will include these values in an updated version of the OTA OOB geo-location reporting message to the PP. If the message is received without the heading, pitch, roll, yaw, and skew parameters, the associated parameter values are all assumed equal to zero, with the exception of the skew. In this case, the system computes a level-flight skew angle value based on the latitude and longitude of the terminal only.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9416319727897644, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1603.884661458333)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1776.4419531249998)), (np.float64(2583.9199531249997), np.float64(1776.4419531249998)), (np.float64(2583.9199531249997), np.float64(1603.884661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 352, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '2ee74d02c440e2b9356de5bdf352d8f7', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '13b67e691647aaef0194be4704ecdbf5'}, page_content='Velocity Real Skew also supports newer antennas with beams in which the shape varies - in this case the interface is the same but the table and the skew value are manipulated by the antenna vendor to account for varying beam shape.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9254816770553589, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(558.6689453125), np.float64(1822.634661458333)), (np.float64(558.6689453125), np.float64(1933.212786458333)), (np.float64(2553.61376953125), np.float64(1933.212786458333)), (np.float64(2553.61376953125), np.float64(1822.634661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 352, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '2ee74d02c440e2b9356de5bdf352d8f7', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'e06dc66121de9319a1453c27b357f4b8'}, page_content='Real skew data should improve regulatory compliance and reduce terminal muting, due to skew limits. The following are some key characteristics of Real Skew support:'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8816945552825928, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(673.2760416666666), np.float64(1979.4054947916663)), (np.float64(673.2760416666666), np.float64(2028.0044531249998)), (np.float64(2090.0146484375), np.float64(2028.0044531249998)), (np.float64(2090.0146484375), np.float64(1979.4054947916663))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 352, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '2ee74d02c440e2b9356de5bdf352d8f7', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '5b439bdea7d2536fffae8dec302ccc1e'}, page_content='• Terminals provide support for antennas that report real skew'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.879688024520874, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(673.2760416666666), np.float64(2074.197161458333)), (np.float64(673.2760416666666), np.float64(2122.7961197916666)), (np.float64(2230.040801309635), np.float64(2122.7961197916666)), (np.float64(2230.040801309635), np.float64(2074.197161458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 352, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '2ee74d02c440e2b9356de5bdf352d8f7', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '93724187963c5dab2b5f0f54de03c44d'}, page_content='• Takes into account the local tilt and relative positioning of terminal'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8569576740264893, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(673.2760416666666), np.float64(2168.774169921875)), (np.float64(673.2760416666666), np.float64(2217.587786458333)), (np.float64(2588.54398504151), np.float64(2217.587786458333)), (np.float64(2588.54398504151), np.float64(2168.774169921875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 352, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '2ee74d02c440e2b9356de5bdf352d8f7', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '50a108a9ebc4c9402a502f4264bf3195'}, page_content='• Real Skew benefits greatly from high update rate of the “w” message - typically 1Hz'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9169297218322754, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(673.2760416666666), np.float64(2261.8466796875)), (np.float64(673.2760416666666), np.float64(2374.602783203125)), (np.float64(2575.767333984375), np.float64(2374.602783203125)), (np.float64(2575.767333984375), np.float64(2261.8466796875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 352, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '2ee74d02c440e2b9356de5bdf352d8f7', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '7d1d904d51af2e6a4ea51ed1ce43f5cf'}, page_content='• Improves overall performance by allowing the system to more accurately calculate the minimum and maximum skew values thereby reducing terminal muting'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9230684638023376, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2462.4054947916666)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2525.5877864583326)), (np.float64(1892.6624755859375), np.float64(2525.5877864583326)), (np.float64(1892.6624755859375), np.float64(2462.4054947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 352, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': 'd9f1a6f061f56cd17f08a2638b3d44e5'}, page_content='8.5.4.1 Real Skew with Flat Plate Antennas'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9488442540168762, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.9974975585938), np.float64(2570.0304947916666)), (np.float64(567.9974975585938), np.float64(2928.525286458333)), (np.float64(2626.9772447916666), np.float64(2928.525286458333)), (np.float64(2626.9772447916666), np.float64(2570.0304947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 352, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'd9f1a6f061f56cd17f08a2638b3d44e5', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '8250e42fc5b1fc01b487b07c8c2c7354'}, page_content='The real skew algorithm in Velocity, without any changes, is also applicable to flat plate antennas. Perhaps the only difference is how the algorithm should be viewed. Real Skew simply asks the antenna to provide a “skew angle,” which is an index into a table stored at the Velocity hub (provided by antenna integrator, in conjunction with network operator). In turn, the antenna directs the hub to look up a maximum PSD value in the table. The table and the index are managed by the operator and the antenna integrator.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9406664967536926, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.8475952148438), np.float64(2974.717994791666)), (np.float64(567.8475952148438), np.float64(3209.254453125)), (np.float64(2596.468505859375), np.float64(3209.254453125)), (np.float64(2596.468505859375), np.float64(2974.717994791666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 352, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'd9f1a6f061f56cd17f08a2638b3d44e5', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '33f4487ac432b5ae23ea92414224173c'}, page_content='As with a mechanically steered elliptical antenna, the index value for the flat plate antenna does not have to physically represent a classic skew angle. The index, in this case, would be the result of any arbitrary calculation based on the geometry — the platform location and orientation, satellite location, and the instantaneous beam shape.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9400971531867981, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.0257568359375), np.float64(3255.447161458333)), (np.float64(567.0257568359375), np.float64(3428.004453125)), (np.float64(2605.6126614583327), np.float64(3428.004453125)), (np.float64(2605.6126614583327), np.float64(3255.447161458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 352, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'd9f1a6f061f56cd17f08a2638b3d44e5', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'af7c95294360c2acff3a9def083f5326'}, page_content='When the beam shape is variable, depending on beam elevation and azimuth—relative to the plate antenna, the index calculation is likely based on a 3D table resident in the antenna controller. From the table, the controller looks up the skew, elevation, and azimuth (each'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.41515517234802246, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points':