ary ground comms, news gathering, camping comms, and oil/gas exploration.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9530835747718811, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(563.9942626953125), np.float64(874.7179947916665)), (np.float64(563.9942626953125), np.float64(1357.1711197916668)), (np.float64(2630.6240234375), np.float64(1357.1711197916668)), (np.float64(2630.6240234375), np.float64(874.7179947916665))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 355, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'f1d953e79a6d1de0ed4e5ce34aa31b58', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '1f8398699925bb4e3021d8077c2fd23d'}, page_content="External Beam Select Mode enables the user to select a signaling carrier from a satellite of their choice to download the service map (OTA_BEAM_MAP), and select the service beam from a satellite of their choice to acquire into the network. This feature enables the user to completely control the satellite and beam selection, and informs the remote to ignore all satellite switch, beam switch, and emergency beam switch decisions made by the Hub. The remote will, however, still honor requests from the hub to switch to another iNet within the user's selected beam, hence permitting some measure of congestion management and improv- ing the user's experience."), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9403334856033325, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1407.009661458333)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1579.56695312