'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1782.5304947916663)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1955.087786458333)), (np.float64(2491.725830078125), np.float64(1955.087786458333)), (np.float64(2491.725830078125), np.float64(1782.5304947916663))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 370, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '5eb036c4bf1d580c4003310cc8aea12c', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '86e515a13953cf222d4f09b0d5c9114b'}, page_content='Since current Velocity multicast methods, static multicast and dynamic multicast, both involve the bidirectional IGMP protocol, this 1-way iNet is limited to only supporting Persistent Multicast. See Persistent Multicast on page 337.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8699174523353577, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2046.3965885416667)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2114.464296875)), (np.float64(2406.360595703125), np.float64(2114.464296875)), (np.float64(2406.360595703125), np.float64(2046.3965885416667))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 370, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'a0f1971ef2c0dabdb01a552509ec214b', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '4510ade4379f22f275d5090b393993b2'}, page_content='10.1.2 Multicast Traffic on Terminal Secondary Receiver'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9435985684394836, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2158.0513281249996)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2392.587786458333)), (np.float64(2622.449462890625), np.float64(2392.587786458333)), (np.float64(2622.449462890625), np.float64(2158.0513281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 370, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '4510ade4379f22f275d5090b393993b2', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '6f864b7c6d212b91268ffdb55496ea43'}, page_content='With multicast overlay enabled on the terminal, a Velocity dual receiver remote is able to support 2-way unicast traffic on the primary receiver, while simultaneously receiving 1-way multicast traffic on the secondary receiver. Although there are two receivers, the terminal is constrained to a single antenna, and therefore can only tune to a single satellite.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9496240019798279, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2438.7804947916666)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2921.2336197916666)), (np.float64(2632.27001953125), np.float64(2921.2336197916666)), (np.float64(2632.27001953125), np.float64(2438.7804947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 370, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '4510ade4379f22f275d5090b393993b2', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '7b21c4c45216225bd9183d9196407780'}, page_content='When multicast overlay is enabled, and using the second receiver to receive multicast traffic, only break-before-make beam switch operation is possible, as the secondary receiver is no longer available for make-before-break operation. In this configuration, both receivers are receiving user data — the primary receives unicast traffic from one beam/2-Way iNet and the secondary receives multicast traffic from another beam/1-Way iNet. It is also possible for the primary and secondary receivers to point to a 2-way iNet and a 1-way iNet in the same beam, thereby enabling more efficient multicast distribution in a beam where terminals that are spread across multiple unicast channels wish to share a single multicast feed.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.4599262773990631, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(787.6719970703125), np.float64(3007.24658203125)), (np.float64(787.6719970703125), np.float64(3056.129453125)), (np.float64(2255.1743593749993), np.float64(3056.129453125)), (np.float64(2255.1743593749993), np.float64(3007.24658203125))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 370, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '41a066563ccba6f8d5a9559ca964f985'}, page_content='NOTE: See Terminal Break-Before-Make Beam Switch on page 275.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.31309616565704346, 'is_extrac