 that which is provided by a single wide beam, or completely overlapping wide beams. This extension is accomplished by making the service available across multiple wide beams covering different geographic areas. These beams would likely overlap, but not completely, such that coverage would continue to be available to mobile terminals as they move from one beam to another.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9073812961578369, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(561.4158935546875), np.float64(911.1763281249998)), (np.float64(561.4158935546875), np.float64(1021.7544531250002)), (np.float64(2529.678955078125), np.float64(1021.7544531250002)), (np.float64(2529.678955078125), np.float64(911.1763281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 375, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'dae9b5952dae8cc4256d86bd9fd1a9fa', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '6b001d7ecfbddd7771eb19c4ea7a4cf7'}, page_content='Due to the break-before-make beam switch from one wide-beam to another or from one satellite to another will create a momentary loss of both multicast and unicast services.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9503079056739807, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1067.947161458333)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1426.4419531249998)), (np.float64(2641.830810546875), np.float64(1426.4419531249998)), (np.float64(2641.830810546875), np.float64(1067.947161458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 375, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'dae9b5952dae8cc4256d86bd9fd1a9fa', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '752080eb6bf0974994dcecf22171b1d9'}, page_content='Switching between spot beams and switching between overlay beams is independent of each other, with a switch on one receiver not affecting operation on the other receiver. An exception to this, would be when there is a change in polarization during the switch, in which case the polarization controlling the selection of the overlay beam will follow the polarization of the new spot beam, and the overlay beam will be switched with the spot beam (2-way iNet/beam).'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.7364092469215393, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(1058.80126953125), np.float64(2404.6919531249996)), (np.float64(1058.80126953125), np.float64(2453.290911458333)), (np.float64(2134.4659353459897), np.float64(2453.290911458333)), (np.float64(2134.4659353459897), np.float64(2404.6919531249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 375, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'FigureCaption', 'element_id': '9ea9cd8ba47ecb0c36260716550bf9aa'}, page_content='Figure 10-4. Switching Between Overlay Beams'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.43058913946151733, '