way iNets in the same SAS; however, the configuration of a 1-way iNet on one SAS, and a 2-way iNet on a different SAS is not supported.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9369751811027527, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(579.29052734375), np.float64(2144.806396484375)), (np.float64(579.29052734375), np.float64(2383.7648697916666)), (np.float64(2613.3053697916666), np.float64(2383.7648697916666)), (np.float64(2613.3053697916666), np.float64(2144.806396484375))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 378, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '719c93d3f1bcd0c64d73959178c53b4d', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '5a9371d67163a3e388d84d0724533713'}, page_content='1-way iNet Downstream Carrier Change — Seamless downstream carrier changes on a 1-way iNet is not supported. Such a change will cause the terminal to lose lock on 1-way carrier until new carrier changes are in sync on Line Card and Remote — resulting in a brief loss of persistent multicast streams.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(2149.2284114583335)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(2197.8273697916666)), (np.float64(607.6595364583333), np.float64(2197.8273697916666)), (np.float64(607.6595364583333), np.float64(2149.2284114583335))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 378, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '719c93d3f1bcd0c64d73959178c53b4d', 'category': 'UncategorizedText', 'element_id': '78eb12ae523d9c4d7432cf2f0b6e85db'}, page_content='•'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9498270153999329, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(2425.26025390625)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(2788.997802734375)), (np.float64(2611.518911458333), np.float64(2788.997802734375)), (np.float64(2611.518911458333), np.float64(2425.26025390625))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 378, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '719c93d3f1bcd0c64d73959178c53b4d', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '5a061051d21bbe7d3e342715294e2ada'}, page_content='• Terminal Muted When Aircraft on Ground — When a terminal is muted it continues its attempt to acquire (searching for available carriers). In cases where the beam polarization is different (compared to the overlay to which it is currently locked), the terminal will try to lock to the corresponding polarization overlay, which would cause a glitch in the multicast. This behavior extends to terminals searching multiple satellites that may or may not be visible — which would also cause loss of multicast connectivity.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9276507496833801, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(2834.645078125)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(3069.181536458333)), (np.float64(2611.300161458333), np.float64(3069.181536458333)), (np.float64(2611.300161458333), np.float64(2834.645078125))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 378, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '719c93d3f1bcd0c64d73959178c53b4d', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '2925a8e37f4d59509d1b8fc63fcbc411'}, page_content='• Persistent Multicast Limited to 1-way iNets — By design, Velocity multicast is streamed to all iNets in a beam. As a result, when 2-way and 1-way iNets are configured in the same beam, persistent multicast would also be streamed to all iNets. In this current design, persistent multicast is limited to 1-way iNets.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9174560904502869, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(3115.3742447916666)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(3349.9107031249996)), (np.float64(2600.617869791666), np.float64(3349.9107031249996)), (np.float64(2600.617869791666), np.float64(3115.3742447916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 378, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '719c93d3f1bcd0c64d73959178c53b4d', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '5853554f0fdab390d0465f856dc76093'}, page_content='• Regulatory Area Assumption — When in a regulatory area where the terminal is not allowed to transmit, current behavior is to force logout of the terminal and for the terminal to enter the signaling mode; persistent multicast is still received, however the signaling carrier must be of the same polarization of the LNB and as the overlay beam.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(353.6458333333333), np.float64(3514.3013281249996)), (np.float64(353.6458333333333), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(430.0836416027083), np.float64(3562.900286458333)), (np.float64(430.0836416027083), np.float64(3514.3013281249996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 378, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '719c93d3f1bcd0c64d73959178c53b4d', 'category': 'UncategorizedText', 'element_id': 'd809ddf36d4b95204794689aadfcb641'}, page_content='344'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.4715530574321747, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(1058.0111083984375), np.float64(3508.6337890625)), (np.float64(1058.0111083984375), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(2627.357666015625), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(2627.357666015625), np.float64(3508.6337890625))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 378, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '719c