, bandwidth management, network availability, GSP and SSPC bandwidth availability, CIR (Committed Information Rate) and MIR (Maximum Information Rate) fulfillment statistics and CIR/MIR Fulfillment Ratios.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9442334175109863, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(565.7509155273438), np.float64(871.0721614583332)), (np.float64(565.7509155273438), np.float64(1229.566953125)), (np.float64(2625.8834947916666), np.float64(1229.566953125)), (np.float64(2625.8834947916666), np.float64(871.0721614583332))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 382, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'c928666d0c61dc3291d6e7b7153c36f4', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '7217d12f268999fcee79d41458dfb1af'}, page_content='The SLA compliance report for the Subscriber Service Plan Component (SSPC), for example, shows the subscriber whether the CIR/MIR demand has been satisfied based on the SLA. Velocity statistics used in producing SLA reports are generated in real-time, every 30 seconds at the Velocity SAS NMS, and are derived every 5 minutes at the NOC NMS. The CIR/MIR fulfillment stats can be used externally by network operators or service providers to generate monthly SLA compliance reports.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9451231956481934, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.3798217773438), np.float64(1275.759661458333)), (np.float64(568.3798217773438), np.float64(1572.275286458333)), (np.float64(2562.624267578125), np.float64(1572.275286458333)), (np.float64(2562.624267578125), np.float64(1275.759661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 382, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'c928666d0c61dc3291d6e7b7153c36f4', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'd0a8ed48dc428dd2bebadb7285e29405'}, page_content='As an example, using Velocity CIR/MIR Fulfillment Statistics and CIR/MIR Fulfillment Ratios performance metrics, Operators can determine, the percentage of time (for example 97%) that the CIR/MIR demand is satisfied during a period of one month; or, for example, what percentage of the CIR/MIR has been achieved, or by how much the SLA CIR/MIR has been missed.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8966386914253235, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(313.54166666666663), np.float64(1666.2916666666667)), (np.float64(313.54166666666663), np.float64(1753.7916666666667)), (np.float64(1768.6348876953125), np.float64(1753.7916666666667)), (np.float64(1768.6348876953125), np.float64(1666.2916666666667))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 382, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'b8e96b3280ea296930d5ceea2098844c', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '2c0088a0e707b58aec43e8f5b581f0dc'}, page_content='11.2 CIR/MIR Fulfillment Statistics'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_uploa