n- dow are reset to a status of passed. This resetting applies both to the CIR and MIR delayed ful- fillment calculations only. The condition of resetting is contingent on the total demand being fulfilled since this demand might have originated from CIR demand that continued accu- mulating in successive frames till it exceeded the CIR setting. Fulfilling the total demand will reset the (subsequently) failed frames in both the CIR and the MIR delayed fulfillment cal- culations.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8903070688247681, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(775.6962280273438), np.float64(1082.5304947916666)), (np.float64(775.6962280273438), np.float64(1255.0877864583335)), (np.float64(2530.597412109375), np.float64(1255.0877864583335)), (np.float64(2530.597412109375), np.float64(1082.5304947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 384, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '942b6f866390f0ad1c99ef56b7aad309'}, page_content='NOTE: See CIR/MIR Fulfillment Parameters on page 350, for additional details of example. Also, see CIR/MIR Statistics Calculation Exclusions on page 359., for periods and cases that are excluded from the CIR/MIR metrics calculations.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9064432382583618, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(313.54166666666663), np.float64(1389.2083333333333)), (np.float64(313.54166666666663), np.float64(1476.7083333333333)), (np.float64(1854.6011954166