, np.float64(1738.7804947916663)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1787.3794531249998)), (np.float64(2428.525390625), np.float64(1787.3794531249998)), (np.float64(2428.525390625), np.float64(1738.7804947916663))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 384, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '39b9649e121934602fa7abd2124fce66', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'c15f9832d84d9bdb93dd41822ea333cd'}, page_content='The following parameters provide more detail about CIR/MIR demand and allocation:'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9169718623161316, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(559.9083251953125), np.float64(1833.572161458333)), (np.float64(559.9083251953125), np.float64(1944.150286458333)), (np.float64(2580.4199531249997), np.float64(1944.150286458333)), (np.float64(2580.4199531249997), np.float64(1833.572161458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 384, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '39b9649e121934602fa7abd2124fce66', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': 'e379668cc7cded679a7f1922fd300e5e'}, page_content='• CIR Demand — the frame-by-frame demand from an SSPC, up to but not exceeding the configured CIR. CIR Demand is the lesser of Current Demand and the configured CIR.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detect