which is larger than the configured CIR, but is less than or equal to the configured MIR.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.937789797782898, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(674.4791666666666), np.float64(2351.2804947916666)), (np.float64(674.4791666666666), np.float64(2523.8377864583335)), (np.float64(2599.639892578125), np.float64(2523.8377864583335)), (np.float64(2599.639892578125), np.float64(2351.2804947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 384, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '39b9649e121934602fa7abd2124fce66', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '91624ed26f04249fc54121b8c772aedb'}, page_content='When current demand is higher than the configured CIR, but less than the configured MIR, the MIR Demand is equated to the current demand that exceeds the CIR. When the current demand is higher than the MIR, then the MIR Demand is equated to the MIR-CIR.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(2570.0304947916666)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(2618.629453125)), (np.float64(607.6595364583333), np.float64(2618.629453125)), (np.float64(607.6595364583333), np.float64(2570.0304947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 384, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '39b9649e121934602fa7abd2124fce66', 'category': 'UncategorizedText', 'element_id': 'e6f8d72fe6a51a0395512b482efabddd'}, page_content='•'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9302754998207092, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(575.5071411132812), np.float64(2570.0304947916666)), (np.float64(575.5071411132812), np.float64(2680.6086197916666)), (np.float64(2573.497314453125), np.float64(2680.6086197916666)), (np.float64(2573.497314453125), np.float64(2570.0304947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 384, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '39b9649e121934602fa7abd2124fce66', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '2714fbaa2b57b1656686cfc5c14595cd'}, page_content='Current Demand — the frame-by-frame demand from the SSPC. When SSPC demand is lower than the configured CIR, the CIR Demand is equated to the current demand.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9430749416351318, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(553.7813110351562), np.float64(2725.574462890625)), (np.float64(553.7813110351562), np.float64(3023.316953125)), (np.float64(2634.5605781249997), np.float64(3023.316953125)), (np.float64(2634.5605781249997), np.float64(2725.574462890625))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 384, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '39b9649e121934602fa7abd2124fce66', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': 'bc40c29dbedbd82e872aa7fb7adcbed8'}, page_content='• Window for Delayed Fulfillment — the configurable CIR/MIR fulfillment window is specified independently, with a value of 1-50 for downstream, and a value of 1-40 for the upstream. On the downstream a value of 1 corresponds to 100ms and a value of 50 corresponds to 5 seconds; on the upstream a value of 1 corresponds to 125ms and a value of 40 corresponds to 5 seconds.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.934639573097229, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(666.9846801757812), np.float64(3062.217994791666)), (np.float64(666.9846801757812), np.float64(3234.775286458333)), (np.float64(2586.962158203125), np.float64(3234.775286458333)), (np.float64(2586.962158203125), np.float64(3062.217994791666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 384, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '39b9649e121934602fa7abd2124fce66', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '7e912ce848ad5206be0d09816669854f'}, page_content='For real-time applications, the Window for Delayed Fulfillment is typically set to a low value on the order of 1 second, and corresponds to a 10-frame window on the downstream and an 8-frame window on the upstream. For non-real-time applications,'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(353.6458333333333),