oat64(848.8480834960938), np.float64(894.2332763671875)), (np.float64(2587.1647447916666), np.float64(894.2332763671875)), (np.float64(2587.1647447916666), np.float64(597.6346614583332))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 385, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '1727acf877ef0644708621be2c1d62f8', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '37797b12efd33a69bd17478cfc2353c8'}, page_content='NOTE: The Window for Delayed Fulfillment can be appropriately sized smaller or larger, based on the application. Some applications can tolerate more delay in the allocation of bandwidth than others. For those applications that cannot tolerate any significant delay, the window should be configured smaller; and for those applications that are less sensitive to delay, the window is set larger.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9014166593551636, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(832.4173583984375), np.float64(933.0513281249998)), (np.float64(832.4173583984375), np.float64(1293.4378662109375)), (np.float64(2571.097900390625), np.float64(1293.4378662109375)), (np.float64(2571.097900390625), np.float64(933.0513281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 385, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '6bb35ab9a3165bd76976a9fe49dbe4ad'}, page_content='Based on the agreement between the operator and the customer the window size is configured to match the application needs. An SLA with a very small Window for Delayed Fulfillment would likely be more expensive than an SLA with a medium or large window. A larger window allows more time for the system to satisfy the demand, whereas a smaller window will demand more bandwidth to ensure the requirement is met.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9096397757530212, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(852.1407470703125), np.float64(1330.447161458333)), (np.float64(852.1407470703125), np.float64(1564.9836197916666)), (np.float64(2560.9147447916666), np.float64(1564.9836197916666)), (np.float64(2560.9147447916666), np.float64(1330.447161458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 385, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'adcb6423fd289bbe43e24b547323bfcd'}, page_content='A size adjustment in the Window for Delayed Fulfillment does not impact QoS allocation in the downstream or upstream. It does, however, influence SLA computation as described in the respective section CIR/MIR Fulfillment Statistics.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.430009126663208, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(342.6621398925781), np.float64(3509.269287109375)), (np.float64(342.6621398925781), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(1941.20166015625), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(1941.20166015625), np.float64(3509.269287109375))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 