 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(830.9679947916665)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1065.504453125)), (np.float64(2617.898681640625), np.float64(1065.504453125)), (np.float64(2617.898681640625), np.float64(830.9679947916665))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 393, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '13ed4b6987c1d26240e561171fc8343f', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '1761ee28d75273a0149a9bcb722c00f1'}, page_content='The CIR/MIR Fulfillment Statistics, and the CIR/MIR Fulfillment Ratio Stats both only apply when the associated SSPC is active and the associated terminal is in network—otherwise, the CIR/MIR Fulfillment metrics are invalid, and such periods are not included in the CIR/MIR Fulfillment calculations.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9372143745422363, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1111.697161458333)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1222.2752864583335)), (np.float64(2586.041259765625), np.float64(1222.2752864583335)), (np.float64(2586.041259765625), np.float64(1111.697161458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 393, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '13ed4b6987c1d26240e561171fc8343f', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'b4a3ed8ef4fc97ce47375b6d7ebfb519'}, page_content='The following are examples of situations and periods that are excluded from the fulfillment calculations:'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9332543015480042, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1268.4679947916666)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1379.0461197916666)), (np.float64(2566.025390625), np.float64(1379.0461197916666)), (np.float64(2566.025390625), np.float64(1268.4679947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 393, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '13ed4b6987c1d26240e561171fc8343f', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '2f9b269b32a7815813d442f202f7c980'}, page_content='• When the terminal is muted due to skew, the terminal is out of the network, then the fulfillment metrics are not included in the calculations.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9344472289085388, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1425.2388281249998)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1597.7961197916666)), (np.float64(2646.407470703125), np.float64(1597.7961197916666)), (np.float64(2646.407470703125), np.float64(1425.2388281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 393, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '13ed4b6987c1d26240e561171fc8343f', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': 'bad402fc8e26811fd0c423c85446c6c9'}, page_content='• If a terminal is out of network for 10 frames out of 40, and the other 30 frames were determined to be 20 “Pass” and 10 “Fail,” then the CIR/MIR Fulfillment for the 40 frames is calculated at 66.7%.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.935187578201294, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1643.9888281249998)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1879.314697265625)), (np.float64(2639.518911458333), np.float64(1879.314697265625)), (np.float64(2639.518911458333), np.float64(1643.9888281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 393, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '13ed4b6987c1d26240e561171fc8343f', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '4402ab0b1c9d879632ca5f6b8b2bd8fc'}, page_content='• When an SSPC is not active (upstream/downstream) or the terminal is out of the network for an entire reporting interval, the CIR/MIR Fulfillment metrics are invalid and are not reported. Those periods for which the SSPC is not active or the terminal is out of network are not included in the determination of CIR/MIR Fulfillment metrics.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9326103925704956, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1924.7179947916663)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(2097.275286458333)), (np.float64(2642.25634765625), np.float64(2097.275286458333)), (np.float64(2642.25634765625), np.float64(1924.7179947916663))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 393, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '13ed4b6987c1d26240e561171fc8343f', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '0e35a9fac7e484ce86b43ce27f92985b'}, page_content='• When a terminal goes out of network, while switching satellites, or for any other reason, queued demand does not have an opportunity to be satisfied in subsequent frames within the Window for Delayed Fulfillment.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9524297714233398, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(2138.257080078125)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(2626.1103515625)), (np.float64(2647.931640625), np.float64(2626.1103515625)), (np.float64(2647.931640625), np.float64(2138.257080078125))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 393, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '13ed4b6987c1d26240e561171fc8343f', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '6eb71dbdda948f6b329f0728287f2798'}, page_content='• When a terminal is muted due to skew, and is out of network, then the fulfillment metrics are included in the calculations. When the terminal is muted for a short period (< 13 seconds), although the PP does not receive any demand, the terminal is considered to be in network. Therefore, in the upstream the CIR and MIR will be considered as fulfilled for that period. In the downstream the demand/fulfillment calculations will continue while the terminal is in that state. When the 13 seconds expire, the terminal is considered, by the PP, to have dropped out of network and the outage period is excluded from the fulfillment calculations.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8561539649963379, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(796.7029418945312), np.float64(2722.86279296875)), (np.float64(796.7029418945312), np.float64(2897.134765625)), (np.float64(2520.484130859375), np.float64(2897.134765625)), (np.float64(2520.484130859375), np.float64(2722.86279296875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 393, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'a10aa0cdff189ee6aa27d447e9e6f123'}, page_content='NOTE: Since the system may have satisfied the demand, had the terminal stayed in network, the frames within the sliding window prior to the frame in which service interruption started are automatically considered “Pass”.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.43574801087379456, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(348.06170654296875), np.float64(3509.50439453125)), (np.float64(348.06170654296875), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(1942.6019287109375), np.float64(3628.525286458333)), (np.float64(1942.6019287109375), np.float64(3509.50439453125))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', '