 Velocity model of Transparent Layer 2 Emulation, is shown in Figure 12-1.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.7781367301940918, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(997.5729166666666), np.float64(1307.2961197916663)), (np.float64(997.5729166666666), np.float64(1355.8950781249998)), (np.float64(2196.128338765156), np.float64(1355.8950781249998)), (np.float64(2196.128338765156), np.float64(1307.2961197916663))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 396, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'FigureCaption', 'element_id': 'bc213ae8e63da5522a391aed0b57f4ed'}, page_content='Figure 12-1. Velocity Transparent Layer 2 Emulation'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.6468777656555176, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(832.835205078125), np.float64(1450.759661458333)), (np.float64(832.835205078125), np.float64(1561.337786458333)), (np.float64(2520.63259875), np.float64(1561.337786458333)), (np.float64(2520.63259875), np.float64(1450.759661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 396, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'd71d6f3e57f8e423c3931cd0d2a1cc6d'}, page_content='NOTE: 1) L2oS is only supported on iQ Desktop, iQ 200, and iQ LTE Satellite Routers.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.6193252801895142, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(845.1770833333333), np.float64(1636.697161458333)), (np.float64(845.1770833333333), np.float64(1685.2961197916663)), (np.float64(2567.348527464948), np.float64(1685.2961197916663)), (np.float64(2567.348527464948), np.float64(1636.697161458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 396, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'f3f9fc37b5f83bb6e796f9786e013302'}, page_content='2) L2oS supports a Maximum Transmission Unit (MTU) of 1532 bytes in Velocity.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9503195881843567, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.3477783203125), np.float64(1822.634661458333)), (np.float64(567.3477783203125), np.float64(2243.1086197916666)), (np.float64(2631.246826171875), np.float64(2243.1086197916666)), (np.float64(2631.246826171875), np.float64(1822.634661458333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 396, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '3953f724113aa415c5716e68ca8199da'}, page_content='L2oS makes the satellite link appear to be a transparent Ethernet connection between the satellite hub and the satellite router. Any Ethernet protocol can be executed over the L2oS link. In terms of data networking, this is “moving down the stack” from the traditional iDirect (and VSAT) model of IP-connectivity over the satellite link. The iDirect L2oS implementation is based on concepts from various IETF L2 VPN RFCs and Metro Ethernet Forum specifications, but optimized for satellite links and iDirect network topology. In Velocity, the initial implementation is restricted to point-to-point connections.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8601885437965393, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(833.5735473632812), np.float64(2329.4054947916666)), (np.float64(833.5735473632812), np.float64(2501.9627864583335)), (np.float64(2586.6178697916666), np.float64(2501.9627864583335)), (np.float64(2586.6178697916666), np.float64(2329.4054947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 396, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '0797b6fdb04447d6da05b6e6ca12b9fc'}, page_content='NOTE: Individual IP protocol stats (TCP, HTTP, UDP, ICMP, and IGMP bytes) are not supported on L2 SVNs. Values reported are inaccurate and must not be used.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8960186839103699, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.0562133789062), np.float64(2639.3013281249996)), (np.float64(567.0562133789062), np.float64(2687.9002864583335)), (np.float64(2248.516845703125), np.float64(2687.9002864583335)), (np.float64(2248.516845703125), np.float64(263