, 'element_id': 'e4ad9a2a8a8493e42611ee5b12663bb6'}, page_content='12.9 MAC Address Learning'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9093328714370728, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(313.54166666666663), np.float64(397.541666666667)), (np.float64(313.54166666666663), np.float64(485.041666666667)), (np.float64(1504.7593749999999), np.float64(485.041666666667)), (np.float64(1504.7593749999999), np.float64(397.541666666667))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 407, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'e4ad9a2a8a8493e42611ee5b12663bb6', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '06e976d10bbe834a179a13d908c5e504'}, page_content='12.9 MAC Address Learning'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9423632025718689, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(564.93701171875), np.float64(528.3638281249998)), (np.float64(564.93701171875), np.float64(762.9002864583334)), (np.float64(2607.819580078125), np.float64(762.9002864583334)), (np.float64(2607.819580078125), np.float64(528.3638281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 407, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '06e976d10bbe834a179a13d908c5e504', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'd304a5ef16d9ea4ddee5676c73558578'}, page_content='A generic Layer 2 switch builds the contents of its MAC FIB by learning MACs – that is, inspecting frames received and storing the source MAC address and the interface on which it was received in the MAC FIB. When the switch needs to forward a frame; it can ‘look up’ the MAC destination address of the frame in the MAC FIB to determine how to forward it.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9460414052009583, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(809.0929947916666)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1105.6086197916668)), (np.float64(2628.531494140625), np.float64(1105.6086197916668)), (np.float64(2628.531494140625), np.float64(809.0929947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 407, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '06e976d10bbe834a179a13d908c5e504', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '20a5f5e0727e819b17bb93f006f9acc8'}, page_content='The PP and terminal operate the same way; they learn MAC addresses from the frames they receive and use the resulting MAC FIB to determine where to send the frames. The difference is that the destination for the frames is a PW that carries the frame over the satellite link. It also forwards the frame over-the-air, only when the frame is addressed to a known MAC address on a known SVN.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9422112703323364, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.4097290039062), np.float64(1151.8013281249998)), (np.float64(568.4097290039062), np.float64(1448.3169531249998)), (np.float64(2608.77001953125), np.float64(1448.3169531249998)), (np.float64(2608.77001953125), np.float64(1151.8013281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 407, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '06e976d10bbe834a179a13d908c5e504', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'f29b0720824061a427c171b92920e4b9'}, page_content='In both cases, a generic L2 switch and the components of the Velocity L2oS solution, and the learned MAC addresses expire if the remote devices with the MAC addresses have not transmitted for a specific duration. This duration is called the MAC Aging Timeout. For the Velocity PP, the default aging timeout is 6hrs, which is based on the industry standards. The Velocity terminal default timeout is 5mins.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9240702390670776, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1539.6257552083334)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1607.6934635416667)), (np.float64(1632.7330322265625), np.float64(1607.6934635416667)), (np.float64(1632.7330322265625), np.float64(1539.6257552083334))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 407, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'e4ad9a2a8a8493e42611ee5b12663bb6', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '9e0066dfd4735473a00ad641c75ec183'}, page_content='12.9.1 Persistent MAC FIB Table'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9346345663070679, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.7332763671875), np.float64(1651.2804947916663)), (np.float64(568.7332763671875), np.float64(1761.8586197916663)), (np.float64(2599.55419921875), np.float64(1761.8586197916663)), (np.float64(2599.55419921875), np.float64(1651.2804947916663))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 407, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '9e0066dfd4735473a00ad641c75ec183', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'dcefdae41479777d8aa2a2482c77739f'}, page_content="When a terminal goes out-of-network, the MAC address is kept until 'age out' timer expires - as if the terminal is still in network."), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9331685304641724, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.5364379882812), np.float64(1808.0513281249998)), (np.float64(568.5364379882812), np.float64(1918.6294531249998)), (np.float64(2623.8349609375), np.float64(1918.6294531249998)), (np.float64(2623.8349609375), np.float64(1808.0513281249998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 407, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '9e0066dfd4735473a00ad641c75ec183', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '11d0bbccd777fa1bebd84465ae94aa78'}, page_content='If the terminal comes back into the network, before MAC address ‘age out,’ the (new) PP will recover the MAC addresses while preserving the current address age.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9054388999938965, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(313.54166666666663), np.float64(2012.6458333333333)), (np.float64(313.54166666666663), np.float64(2100.1458333333335)), (np.float64(1769.4104166666668), np.float64(2100.1458333333335)), (np.float64(1769.4104166666668), np.float64(2012.6458333333333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 407, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'e4ad9a2a8a8493e42611ee5b12663bb6', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': 'e27bbef36ce405655f69f4a3f493bb6b'}, page_content='12.10 L2oS Failover and Resiliency'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9269876480102539, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(559.8587646484375), np.float64(2143.4679947916666)), (np.float64(559.8587646484375), np.float64(2254.0461197916666)), (np.float64(2381.3818359375), np.float64(2254.0461197916666)), (np.float64(2381.3818359375), np.float64(2143.4679947916666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 407, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': 'e27bbef36ce405655f69f4a3f493bb6b', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 