mer MAC addresses to switch the traffic appropriately, using data plane learning;'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9160763025283813, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1675.3759765625)), (np.float64(567.5468749999999), np.float64(1849.3586197916663)), (np.float64(2607.129638671875), np.float64(1849.3586197916663)), (np.float64(2607.129638671875), np.float64(1675.3759765625))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 410, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'parent_id': '468b52259f82e09d5186ddc0e22b1a4f', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': 'ae7645a10c4c7968ab0fd9335820e0cf'}, page_content='• E-LAN—an E-LAN service consists of a number of endpoints. Each endpoint can communicate with all the other endpoints. The network learns customer MAC addresses to switch the traffic appropriately, using data plane learning.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9427189230918884, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(558.9931030273438), np.float64(1894.7823486328125)), (np.float64(558.9931030273438), np.float64(2192.0669531249996)), (np.float64(2624.19189453125), np.float64(2192.0669531249996)), (np.float64(2624.19189453125), np.float64(1894.7823486328125))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 410, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_