2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'a1ac9343f75f2aa5e7edf5178cfa2c24'}, page_content='NOTE: In order to speed up the debugging process (and avoid the need to manually filter through verbose log files as it is done today), the remote only stores key events on disk. The remote also takes great care to ensure that duplicate events are *not* reported, even across process restarts/reboots. For example, if the remote loses its connection to the ACU, a single event is reported (MODEM_ACU_DISCONNECTED). This event will not be reported again until the ACU connection is restored, even when the remote is rebooted or restarted. This way, the user is not bombarded or distracted with duplicate events, and space is not wasted saving old information on disk.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9209085702896118, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(564.8046264648438), np.float64(2290.667421875)), (np.float64(564.8046264648438), np.float64(2358.7351302083334)), (np.float64(1650.4705810546875), np.float64(2358.7351302083334)), (np.float64(1650.4705810546875), np.float64(2290.667421875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 450, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': 'f24af684796489605f7d59f8fc1516e2'}, page_content='Using Terminal Web UI Dashboard'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9211529493331909, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((n