 side of the diagram.\n\nThis diagram appears to represent a network topology with a focus on VLANs and SVN (Sub-Virtual Network) configurations, as indicated by the legend.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(816.6666666666666), np.float64(2114.583333333333)), (np.float64(816.6666666666666), np.float64(3193.7499999999995)), (np.float64(2377.083333333333), np.float64(3193.7499999999995)), (np.float64(2377.083333333333), np.float64(2114.583333333333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 90, 'image_path': '/Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-90-38.jpg', 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Image', 'element_id': 'd774400680572e51f62dabd26b9a5c07', 'source_image': '/Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-90-38.jpg'}, page_content='[IMAGE DESCRIPTION]\nSource File: /Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-90-38.jpg\nThe image is a network diagram illustrating a network topology with various components and their connections. Here is a detailed description:\n\n1. **Components:**\n   - **ASR 1K Access Router:** This is labeled at the bottom left of the diagram. It is connected to the "Line Cards" and the "SAS Switch" via a trunk connection.\n   - **Line Cards:** These are connected to the ASR 1K Access Router and the SAS Switch. They are labeled with the text "Trunk: Admin VLAN, Tunnel VLAN."\n   - **SAS Switch:** This is the central switch in the diagram. It is connected to the ASR 1K Access Router, the Hub Chassis, the PP Servers, and the NMS Servers. It has 