rds the RF Gateways, indicating that the satellite transmits data to the RF Gateways. The arrows from the RF Gateways point towards the satellite, indicating that the RF Gateways transmit data to the satellite.\n\nThe diagram is designed to show the flow of data between the satellite and the RF Gateways, highlighting the different components involved in the communication process.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(842.1874999999999), np.float64(1451.0416666666665)), (np.float64(842.1874999999999), np.float64(2048.958333333333)), (np.float64(2351.5625), np.float64(2048.958333333333)), (np.float64(2351.5625), np.float64(1451.0416666666665))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 95, 'image_path': '/Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-95-42.jpg', 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Image', 'element_id': '006bf99c17d1257380b3c1dc53629519', 'source_image': '/Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-95-42.jpg'}, page_content='[IMAGE DESCRIPTION]\nSource File: /Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-95-42.jpg\nThe image is a diagram illustrating a network architecture, specifically a Wide Area Network (WAN) setup. Here is a detailed description of the components and their labels:\n\n1. **Left Side (CDC Section):**\n   - **iGW/PPs:** This likely stands for Internet Gateway/Point-to-Point connections.\n   - **CDC Access Router(s):** These are routers that provide access to the CDC (Central Data Center) network.\n   - **PE Router(s):** These are Provider Edge router