ware for each carrier.\n\n6. **Text at the Bottom**:\n   - The text at the bottom of the image states: "Carriers will change their MODCOD if necessary (Inroute Group Compositions)."\n\nThis diagram seems to be used to illustrate the concept of multiple carriers in a communication system, their modulation types, data rates, and the signal-to-noise ratios required for each carrier.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(590.625), np.float64(2194.7916666666665)), (np.float64(590.625), np.float64(2369.7916666666665)), (np.float64(765.6249999999999), np.float64(2369.7916666666665)), (np.float64(765.6249999999999), np.float64(2194.7916666666665))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 140, 'image_path': '/Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-140-81.jpg', 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Image', 'element_id': 'a094884f3f97c12918d23681cf609006', 'source_image': '/Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-140-81.jpg'}, page_content='[IMAGE DESCRIPTION]\nSource File: /Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-140-81.jpg\nThe image appears to be a pixelated representation of a blue rectangular shape with a white interior. The edges of the rectangle are jagged, indicating that the image is low-resolution or has been pixelated. There is no text, numbers, charts, or diagrams visible within the rectangle. The overall appearance suggests that this might be a simplified or abstract representation of a shape, possibly a gift box or a similar object, given the shape and the way it