 Power Too High." The chart is a horizontal bar with a color-coded scale ranging from 6 to 14, representing the C/N (Carrier-to-Noise ratio) in dB. The scale is divided into three sections:\n\n1. **Red Section**: This section represents the range from 6 to 8 dB. It is labeled as "Skewed Detection Range" and is highlighted in red, indicating a high risk or a critical condition.\n\n2. **Yellow Section**: This section represents the range from 8 to 12 dB. It is also part of the "Skewed Detection Range" and is highlighted in yellow, indicating a moderate risk.\n\n3. **Green Section**: This section represents the range from 12 to 14 dB. It is part of the "Skewed Detection Range" and is highlighted in green, indicating a low risk.\n\n4. **Threshold C/N**: There is a blue arrow pointing to the 8 dB mark, which is labeled as "Threshold C/N." This indicates the threshold at which the condition "TX Initial Power Too High" is detected.\n\nThe chart visually represents the detection range for the condition, with the threshold clearly marked and the risk levels indicated by the color coding.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(736.4583333333333), np.float64(1695.3124999999998)), (np.float64(736.4583333333333), np.float64(2107.2916666666665)), (np.float64(2453.645833333333), np.float64(2107.2916666666665)), (np.float64(2453.645833333333), np.float64(1695.3124999999998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 149, 'image_path': '/Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-149-88.jpg', 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Image', 'element_id': '932678028287d31b0ec9