or acting as Service Provider"\n- **Middle Box**: "Service Provider(s)"\n- **Arrows**: Pointing downward from "Satellite Operator acting as Service Provider" to "Service Provider(s)".\n- **Subsequent Boxes**: "Service Provider(s)" with arrows pointing downward to "Subscriber(s)".\n- **Subscriber(s)**: Represented by multiple boxes labeled "Subscriber(s)" at the bottom.\n\n### Key Observations:\n- Both diagrams show a hierarchical structure where the "Satellite Operator" is at the top.\n- In diagram (a), the "Service Provider(s)" are separate entities from the "Satellite Operator," and they provide services to the "Subscriber(s)".\n- In diagram (b), the "Satellite Operator" acts as a "Service Provider," directly providing services to the "Subscriber(s)".\n- The structure in both diagrams is similar, with the "Subscriber(s)" at the bottom, indicating the end-users of the service.\n\nThis image is likely used to illustrate different models or configurations of satellite communication systems, highlighting the role of the satellite operator and service providers in delivering services to subscribers.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(597.9166666666666), np.float64(1749.9999999999998)), (np.float64(597.9166666666666), np.float64(1924.9999999999998)), (np.float64(772.9166666666666), np.float64(1924.9999999999998)), (np.float64(772.9166666666666), np.float64(1749.9999999999998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 157, 'image_path': '/Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-157-93.jpg', 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Image', 'element_id': 'bf