p of the hierarchy, indicating they are the end-users or the applications running on the system.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(696.3541666666666), np.float64(1633.3333333333333)), (np.float64(696.3541666666666), np.float64(2770.833333333333)), (np.float64(2493.75), np.float64(2770.833333333333)), (np.float64(2493.75), np.float64(1633.3333333333333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 263, 'image_path': '/Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-263-184.jpg', 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Image', 'element_id': 'd6a3e19a4de55170aa39120509596a19', 'source_image': '/Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-263-184.jpg'}, page_content='[IMAGE DESCRIPTION]\nSource File: /Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-263-184.jpg\nThe image is a detailed diagram of a Network Management System (NMS) infrastructure, specifically for SAS NMS (System Administration System Network Management System). The diagram is divided into several sections, with various components and their interconnections highlighted.\n\n### Top Section:\n- **Title**: "SAS NMS"\n- **Header**: "NMS Infrastructure – Linux HA" (indicating a high availability Linux-based infrastructure for the NMS).\n\n### Middle Section:\nThis section contains the main components of the NMS and their interconnections:\n- **Discrete Data Engine**: Communicates with the Thresholding Engine and Stats Manager (real-time).\n- **Thresholding Engine**: Communicates with the Discrete Data Engine and Stats Manager (real-time).\n- **Stats Manager (real-time)**: Communicates with the Discrete Data Engine, Thresholding Engine, Latency Measurement Manager, and RT Command.\n- **Latency Measurement Manager**: Communicates with the Stats Manager (real-time) and RT Command.\n- **RT Command**: Communicates with the Latency Measurement Manager, Configuration Manager, and Authentication Manager.\n- **Configuration Manager**: Communicates with the RT Command, Update Manager, and CA Foundry.\n- **Update Manager**: Communicates with the Configuration Manager and CA Foundry.\n- **CA Foundry**: Communicates with the Configuration Manager and Authentication Manager.\n- **Authentication Manager**: Communicates with the Configuration Manager and RT Command.\n\n### Bottom Section:\n- **Web Core**: This is the core of the web-based interface for the NMS.\n- **SAS User**: This represents the user interface for the SAS NMS, which interacts with the Web Core.\n\n### Connections:\n- Red arrows indicate the flow of data or commands between the components.\n- The diagram shows a clear flow from the user interface (SAS User) to the Web Core, which then interacts with various management and data processing components.\n\n### Overall:\nThe diagram illustrates the architecture of the SAS NMS, showing how different components interact to manage and process data in a high-availability Linux environment. The components are designed to handle real-time data, latency measurements, configuration management, and authentication, all integrated into a web-based interface for user interaction.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(743.7499999999999), np.float64(430.2083333333333)), (np.float64(743.7499999999999), np.float64(1392.7083333333333)), (np.float64(2446.3541666666665), np.float64(1392.7083333333333)), (np.float64(2446.3541666666665), np.float64(430.2083333333333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 268, 'image_path': '/Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-268-185.jpg', 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Image', 'element_id': '2d4a9d730be7a97a03aad587e513b34a', 'source_image': '/Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-268-185.jpg'}, page_content='[IMAGE DESCRIPTION]\nSource File: /Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-268-185.jpg\nThe image is a diagram illustrating the architecture of a Network Operations Center (NOC) Network Management System (NMS) infrastructure, specifically for iDirect HA. The diagram is divided into several sections, with various components and their interconnections.\n\n### Top Section:\n- **NOC User**: This is the user interface for the NOC NMS.\n- **NMS Infrastructure – iDirect HA**: This indicates the specific infrastructure being used, which is iDirect HA.\n\n### Main Section:\n- **Web Core**: This is the central component of the NMS, serving as the core web-based interface for the NOC user.\n- **RT Command**: Represents real-time commands.\n- **Discrete Data Engine**: Manages discrete data.\n- **Thresholding Engine**: Manages thresholding of data.\n- **Stats Manager (Historical)**: Manages historical statistics.\n- **Stats Manager (Real Time)**: Manages real-time statistics.\n- **Configuration Manager**: Manages configuration settings.\n- **Update Manager**: Manages updates.\n- **CA Foundry**: Manages certificate authority foundry.\n- **Authentication Manager**: Manages authentication.\n\n### Interconnections:\n- Arrows indicate the flow of data and commands between the various components. For example:\n  - The RT Command interacts with the Discrete Data Engine.\n  - The Discrete Data Engine interacts with the Thresholding Engine.\n  - The Thresholding Engine interacts with the Stats Manager (Real Time).\n  - The Stats Manager (Real Time) interacts with the Stats Manager (Historical).\n  - The Stats Manager (Historical) interacts with the Configuration Manager.\n  - The Configuration Manager interacts with the Update Manager.\n  - The Update Manager interacts with the CA Foundry.\n  - The CA Foundry interacts with the Authentication Manager.\n  - The Authentication Manager interacts with the Configuration Manager.\n\n### Bottom Section:\n- **To: SAS NMS**: This indicates the direction of data flow to the SAS NMS.\n\n### Overall:\nThe diagram provides a clear view of the hierarchical and interconnected components of the NOC NMS, highlighting the flow of data and commands between these components. It is designed to show how the system manages real-time commands, discrete data, thresholds, statistics, configurations, updates, and authentication, all within the context of the iDirect HA infrastructure.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(590.625), np.float64(1939.5833333333333)), (np.float64(590.625), np.float64(2114.583333333333)), (np.float64(765.6249999999999), np.float64(2114.583333333333)), (np.float64(765.6249999999999), np.float64(1939.5833333333333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 270, 'image_path': '/Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-270-186.jpg', 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Image', 'element_id': '54a577bc218d55582d217776e3f4de25', 'source_image':