ects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-295-201.jpg\nThe image is a flowchart illustrating a process involving various components and steps. Here is a detailed description:\n\n1. **Step 1: Channel/Beam Map**\n   - This step is represented by a green box labeled "Channel/Beam Map."\n\n2. **Step 2: Terminal**\n   - The flowchart shows an arrow pointing from "Channel/Beam Map" to "Terminal," indicating the next step in the process.\n\n3. **Step 3: Selects iNet**\n   - The flowchart shows an arrow from "Terminal" to "iNet," with the text "Step 3 Selects iNet."\n\n4. **Step 4: Randomly Picks ACQ_ID**\n   - The flowchart shows an arrow from "Terminal" to "ACQ_ID," with the text "Step 4 Randomly Picks ACQ_ID."\n\n5. **Step 5: Send Superburst(ACQ_ID) on iNet**\n   - The flowchart shows an arrow from "Terminal" to "iNet," with the text "Step 5 Send Superburst(ACQ_ID) on iNet."\n\n6. **Step 6: Rx Line Card**\n   - The flowchart shows an arrow from "iNet" to "Rx Line Card," with the text "Step 6."\n\n7. **Step 7: Superburst (ACQ_ID)**\n   - The flowchart shows an arrow from "Rx Line Card" to "TDMA Aggregator," with the text "Step 7 Superburst (ACQ_ID)."\n\n8. **Step 8: Creates Temporary**\n   - The flowchart shows a dashed arrow from "TDMA Aggregator" to "Acquisition Process," with the text "Step 8 Creates Temporary."\n\n9. **Step 9: Update Msg HDLC Addr**\n   - The flowchart shows an arrow from "Acquisition Process" to "Acquisition Process," with the text "Step 9 Update Msg HDLC Addr."\n\nThe flowchart includes several components:\n- **Acquisition Signaling Carrier**: Represented by a green circle.\n- **Tx Line Card**: Represented by a green circle.\n- **Rx Line Card**: Represented by a green circle.\n- **TDMA Aggregator**: Represented by a green circle.\n- **Acquisition Process**: Represented by a green circle with a black outline.\n\nThe flowchart is structured to show the sequence of steps involved in the process, with arrows indicating the direction of the flow and text labels describing each step.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(627.0833333333333), np.float64(430.2083333333333)), (np.float64(627.0833333333333), np.float64(1319.7916666666665)), (np.float64(2566.6666666666665), np.float64(1319.7916666666665)), (np.float64(2566.6666666666665), np.float64(430.2083333333333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 297, 'image_path': '/Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-297-202.jpg', 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Image', 'element_id': '2eab139342b33708a359a54a56ce3f49', 'source_image': '/Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-297-202.jpg'}, page_content='[IMAGE DESCRIPTION]\nSource File: /Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-297-202.jpg\nThe image is a flowchart illustrating a process involving several components and steps. Here is a detailed description:\n\n1. **Components:**\n   - **SAS BW MGR (SAS Business Warehouse Manager):** This is a blue circle labeled at the top.\n   - **NMS Configuration Manager:** This is a gray circle labeled at the bottom left.\n   - **Satellite Terminal Proxy:** This is a green circle labeled at the bottom center.\n   - **Geo-location Server:** This is another green circle labeled at the bottom right.\n   - **Terminal:** This is a rectangular box labeled at the top right.\n\n2. **Steps:**\n   - **Step 1-3:** Arrows point from the "NMS Configuration Manager" to the "Satellite Terminal Proxy."\n   - **Step 4:** Arrows point from the "Satellite Terminal Proxy" to the "Geo-location Server."\n   - **Step 5:** Arrows point from the "Satellite Terminal Proxy" to the "SAS BW MGR."\n\n3. **Text:**\n   - At the top right, there is a note stating: "Forced logout msg sent if necessary."\n   - At the bottom left, the "NMS Configuration Manager" is labeled.\n   - At the bottom center, the "Satellite Terminal Proxy" is labeled.\n   - At the bottom right, the "Geo-location Server" is labeled.\n   - At the top right, the "Terminal" is labeled.\n\n4. **Arrows:**\n   - Arrows indicate the direction of data flow or process steps. For example, Step 1-3 shows the flow from the "NMS Configuration Manager" to the "Satellite Terminal Proxy."\n\nThis flowchart appears to depict a process where the "NMS Configuration Manager" interacts with the "Satellite Terminal Proxy," which then communicates with the "Geo-location Server" and the "SAS BW MGR." The "Terminal" is mentioned in the context of a forced logout message being sent if necessary.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(590.625), np.float64(1607.8124999999998)), (np.float64(590.625), np.float64(1782.8124999999998)), (np.float64(765.6249999999999), np.float64(1782.8124999999998)), (np.float64(765.6249999999999), np.float64(1607.8124999999998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 298, 'image_path': '/Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-298-203.jpg', 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Image', 'element_id': 'b5d782ffc2528950585f968a6f861d97', 'source_image': '/Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-298-203.jpg'}, page_cont