s and transmit them to the satellite via the green arrows.\n- **Satellite to Terrestrial Network**: The satellite receives the modulated signals and transmits them back to the terrestrial network.\n\n### Key Legend:\n- **Plain IP**: Represented by the purple arrow, indicating the plain IP data flow.\n- **Tunnel**: Represented by the red arrow, indicating the tunnel data flow.\n- **Modulated Signals**: Represented by the green arrows, indicating the modulated signals being transmitted to and from the satellite.\n- **iNet1, iNet2, iNet3**: Represented by the yellow, blue, and white areas, indicating different network segments or channels.\n\n### Diagram Layout:\n- The left side of the diagram focuses on the terrestrial data network and the server.\n- The central part of the diagram shows the teleport with its various components and signal flow.\n- The right side of the diagram shows the satellite and'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(430.2083333333333)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1749.9999999999998)), (np.float64(2625.0), np.float64(1749.9999999999998)), (np.float64(2625.0), np.float64(430.2083333333333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 312, 'image_path': '/Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-312-216.jpg', 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Image', 'element_id': '456c2f7c42f1fb6e3f2944e04ba3c63c', 'source_image': '/Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-312-216.jpg'}, page_content='[IMAGE DESCRIPTION]\nSource File: /Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_ow