he teleport via the terrestrial data network.\n- **Through the Upstream Router**: The data is routed through the upstream router.\n- **To the Switch**: The data is then directed to the switch.\n- **To the PP Units**: The data is further processed at the PP units.\n- **To the Satellite Dishes**: The data is modulated and transmitted via the satellite dishes.\n- **To the Satellite**: The modulated signals are sent to the satellite.\n- **From the Satellite**: The satellite receives the signals and transmits them back to the teleport.\n- **To the Chassis**: The signals are received by the RCM modules in the chassis.\n- **To the Satellite Dishes**: The signals are then transmitted back to the satellite dishes.\n- **To the Satellite**: The signals are sent back to the satellite.\n- **To the Terrestrial Data Network**: The satellite transmits the signals back to the terrestrial data network, completing the cycle.\n\n### Key:\n- **Purple**:'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(568.75), np.float64(1163.0208333333333)), (np.float64(568.75), np.float64(2511.9791666666665)), (np.float64(2625.0), np.float64(2511.9791666666665)), (np.float64(2625.0), np.float64(1163.0208333333333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 315, 'image_path': '/Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-315-217.jpg', 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Image', 'element_id': '30f38ed619528b6cf71e22a5602c65c6', 'source_image': '/Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-315-217.jpg'}, page_content='[IMAGE DESCRIPTION]\nSource File: /Users/pratho