 \\), which seem to represent the difference between the skew angles \\( S_1 \\) and \\( S_L \\), and \\( S_L \\) and \\( S_2 \\), respectively.\n   - There is a label \\( \\Delta_{PSD} \\) pointing to the difference in PSD variation between the points \\( P_0 \\) and \\( P_V \\).\n\nThis graph seems to be used to analyze the behavior of PSD variation with respect to skew angle, possibly in a context related to signal processing or antenna design.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(590.625), np.float64(437.49999999999994)), (np.float64(590.625), np.float64(612.5)), (np.float64(765.6249999999999), np.float64(612.5)), (np.float64(765.6249999999999), np.float64(437.49999999999994))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 352, 'image_path': '/Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-352-251.jpg', 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Image', 'element_id': '1a781c3bc85bea6568e9f6eb92f69a1a', 'source_image': '/Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-352-251.jpg'}, page_content='[IMAGE DESCRIPTION]\nSource File: /Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-352-251.jpg\nThe image appears to be a pixelated representation of a blue gift box with a white interior. The box is open, and there is a blue ribbon tied around it, with a small blue bow on top. The ribbon and bow are also pixelated, maintaining the same blue color scheme as the box. There is no text, numbers, charts, or diagrams visible in the image. The overall design is simple and minimalistic, with a focus on the blue