ing used.\n  - **May 1 to June 1**: The allowance is consumed, and the top-up continues to be used.\n\n### Key Points:\n- The chart shows how the allowance and top-up are consumed over the months.\n- The top-up is used to extend the allowance beyond the initial 100 GB.\n- The overage limit is 50 GB, which is not exceeded in this scenario.\n\nThis flowchart is used to illustrate the management of data allowance and top-up usage over a period, ensuring that the user's data consumption is within the allowed limits and that any additional data usage is managed through top-ups."), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(612.5), np.float64(2027.0833333333333)), (np.float64(612.5), np.float64(3273.958333333333)), (np.float64(2581.25), np.float64(3273.958333333333)), (np.float64(2581.25), np.float64(2027.0833333333333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 363, 'image_path': '/Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-363-257.jpg', 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Image', 'element_id': '6cf930d050d2116e3b90eda1b7a38276', 'source_image': '/Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-363-257.jpg'}, page_content='[IMAGE DESCRIPTION]\nSource File: /Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-363-257.jpg\nThe image is a detailed flowchart or timeline diagram illustrating the usage and management of data allowances over a period of three weeks. Here\'s a breakdown of the elements present in the image:\n\n### **General Layout:**\n- The diagram is divided into three main sections representing Week 1, Week 2, and Week 3.\n- There are multiple data points and events marked along the timeline, with annotations and arrows indicating the progression and changes in data usage.\n\n### **Key Elements:**\n\n#### **Left Side: Data Input and Allowance**\n- At the top left, there are three data inputs labeled as:\n  - 100 GB\n  - 50 GB\n  - 0 GB\n- These inputs are connected to the timeline, indicating the initial allowances or data credits.\n\n#### **Timeline:**\n- The timeline is divided into daily intervals, with each interval representing 10 GB of data usage.\n- The timeline is color-coded:\n  - Light green represents the allowance period.\n  - Light blue represents the top-up period.\n  - Dark blue represents the restoration period.\n\n#### **Allowance Period:**\n- The timeline starts with an initial allowance of 50 GB, which is marked as "Start of Allowance Period."\n- The allowance is updated daily, with an additional 10 GB added each day, as indicated by the arrows labeled "+10 GB."\n\n#### **Top-Up Period:**\n- After the allowance is consumed, the top-up period begins.\n- The top-up amount is 30 GB, as indicated by the label "30 GB Top-Up Remaining."\n- The top-up is replenished daily, with an additional 10 GB added each day.\n\n#### **Restoration Period:**\n- The restoration period is triggered after 40 GB of data has been used, which is marked as "40Gb restoration period."\n- The restoration period is indicated by the label "40Gb restoration period" and is shown as a step-up in the timeline.\n\n#### **Events:**\n- The timeline includes several events with corresponding codes and descriptions:\n  1. EAI-EVT-723 GSP_FAP_PERIOD_END\n  2. EAI-EVT-720 GSP_FAP_CREDIT\n  3. EAI-EVT-694 GSP_FAP_START_TOP_UP\n  4. EAI-EVT-xxx GSP_RESTORATION_END\n  5. EAI-EVT-723 GSP_FAP_PERIOD_END\n  6. EAI-EVT-720 GSP_FAP_CREDIT\n\n#### **Configuration:**\n- The configuration details are provided on the right side of the image:\n  - Allowance = Weekly\n  - Allowance Amount 