AS LAN" is connected to an "OTA Satellite Network" (On-Track Antenna Satellite Network) via a "PP" (Point-to-Point) connection.\n   - **Right Side**:\n     - The "OTA Satellite Network" is connected to a "Terminal" via a "PP" connection.\n     - The "Terminal" is connected to a "Terminal LAN" (Terminal Local Area Network) via an "Ethernet" connection.\n     - The "Terminal LAN" is connected to a "Subnet" (a smaller network segment) via an "Ethernet" connection.\n\n4. **Additional Labels**:\n   - The "OTA Satellite Network" is labeled with "PP," indicating a Point-to-Point connection.\n   - The "Terminal" is labeled with "Terminal," indicating the end point of the satellite network.\n   - The "Subnet" is labeled with "Subnet," indicating a smaller network segment within the Terminal LAN.\n\nThis diagram effectively illustrates the hierarchical and interconnected nature of a satellite-based virtual network, showing how various network segments and protocols are interconnected to form a cohesive network architecture.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(594.2708333333333), np.float64(430.2083333333333)), (np.float64(594.2708333333333), np.float64(834.8958333333333)), (np.float64(2595.833333333333), np.float64(834.8958333333333)), (np.float64(2595.833333333333), np.float64(430.2083333333333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T13:52:40', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 403, 'image_path': '/Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a_boat_over_own_doc/src/q&a_boat/figures/figure-403-292.jpg', 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_2390dad9058e9d21ffdcdecf211d325c.pdf', 'category': 'Image', 'element_id': '3e54262bfc9d7d6f530e7cb92f3dedf2', 'source_image': '/Users/prathod/Projects/Rag_based_q-a